asr-000164
00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the Department of Interior and Local Government,

asr-000165
00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:33.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We reaffirm our fundamental commitments

asr-000166
00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:35.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to empower local governments,

asr-000167
00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: keep communities safe,

asr-000168
00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: provide efficient emergency response,

asr-000169
00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and ensure that every peso entrusted to the government

asr-000170
00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: translates into meaningful public service.

asr-000171
00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Within this budget proposal lies a clear roadmap

asr-000172
00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:51.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the Department's priority programs and projects.

asr-000173
00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:52.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: To support this proposal,

asr-000174
00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:54.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will present the Department's major accomplishments

asr-000175
00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:59.680
