asr-000182
00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the DILG and its attached agencies.

asr-000183
00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:15.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Makakaasa po kayo

asr-000184
00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: na kami ay patuloy na magiging katuwang

asr-000185
00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: ng lahat ng sangay ng pamahalaan,

asr-000186
00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:23.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: hindi lamang ng Pangulo at ng Ehekutibo,

asr-000187
00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: hindi pati ang Lehislatura at Hudikatura.

asr-000188
00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:30.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sa pagsusulong ng tapat at mahusay na pamamahala,

asr-000189
00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:34.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: sa pagpapanatiling ligtas at mapayapang pamayanan,

asr-000190
00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: at sa paghatid ng serbisyong publiko,

asr-000191
00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: tunay na mararamdaman,

asr-000192
00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:41.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: napapakinabangan ng bawat Pilipino.

asr-000193
00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: With the permission of the Chair,

asr-000194
00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: may we now present the Department's

asr-000195
00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:47.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Fiscal Year 27 Budget Proposal.

asr-000196
00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.820
DILG Video Narrator: The Department of the Interior

asr-000197
00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:05.940
DILG Video Narrator: and Local Government is at the forefront of advancing peace and order, public

asr-000198
00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:13.640
DILG Video Narrator: safety and responsive local governance across the country. Together with its attached agencies,

asr-000199
00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:20.220
DILG Video Narrator: the Department works to strengthen local government units, enhance public safety and

asr-000200
00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:27.760
DILG Video Narrator: emergency response and promote inclusive programs that uplift the lives and welfare of Filipinos.

asr-000201
00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:35.520
DILG Video Narrator: With the support, resources and confidence entrusted to us by Congress, the Department

asr-000202
00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:42.120
DILG Video Narrator: has continued to fulfill its mandate and deliver programs aligned with the President's priorities

asr-000203
00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:49.660
DILG Video Narrator: for the country. Safeguarding our collective peace and prosperity, and ensuring our people

asr-000204
00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:57.440
DILG Video Narrator: safe and secure, remained among our foremost priorities. We continue to strengthen the unified

asr-000205
00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.880
DILG Video Narrator: 911 system

asr-000206
00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:04.900
DILG Video Narrator: through acquiring additional assets and expanding access to emergency services,

asr-000207
00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:12.640
DILG Video Narrator: which led to more calls, fewer prank calls, and an improved emergency response time.

asr-000208
00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:21.700
DILG Video Narrator: The aggressive anti-criminality campaign by the PNP led to reduced crimes throughout the country

asr-000209
00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:28.820
DILG Video Narrator: while the NAPOLCOM fulfilled its commitment of zero backlog in cases involving police officers

asr-000210
00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:36.640
DILG Video Narrator: that helped restore accountability, integrity and public trust. Our unrelenting drive

asr-000211
00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:44.280
DILG Video Narrator: against illegal drugs led to billions worth of drugs seized, thousands arrested, and more

asr-000212
00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:52.220
DILG Video Narrator: barangays nationwide cleared of drug-related threats. This we did, even as we completed

asr-000213
00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:59.060
DILG Video Narrator: development projects in conflict-affected areas and gave former rebels more opportunities to

asr-000214
00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:08.200
DILG Video Narrator: begin anew. Through the BJMP, we significantly reduced jail congestion as well as provided

asr-000215
00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:14.520
DILG Video Narrator: holistic rehabilitation and reintegration services for persons deprived of liberty.

asr-000216
00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:22.740
DILG Video Narrator: We instituted sweeping reforms within the BFP to strengthen transparency, integrity

asr-000217
00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:29.220
DILG Video Narrator: and accountability, which contributed to more effective and efficient fire prevention and

asr-000218
00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:35.080
DILG Video Narrator: suppression services, thereby reducing fire incidents and saving more lives.

asr-000219
00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:43.620
DILG Video Narrator: The Department continues to empower and transform our local government units as capable and agile

asr-000220
00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:50.360
DILG Video Narrator: partners for national development. Our rigorous monitoring of national and local government

asr-000221
00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:57.460
DILG Video Narrator: funded projects ensured the completion of thousands of projects such as farm-to-market roads,

asr-000222
00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:05.500
DILG Video Narrator: evacuation centers, rice subsidies, water and sanitation systems, and other community facilities

asr-000223
00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:13.180
DILG Video Narrator: that benefited millions of Filipino families, especially in underserved and disadvantaged areas.

asr-000224
00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:21.000
DILG Video Narrator: We nurtured our newly elected local officials as well as our barangay and Sangguniang Kabataan

asr-000225
00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:27.200
DILG Video Narrator: officials through various capacity-building interventions. We accelerated the

asr-000226
00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:33.700
DILG Video Narrator: digitalization and automation of LGU services that led to faster and more efficient governance,

asr-000227
00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:40.740
DILG Video Narrator: which is essential in attracting businesses and investments and boosting economic development among

asr-000228
00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:49.580
DILG Video Narrator: LGUs. The Department likewise played a pivotal role in making our LGUs adequately prepared,

asr-000229
00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:56.600
DILG Video Narrator: which cushioned the impact of typhoons and other calamities that hit the various parts of the country.

asr-000230
00:18:56.600 --> 00:19:02.280
DILG Video Narrator: These include the constant monitoring of evacuation centers in LGUs,

asr-000231
00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:08.020
DILG Video Narrator: as well as the timely and strategic deployment of first responders in affected areas

asr-000232
00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:12.440
DILG Video Narrator: to provide immediate assistance during and after disasters.

asr-000233
00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:21.300
DILG Video Narrator: We also monitor the completion of rehabilitated and constructed facilities and maintain the

asr-000234
00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:27.000
DILG Video Narrator: cleanliness of barangays and communities to help prevent further risks to public health.

asr-000235
00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:38.520
DILG Video Narrator: Uplifting the lives and welfare of every Filipino has been the driving force behind our sectoral interventions.

asr-000236
00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:50.660
DILG Video Narrator: We advanced the institutionalization of early childhood care and development while investing in the capacity and potential of the next generation of Filipinos.

asr-000237
00:19:51.780 --> 00:20:00.900
DILG Video Narrator: We also continued to address the needs of our Muslim brethren while strengthening our efforts in advancing gender equality in the country

asr-000238
00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:07.780
DILG Video Narrator: that are at par with or even better than those of other countries in Asia and across the globe.

asr-000239
00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:16.360
DILG Video Narrator: These and much more have been made possible as reflected in our strong financial performance in 2025

asr-000240
00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:20.300
DILG Video Narrator: with a 96% obligation rate.

asr-000241
00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:23.600
DILG Video Narrator: And a 95% disbursement rate.

asr-000242
00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:31.120
DILG Video Narrator: Similarly, we remain on track to achieve our financial targets for the year

asr-000243
00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:39.260
DILG Video Narrator: with a 55% obligation rate and a nearly 97% disbursement rate as of mid-year.

asr-000244
00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:48.740
DILG Video Narrator: Our proposal for the next fiscal year reflects our commitment to sustaining our ongoing initiatives

asr-000245
00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:53.180
DILG Video Narrator: and advancing our goals, amounting to a total of

asr-000246
00:20:53.180 --> 00:21:01.000
DILG Video Narrator: P332.5 billion, a 7% increase from last year's appropriation.

asr-000247
00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:11.100
DILG Video Narrator: Of this amount, Bureau of Jail Management and Penology, Bureau of Fire Protection, Philippine National Police,

asr-000248
00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:17.740
DILG Video Narrator: and the Office of the Secretary have registered increases in their respective appropriations.

asr-000249
00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:23.560
DILG Video Narrator: While the Early Childhood Care and Development Council, Philippine Commission on Women,

asr-000250
00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:30.660
DILG Video Narrator: National Commission on Muslim Filipinos, National Youth Commission, and National Police Commission

asr-000251
00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:35.340
DILG Video Narrator: have experienced decreases compared with their previous appropriations.

asr-000252
00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:44.120
DILG Video Narrator: Consistent with the previous years, the majority of our proposed budget, equivalent to 84%,

asr-000253
00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:52.660
DILG Video Narrator: is allocated to personal services, while 13% is earmarked for maintenance and other operating expenses

asr-000254
00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:56.120
DILG Video Narrator: and 3% for capital outlay.

asr-000255
00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:02.480
DILG Video Narrator: The proposed budget is broken down by expense class per agency.

asr-000256
00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:14.880
DILG Video Narrator: With your help, we will be able to build on these gains through the proposals each agency has put forward for your consideration.

asr-000257
00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:23.460
DILG Video Narrator: The Office of the Secretary will continue to uplift local governance in every community

asr-000258
00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:27.460
DILG Video Narrator: through the implementation of various programs and projects

asr-000259
00:22:27.460 --> 00:22:29.860
DILG Video Narrator: that strengthen LGU capacity.

asr-000262
00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:33.360
DILG Video Narrator: hasten implementation of development programs,

asr-000263
00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:39.160
DILG Video Narrator: advance digitalization, good governance, and citizen participation.

asr-000264
00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:46.560
DILG Video Narrator: We will remain unwavering in improving our emergency response system

asr-000265
00:22:46.560 --> 00:22:49.440
DILG Video Narrator: to make it more efficient and accessible,

asr-000266
00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:53.380
DILG Video Narrator: while strengthening the fight against illegal drugs

asr-000267
00:22:53.380 --> 00:22:56.680
DILG Video Narrator: and advancing peace and order in the communities.

asr-000268
00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:04.100
DILG Video Narrator: Our drive continues to focus on the rehabilitation and cleanup of Manila Bay,

asr-000270
00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:07.140
DILG Video Narrator: strengthening disaster response and preparedness,

asr-000271
00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:10.720
DILG Video Narrator: enhancing the Department's ICT capabilities,

asr-000272
00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:16.540
DILG Video Narrator: and fully operationalizing our new central office and regional offices.

asr-000273
00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:26.000
DILG Video Narrator: The LGA will continue to strengthen LGUs and the DILG personnel

asr-000274
00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:29.220
DILG Video Narrator: through training newly elected barangay officials,

asr-000276
00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:36.280
DILG Video Narrator: advancing disaster readiness, innovation, creative industries, and security,

asr-000277
00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:40.760
DILG Video Narrator: and strengthening their capacity to deliver these interventions.

asr-000278
00:23:43.260 --> 00:23:47.400
DILG Video Narrator: To uphold integrity and trust in our police force,

asr-000279
00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:54.620
DILG Video Narrator: the NAPOLCOM will prioritize investments in critical facilities in Regions 3, 5,

asr-000280
00:23:54.880 --> 00:24:04.160
DILG Video Narrator: and Cordillera Administrative Region, ICT projects, ISO certification, and equipment for Negros Island Region.

asr-000281
00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:15.300
DILG Video Narrator: The Philippine National Police will strengthen its ranks to become a reliable and trustworthy partner in law enforcement

asr-000282
00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:21.360
DILG Video Narrator: through the recruitment of new personnel, enhanced equipment and ICT capabilities,

asr-000283
00:24:21.820 --> 00:24:25.520
DILG Video Narrator: and stronger support for the welfare of its personnel.

asr-000284
00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:30.200
DILG Video Narrator: This will also include

asr-000285
00:24:30.200 --> 00:24:33.900
DILG Video Narrator: fulfilling commitments under the Program Convergence Initiatives,

asr-000286
00:24:34.160 --> 00:24:38.620
DILG Video Narrator: intensifying police operations, and constructing new facilities.

asr-000287
00:24:40.820 --> 00:24:49.960
DILG Video Narrator: The Bureau of Fire Protection will likewise accelerate efforts in fire prevention, suppression, and emergency response

asr-000288
00:24:49.960 --> 00:24:56.020
DILG Video Narrator: through hiring new fire officers, operationalizing newly completed fire stations,

asr-000289
00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:59.820
DILG Video Narrator: deploying new fire trucks, procuring equipment,

asr-000290
00:25:00.240 --> 00:25:05.680
DILG Video Narrator: and constructing new fire stations, training centers, and a fire arson laboratory.

asr-000291
00:25:09.380 --> 00:25:13.800
DILG Video Narrator: To safeguard and rehabilitate persons deprived of liberty,

asr-000292
00:25:14.240 --> 00:25:21.420
DILG Video Narrator: the Bureau of Jail Management and Penology will bring in recruits to reinforce operational capability

asr-000293
00:25:21.420 --> 00:25:24.800
DILG Video Narrator: and ensure hygiene and medical support.

asr-000294
00:25:24.800 --> 00:25:29.460
DILG Video Narrator: It will also counter illegal drugs in our jails,

asr-000295
00:25:29.620 --> 00:25:33.520
DILG Video Narrator: procure new firearms, radios, and vans,

asr-000296
00:25:33.520 --> 00:25:37.020
DILG Video Narrator: and construct new jail facilities in Calabarzon.

asr-000297
00:25:40.220 --> 00:25:44.580
DILG Video Narrator: Molding the minds of our future public order and safety leaders,

asr-000298
00:25:44.940 --> 00:25:50.260
DILG Video Narrator: the Philippine Public Safety College shall continue its education and training programs,

asr-000299
00:25:50.700 --> 00:25:52.840
DILG Video Narrator: research and curriculum development,

asr-000300
00:25:53.280 --> 00:26:00.040
DILG Video Narrator: while undertaking the construction of facilities and procurement of PPEs and ICT equipment.

asr-000301
00:26:02.600 --> 00:26:08.960
DILG Video Narrator: The National Youth Commission shall lead the charge in empowering the Filipino leaders of tomorrow

asr-000306
00:26:08.960 --> 00:26:13.600
DILG Video Narrator: through mandatory and continuing training for Sangguniang Kabataan,

asr-000307
00:26:14.240 --> 00:26:17.360
DILG Video Narrator: participation in youth-oriented programs and activities,

asr-000308
00:26:17.820 --> 00:26:21.600
DILG Video Narrator: and support for anti-bullying and youth health initiatives.

asr-000309
00:26:23.440 --> 00:26:26.940
DILG Video Narrator: The National Commission on Muslim Filipinos.

asr-000310
00:26:26.940 --> 00:26:35.740
DILG Video Narrator: This includes moonsighting activities for Eid al-Adha and Eid al-Fitr, the administration and supervision of Hajj operations,

asr-000311
00:26:36.260 --> 00:26:44.920
DILG Video Narrator: strengthening Madaris and Islamic studies, supporting Muslim MSMEs, providing legal and paralegal assistance,

asr-000312
00:26:45.480 --> 00:26:50.120
DILG Video Narrator: and promoting peace-building and dialogue in Muslim Filipino communities.

asr-000313
00:26:52.200 --> 00:26:58.680
DILG Video Narrator: Championing the causes of women and girls, the Philippine Commission on Women will expand

asr-000314
00:26:58.680 --> 00:27:03.880
DILG Video Narrator: its reach in the Visayas while sustaining its initiatives on gender and development.

asr-000315
00:27:05.480 --> 00:27:06.320
DILG Video Narrator: Lastly,

asr-000316
00:27:06.520 --> 00:27:12.820
DILG Video Narrator: The Early Childhood Care and Development Council will intensify its efforts to give

asr-000317
00:27:12.820 --> 00:27:20.240
DILG Video Narrator: every child a stronger start by capacitating intermediaries and partners, ensuring accreditation

asr-000318
00:27:20.240 --> 00:27:25.320
DILG Video Narrator: of ECCD service providers, and monitoring child development centers.

asr-000319
00:27:27.220 --> 00:27:35.840
DILG Video Narrator: We will continue to stand firm and unwavering in serving the interests of the Filipino people

asr-000320
00:27:35.840 --> 00:27:39.320
DILG Video Narrator: and in carrying forward our commitment to

asr-000321
00:27:39.320 --> 00:27:44.260
DILG Video Narrator: building a nation that embodies the ideals of a Bagong Pilipinas.

asr-000322
00:27:44.940 --> 00:27:47.440
DILG Video Narrator: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000323
00:27:53.500 --> 00:28:00.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Secretary, for the very concise brief presentation and even the accomplishment

asr-000324
00:28:00.820 --> 00:28:06.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: of the DILG and attached agencies. Basta Upsilon 'yan, magaling po talaga.

asr-000325
00:28:07.920 --> 00:28:09.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I think Tau Gamma will agree.

asr-000326
00:28:11.320 --> 00:28:12.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Bong Teves will agree with that.

asr-000327
00:28:14.940 --> 00:28:16.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much, sir.

asr-000327-split-1
00:28:17.100 --> 00:28:21.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, so before the interpellation, I would like to recognize

asr-000328
00:28:21.600 --> 00:28:33.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: the presence of our Deputy Speaker, Bambi Emano, Vice Chair Maria Isabel Sagarbarria, Vice Chair

asr-000329
00:28:33.800 --> 00:28:42.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Keith Micah "Mike" Tan, Vice Chair Bernadette Barbers, Representative Edgar Erice,

asr-000330
00:28:44.020 --> 00:28:54.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Vice Chair Joboy Aquino, Representative Jurdin Jesus Romualdo. Manong JJ pala, Manong JJ,

asr-000331
00:28:54.200 --> 00:29:02.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: our Majority Leader sa CA. So before the interpellation, may I remind our distinguished colleagues

asr-000332
00:29:02.400 --> 00:29:09.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: that each member is allotted five minutes for questions or interpellations,

asr-000333
00:29:09.040 --> 00:29:12.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: excluding the response of the resource persons.

asr-000334
00:29:12.860 --> 00:29:18.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: When the bell sounds, the member has 30 seconds to conclude or round up.

asr-000335
00:29:22.440 --> 00:29:24.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Gumaganda na yung bell sa Kongreso.

asr-000335-split-1
00:29:25.120 --> 00:29:30.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Consistent with the long-standing practice of the House, the Chair shall recognize minority,

asr-000336
00:29:31.140 --> 00:29:36.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: independent, and majority members in an alternating manner when practicable.

asr-000337
00:29:37.300 --> 00:29:47.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The Chair first recognized the Honorable Representative Dadah Kiram Ismula. Ma’am, you have the floor.

asr-000337-split-1
00:29:47.740 --> 00:29:48.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000338
00:29:48.820 --> 00:29:53.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuhu.

asr-000339
00:29:53.040 --> 00:29:55.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: magandang umaga to my colleagues uh

asr-000340
00:29:57.140 --> 00:29:58.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa DILG family

asr-000341
00:29:58.720 --> 00:30:01.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and to its attached agency.

asr-000342
00:30:02.100 --> 00:30:05.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Una ko pong magiging katanungan para po sa DILG,

asr-000343
00:30:07.340 --> 00:30:12.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: PNP mentioned sa Senate hearing that true crime community or TCC

asr-000344
00:30:12.860 --> 00:30:20.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and its subcultures 764, The Com may be involved sa school shootings in Tacloban.

asr-000345
00:30:20.660 --> 00:30:25.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: As regards to this, can you briefly share some findings relating to this

asr-000346
00:30:25.940 --> 00:30:28.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa shooting incident in Zamboanga City?

asr-000347
00:30:29.620 --> 00:30:40.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am. The TCC allegations were a theory that the boy, the CICL, searched prior to his history.

asr-000348
00:30:40.620 --> 00:30:48.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But there's no conclusive link that the CICL, that the, through, what do you call the organization?

asr-000349
00:30:49.020 --> 00:30:53.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: It was mentioned in the PNP during the Senate hearing.

asr-000350
00:30:53.820 --> 00:30:58.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, there's no conclusive link that the group influenced the boy into his actions.

asr-000351
00:30:59.460 --> 00:31:01.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. Maraming salamat po.

asr-000352
00:31:01.100 --> 00:31:08.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: How about sa NBI and the DOJ are also investigating NVE cases sa school shootings po.

asr-000353
00:31:08.340 --> 00:31:15.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano kayo nagko-coordinate ng investigation at pag-prevent ng future school violence incidents targeting children?

asr-000354
00:31:15.760 --> 00:31:24.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well, ma'am, the first part is that the Department of Education and the DILG are entering into a memorandum circular

asr-000355
00:31:24.900 --> 00:31:28.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to allow barangay tanods inside

asr-000356
00:31:28.320 --> 00:31:29.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the school buildings.

asr-000357
00:31:30.240 --> 00:31:35.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, they will be part of the security augmentation force to inspect the bags before they enter.

asr-000358
00:31:35.960 --> 00:31:44.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Outside of that, the PNP is regularly scheduled in the ingress and egress of students during school time.

asr-000359
00:31:44.100 --> 00:31:46.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: They are required to be there.

asr-000360
00:31:46.940 --> 00:31:53.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, all schools are to be secured between yung pasokan nila at saka yung pauwihan nila.

asr-000361
00:31:54.300 --> 00:31:56.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Thank you for that, Mr. Chair.

asr-000362
00:31:56.320 --> 00:32:15.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: It is also apparent that in both the Tacloban at Zamboanga City incident, government-issued firearms ang ginamit. Ano ba ang protocol sa handling at ano ang mga nilabag? Most importantly, ano ang babaguhin ng PNP at DILG patungkol sa handling ng issued firearms?

asr-000363
00:32:15.720 --> 00:32:16.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-000364
00:32:16.440 --> 00:32:28.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There are 800,000 uniformed personnel in the country divided between the PNP, the AFP, the NBI, Bureau of Customs, BJNP,

asr-000365
00:32:28.400 --> 00:32:29.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and the BFP.

asr-000366
00:32:29.720 --> 00:32:35.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In the 800,000, we have had two incidences of unauthorized use of their firearms.

asr-000367
00:32:35.020 --> 00:32:39.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is stated in the protocol that they are responsible at all times for their guns.

asr-000368
00:32:39.580 --> 00:32:47.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And they are supposed to put it in safekeeping under lock and key if not in their possession.

asr-000369
00:32:47.640 --> 00:32:55.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In both cases, the aunt of the Tacloban shooter just left it in her table.

asr-000370
00:32:55.260 --> 00:32:56.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And in the...

asr-000371
00:32:58.980 --> 00:33:00.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In the Zamboanga case, it was left in his car.

asr-000372
00:33:00.580 --> 00:33:15.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Now, what we are proposing is that the IRR has to be amended that all lawfully issued firearms are to be...

asr-000373
00:33:15.160 --> 00:33:24.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The PNP will be granted access to all homes of lawfully issued firearms to inspect their procedures in safekeeping.

asr-000374
00:33:26.020 --> 00:33:27.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: This might...

asr-000375
00:33:27.120 --> 00:33:37.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: upset a few people because it might be interpreted as an impingement of rights.

asr-000376
00:33:37.740 --> 00:33:46.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, we must remember that the privilege to own a gun is not enshrined in our constitution.

asr-000377
00:33:46.200 --> 00:33:51.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is not like the United States of America where it is a part of the Second Amendment.

asr-000378
00:33:51.840 --> 00:33:57.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is a privilege granted by law to those who wish to avail of a firearm.

asr-000379
00:33:57.520 --> 00:33:58.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So,

asr-000380
00:33:58.040 --> 00:33:59.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the PNP must have access,

asr-000381
00:34:00.020 --> 00:34:01.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: must give notice,

asr-000382
00:34:01.220 --> 00:34:05.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and inspect where they put their firearms and how they safekeep it.

asr-000383
00:34:07.000 --> 00:34:07.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair,

asr-000384
00:34:07.960 --> 00:34:08.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa ngayon po,

asr-000385
00:34:08.660 --> 00:34:14.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano pong kaso or may kaso na bang nakahain doon sa dalawang incident na ito?

asr-000386
00:34:15.000 --> 00:34:18.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That is another part that I am asking Congress to upgrade.

asr-000387
00:34:18.640 --> 00:34:20.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As of now,

asr-000388
00:34:20.280 --> 00:34:26.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the only case of the aunt and the father of those who own the guns

asr-000389
00:34:26.900 --> 00:34:27.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: are reckless imprudence.

asr-000390
00:34:27.820 --> 00:34:29.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Reckless imprudence resulting in homicide.

asr-000391
00:34:30.020 --> 00:34:31.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is parang humiram ka lang ng kotse,

asr-000392
00:34:32.000 --> 00:34:33.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: pinahiram mo yung kotse,

asr-000393
00:34:33.980 --> 00:34:35.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: tapos [unclear] ka sa [unclear].

asr-000394
00:34:35.240 --> 00:34:36.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Reckless imprudence na.

asr-000395
00:34:36.640 --> 00:34:43.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There should be a greater penalty for the owners of the guns that are used for illegal purposes.

asr-000396
00:34:43.040 --> 00:34:45.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-000397
00:34:45.560 --> 00:34:49.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako naman po ko sa isa pang katanungan para sa PNP

asr-000398
00:34:49.620 --> 00:34:51.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: on mistaken identity arrest.

asr-000399
00:34:52.420 --> 00:34:57.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Bagamat mandato po ng PNP ang pagpapatupad ng batas at pag-aresto,

asr-000400
00:34:58.480 --> 00:35:00.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng mga lumalabag dito.

asr-000401
00:35:00.420 --> 00:35:04.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May mga insidente ng mistaken identity na nagdudulot ng pangamba

asr-000402
00:35:04.920 --> 00:35:08.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at kawalan ng tiwala sa kanilang operasyon.

asr-000403
00:35:08.260 --> 00:35:10.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nitong August 19 of 2026,

asr-000404
00:35:11.980 --> 00:35:13.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kiniulat ng Bangsa Moro Human Rights Commission

asr-000405
00:35:13.760 --> 00:35:15.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na sa Basilan,

asr-000406
00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:22.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ilang residente ang paulit-ulit na naaaresto batay sa mga warrant na nakapangalan sa ibang tao.

asr-000407
00:35:23.080 --> 00:35:24.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaugnay dito,

asr-000408
00:35:24.500 --> 00:35:27.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano ang nakalaan na pondo ng PNP sa NEP?

asr-000409
00:35:28.720 --> 00:35:31.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano ang nakalaan na pondo ng PNP sa NEP para sa intelligence gathering at verification

asr-000410
00:35:31.620 --> 00:35:35.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: bago masagawa ng arrest operation?

asr-000411
00:35:35.220 --> 00:35:38.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At paano masisigurong ginagamit ito ng tama

asr-000412
00:35:38.360 --> 00:35:43.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para maiwasan ang ganitong kaso ng mistaken identity cases?

asr-000413
00:35:43.700 --> 00:35:44.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-000414
00:35:44.600 --> 00:35:50.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In the total budget of the PNP for 2026 and 2027,

asr-000415
00:35:50.940 --> 00:35:54.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we have accumulated almost 4 billion in savings

asr-000416
00:35:54.560 --> 00:35:57.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to implement a PNP community ID.

asr-000417
00:35:57.680 --> 00:36:05.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: This community IDP will involve sophisticated biometrics and records keeping

asr-000418
00:36:05.000 --> 00:36:08.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that mistaken identities can no longer happen.

asr-000419
00:36:08.900 --> 00:36:11.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: What happens now is sometimes when we arrest a person

asr-000420
00:36:11.920 --> 00:36:13.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and we put a picture,

asr-000421
00:36:13.940 --> 00:36:15.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: five names come up

asr-000422
00:36:15.640 --> 00:36:19.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because we have, I think, 35 government IDs

asr-000423
00:36:19.440 --> 00:36:21.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and that they can take it easily.

asr-000424
00:36:21.820 --> 00:36:24.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And it is easily reflected in the SIM card registration.

asr-000425
00:36:26.060 --> 00:36:26.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: One person,

asr-000426
00:36:26.820 --> 00:36:30.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: can accumulate 400 phones

asr-000427
00:36:30.060 --> 00:36:33.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and using different IDs issued by the government

asr-000428
00:36:33.460 --> 00:36:34.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that is accepted.

asr-000429
00:36:34.280 --> 00:36:35.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we are proposing that

asr-000430
00:36:35.720 --> 00:36:39.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the PNP is already instituting a community ID

asr-000431
00:36:39.860 --> 00:36:42.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that there will be one single ID for the entire country.

asr-000432
00:36:43.400 --> 00:36:44.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair,

asr-000433
00:36:44.580 --> 00:36:47.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: napapaloob ba dito sa budget sa NEP

asr-000434
00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:53.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: yung tinatawag na award or rewards

asr-000435
00:36:53.340 --> 00:36:56.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: in the event po na may nahuli sila

asr-000436
00:36:56.940 --> 00:36:57.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero apparently,

asr-000437
00:36:57.640 --> 00:36:59.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: it was a mistaken identity.

asr-000438
00:36:59.980 --> 00:37:03.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There is no reward for a mistaken identity

asr-000439
00:37:03.520 --> 00:37:05.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but there is an investigation for that.

asr-000440
00:37:05.780 --> 00:37:08.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And sa kasalukuyan po, Mr. Chair,

asr-000441
00:37:08.400 --> 00:37:10.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: may mga naulat na po ba sa inyo

asr-000442
00:37:10.420 --> 00:37:14.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at may mga action na po ba na nagawa

asr-000443
00:37:15.220 --> 00:37:17.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: in the event na may nagkamalinga

asr-000444
00:37:17.420 --> 00:37:18.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: from the PNP personnels,

asr-000445
00:37:19.960 --> 00:37:23.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ano po yung mga kaagarang cases

asr-000446
00:37:23.100 --> 00:37:25.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: or filed cases na nagagawa sa PNP?

asr-000447
00:37:25.180 --> 00:37:27.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well, in those cases,

asr-000448
00:37:27.440 --> 00:37:28.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: first, there is the admin aspect

asr-000449
00:37:28.940 --> 00:37:30.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: where they are investigated.

asr-000450
00:37:30.700 --> 00:37:34.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If there was malicious intent in it,

asr-000451
00:37:34.800 --> 00:37:36.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then we will forward it to the NAPO-COM

asr-000452
00:37:36.560 --> 00:37:37.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: for their disposal.

asr-000453
00:37:39.100 --> 00:37:41.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Patungkol doon sa ALFAD family,

asr-000454
00:37:41.540 --> 00:37:42.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: it was reportedly,

asr-000455
00:37:43.420 --> 00:37:45.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: it is in Zamboanga City po,

asr-000456
00:37:45.640 --> 00:37:49.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: it was reportedly na mistaken identity din.

asr-000457
00:37:49.380 --> 00:37:51.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano po yung status ng kasong yun?

asr-000458
00:37:52.820 --> 00:37:53.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sino ba ang ano?

asr-000459
00:37:53.900 --> 00:37:55.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Let me get back to you, ma'am.

asr-000460
00:38:00.480 --> 00:38:02.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, can we get back to you?

asr-000461
00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:03.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Before the session starts,

asr-000462
00:38:04.120 --> 00:38:05.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will gather the information.

asr-000463
00:38:06.140 --> 00:38:08.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yeah, Mr. Chair, okay lang po yun.

asr-000464
00:38:09.060 --> 00:38:11.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako na lang ako muna sa ibang katanungan

asr-000465
00:38:11.580 --> 00:38:12.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: while waiting for that.

asr-000466
00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:14.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sige po.

asr-000467
00:38:14.540 --> 00:38:15.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Patungkol po ito sa

asr-000468
00:38:15.900 --> 00:38:18.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: violence against women and children

asr-000469
00:38:18.840 --> 00:38:20.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa VAWC.

asr-000470
00:38:21.040 --> 00:38:23.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Noong Marso of 2026,

asr-000471
00:38:23.740 --> 00:38:29.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: inuulat ng DILG na 40,886 barangays

asr-000472
00:38:29.280 --> 00:38:31.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: o 97% ng kabuuang bilang ng mga barangay

asr-000473
00:38:33.380 --> 00:38:36.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang may funksyonal VAWC GBV desk,

asr-000474
00:38:37.040 --> 00:38:38.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: which is a welcome development.

asr-000475
00:38:39.460 --> 00:38:41.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngunit may mga natanggap kaming ulat

asr-000476
00:38:41.480 --> 00:38:43.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa grounds ng ilang desk

asr-000477
00:38:43.240 --> 00:38:44.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay hindi talaga funksyonal

asr-000478
00:38:44.840 --> 00:38:47.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at walang tao, walang tamang lugar

asr-000479
00:38:47.000 --> 00:38:50.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: o ginagamit bilang storage lang.

asr-000480
00:38:50.640 --> 00:38:52.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano kaya ang plano ng DILG

asr-000481
00:38:52.880 --> 00:38:55.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa sustainability ng mga help desk

asr-000482
00:38:55.780 --> 00:38:57.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: beyond initial funding?

asr-000483
00:38:57.560 --> 00:39:01.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May recurrent ba na budget line item

asr-000485
00:39:01.440 --> 00:39:04.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Para sa staffing, training at maintenance

asr-000486
00:39:04.580 --> 00:39:07.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: o nakadepende lang ito sa one-time allocation?

asr-000487
00:39:07.680 --> 00:39:11.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, the VAWC desk is a function

asr-000488
00:39:11.700 --> 00:39:12.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the barangay system.

asr-000489
00:39:13.700 --> 00:39:19.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Their budget emanates from the budget

asr-000490
00:39:19.980 --> 00:39:21.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that is allocated to them

asr-000491
00:39:21.940 --> 00:39:24.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: according to the local government fund.

asr-000492
00:39:24.900 --> 00:39:28.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In this case, our function is to monitor

asr-000493
00:39:28.800 --> 00:39:31.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and to cite their needs

asr-000494
00:39:31.860 --> 00:39:32.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: for improvement.

asr-000495
00:39:32.880 --> 00:39:36.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So far, we still have room to improve

asr-000496
00:39:36.500 --> 00:39:38.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and we will make sure that

asr-000497
00:39:38.480 --> 00:39:40.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will continue to monitor

asr-000498
00:39:40.520 --> 00:39:42.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and make sure that all these barangays

asr-000499
00:39:42.900 --> 00:39:44.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: VAWC desks are functional.

asr-000500
00:39:44.680 --> 00:39:47.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po, may mga naulat na rin po sa inyong...

asr-000501
00:39:47.920 --> 00:39:48.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-000502
00:39:48.820 --> 00:39:50.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, we have 40,000 barangays

asr-000503
00:39:50.880 --> 00:39:53.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and it is inescapable that there are

asr-000504
00:39:54.520 --> 00:39:56.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: some barangays which do not function

asr-000505
00:39:56.680 --> 00:39:57.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: as well as the others.

asr-000506
00:39:58.240 --> 00:39:59.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000507
00:39:59.420 --> 00:40:02.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May isa pa po akong topic.

asr-000508
00:40:02.360 --> 00:40:03.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito naman po yung

asr-000509
00:40:03.700 --> 00:40:05.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: LGSF funds natin.

asr-000510
00:40:05.840 --> 00:40:07.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang local government support fund,

asr-000511
00:40:07.900 --> 00:40:10.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: particularly ang financial assistance

asr-000512
00:40:10.360 --> 00:40:11.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa local government unit,

asr-000513
00:40:12.200 --> 00:40:15.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay ini-administer ng DBM

asr-000514
00:40:15.200 --> 00:40:17.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at ginagamit ng LGUs

asr-000515
00:40:17.080 --> 00:40:19.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa iba't-ibang development projects.

asr-000516
00:40:19.680 --> 00:40:20.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kabilang na rito,

asr-000517
00:40:20.920 --> 00:40:22.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang assistance sa indigent individuals

asr-000518
00:40:22.980 --> 00:40:25.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa education o scholarship.

asr-000519
00:40:26.440 --> 00:40:28.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Gusto ko lang i-confirm

asr-000520
00:40:28.420 --> 00:40:30.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kung ano ang papel ng DILG

asr-000521
00:40:30.720 --> 00:40:31.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa distribution o

asr-000522
00:40:31.720 --> 00:40:33.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: implementation po nito.

asr-000523
00:40:33.120 --> 00:40:37.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, the sole function of DILG

asr-000524
00:40:37.280 --> 00:40:39.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is to monitor the distribution

asr-000525
00:40:39.080 --> 00:40:40.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and to present reports.

asr-000526
00:40:41.720 --> 00:40:43.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is the DBM

asr-000527
00:40:43.000 --> 00:40:45.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: which actually disperses the monies

asr-000528
00:40:45.180 --> 00:40:48.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and it is the COA and the DILG

asr-000529
00:40:48.060 --> 00:40:49.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: which monitors its distribution.

asr-000530
00:40:50.360 --> 00:40:51.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dahil po, Mr. Chair,

asr-000531
00:40:51.880 --> 00:40:54.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na-mention na parte po

asr-000532
00:40:54.360 --> 00:40:56.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ay magmamonitor ang DILG,

asr-000533
00:40:56.500 --> 00:40:58.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: may mga naulat po kasi sa ground

asr-000534
00:40:58.540 --> 00:41:00.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na nagiging highly politicized

asr-000535
00:41:00.620 --> 00:41:02.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang paggamit ng DILG.

asr-000536
00:41:03.120 --> 00:41:04.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa barangay level.

asr-000537
00:41:04.360 --> 00:41:06.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madalas, pabor lang sa malapit

asr-000538
00:41:06.520 --> 00:41:07.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa barangay kapitan

asr-000539
00:41:07.560 --> 00:41:08.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang nabibigyan.

asr-000540
00:41:08.560 --> 00:41:11.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At madalas, mas malala.

asr-000541
00:41:11.700 --> 00:41:14.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May mga pagkakataon na picture-taking

asr-000542
00:41:14.160 --> 00:41:15.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: lang ang nangyayari

asr-000543
00:41:15.280 --> 00:41:17.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero hindi talaga nakakarating

asr-000544
00:41:17.200 --> 00:41:20.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang assistance sa intended beneficiaries.

asr-000545
00:41:20.660 --> 00:41:21.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In your monitoring,

asr-000546
00:41:21.920 --> 00:41:23.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: have you received similar reports po ba?

asr-000547
00:41:24.180 --> 00:41:25.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-000548
00:41:25.100 --> 00:41:26.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have seen that.

asr-000549
00:41:26.440 --> 00:41:27.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We are monitoring it.

asr-000550
00:41:27.980 --> 00:41:31.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, to say for us

asr-000551
00:41:31.640 --> 00:41:33.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to ascertain

asr-000552
00:41:33.280 --> 00:41:35.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: whether or not malakas lang sa kapitan

asr-000553
00:41:35.660 --> 00:41:38.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: ang nakakukuha is a very difficult task.

asr-000554
00:41:38.400 --> 00:41:40.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: To establish civil relations

asr-000555
00:41:40.500 --> 00:41:42.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: or civic relations

asr-000556
00:41:42.060 --> 00:41:43.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: between party recipients

asr-000557
00:41:43.520 --> 00:41:45.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and disbursement people

asr-000558
00:41:45.240 --> 00:41:47.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: are very hard to ascertain.

asr-000559
00:41:47.200 --> 00:41:48.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But if there are complaints,

asr-000560
00:41:48.800 --> 00:41:50.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we are open to investigating

asr-000561
00:41:50.200 --> 00:41:51.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if they give it to us.

asr-000562
00:41:51.960 --> 00:41:54.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, huling katanungan na lang po.

asr-000563
00:41:54.300 --> 00:41:54.680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, po.

asr-000564
00:41:54.780 --> 00:41:56.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May mandato po ba

asr-000565
00:41:56.220 --> 00:41:58.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: o kapangyarihan ang DILG

asr-000566
00:41:58.120 --> 00:42:00.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para tanggapin ng mga ganitong reports?

asr-000567
00:42:00.980 --> 00:42:01.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sakaling,

asr-000568
00:42:01.540 --> 00:42:04.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: may [unclear] kami sa inyo.

asr-000569
00:42:04.440 --> 00:42:06.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano po kaya yung action

asr-000570
00:42:06.840 --> 00:42:08.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na pwede ninyong magawa?

asr-000571
00:42:08.200 --> 00:42:08.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well, ma'am,

asr-000572
00:42:08.760 --> 00:42:10.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if we ascertain

asr-000573
00:42:10.120 --> 00:42:11.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that there has been wrongdoing,

asr-000574
00:42:11.760 --> 00:42:13.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then we will refer the case

asr-000575
00:42:13.300 --> 00:42:20.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: either to the local government authority,

asr-000576
00:42:20.460 --> 00:42:22.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: which is maybe the municipality

asr-000577
00:42:22.040 --> 00:42:23.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: or the city.

asr-000578
00:42:23.480 --> 00:42:27.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But if it is of a graver level,

asr-000579
00:42:27.180 --> 00:42:28.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then we will refer it to the ombudsman

asr-000580
00:42:28.760 --> 00:42:29.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: for disposition.

asr-000581
00:42:30.260 --> 00:42:31.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, maraming salamat.

asr-000583
00:42:32.300 --> 00:42:34.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Aantayin ko na lang yung update tungkol doon

asr-000584
00:42:34.480 --> 00:42:36.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa Alphard family report

asr-000585
00:42:36.180 --> 00:42:37.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: or investigation

asr-000586
00:42:38.800 --> 00:42:39.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: within the day?

asr-000587
00:42:39.980 --> 00:42:41.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Or bago matapos ito?

asr-000588
00:42:41.420 --> 00:42:42.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Within the hour, ma'am.

asr-000589
00:42:42.620 --> 00:42:46.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, thank you.

asr-000590
00:42:47.360 --> 00:42:49.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So next to interpolate,

asr-000591
00:42:49.000 --> 00:42:51.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We have Chairman Rolando Valeriano.

asr-000592
00:42:51.460 --> 00:42:52.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sir.

asr-000593
00:42:53.880 --> 00:42:54.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Recognized.

asr-000594
00:42:54.460 --> 00:42:56.140
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000595
00:42:56.140 --> 00:42:58.680
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Good morning po sa DILG.

asr-000596
00:42:58.680 --> 00:42:59.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-000597
00:43:00.020 --> 00:43:01.700
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Magaling na ako nang nagtanong po

asr-000598
00:43:01.700 --> 00:43:02.660
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: sa kanina.

asr-000599
00:43:02.660 --> 00:43:04.100
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Halos lahat ang tatanong ko

asr-000600
00:43:04.100 --> 00:43:04.900
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: nakuha niyan.

asr-000601
00:43:04.900 --> 00:43:06.660
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Pero nadaanan ko lang ito.

asr-000602
00:43:06.660 --> 00:43:06.980
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Sek,

asr-000603
00:43:08.700 --> 00:43:09.680
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Paki-ano mo nga ako,

asr-000604
00:43:10.360 --> 00:43:11.500
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: paki-educate mo nga ako rito.

asr-000605
00:43:11.500 --> 00:43:12.740
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Ang sabi mo kanina,

asr-000606
00:43:12.740 --> 00:43:14.620
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung mga local gun owner,

asr-000607
00:43:15.480 --> 00:43:16.460
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: parang gusto ninyo

asr-000608
00:43:16.460 --> 00:43:18.120
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: inspecting sa bahay

asr-000609
00:43:18.120 --> 00:43:18.920
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: or sa community,

asr-000610
00:43:19.360 --> 00:43:20.700
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: paano pong procedure

asr-000611
00:43:20.700 --> 00:43:21.680
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: ang gusto ninyong gawin?

asr-000612
00:43:21.760 --> 00:43:23.060
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Di ba tayo magka-problema sa

asr-000613
00:43:24.460 --> 00:43:25.080
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: batas

asr-000614
00:43:25.080 --> 00:43:26.660
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: o baka kailangan natin

asr-000615
00:43:26.660 --> 00:43:27.380
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: ng enabling law?

asr-000616
00:43:28.200 --> 00:43:28.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Your Honor,

asr-000617
00:43:29.040 --> 00:43:29.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it is a

asr-000618
00:43:30.780 --> 00:43:32.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: function of our IRR.

asr-000620
00:43:32.580 --> 00:43:34.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And I think

asr-000621
00:43:34.880 --> 00:43:36.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it is only incumbent upon us

asr-000622
00:43:36.560 --> 00:43:38.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that the privilege

asr-000623
00:43:38.120 --> 00:43:39.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we give to the gun owners

asr-000624
00:43:39.520 --> 00:43:41.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: are also concordant

asr-000625
00:43:41.300 --> 00:43:42.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: with their responsibility

asr-000626
00:43:42.220 --> 00:43:43.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of safekeeping.

asr-000627
00:43:44.200 --> 00:43:45.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In both cases

asr-000628
00:43:45.520 --> 00:43:46.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of school shootings,

asr-000629
00:43:46.900 --> 00:43:48.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the safekeeping of the guns

asr-000630
00:43:48.540 --> 00:43:50.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: were not in standard procedure.

asr-000631
00:43:51.000 --> 00:43:52.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: What we propose to do

asr-000632
00:43:52.400 --> 00:43:54.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is that we will revise the IRR,

asr-000633
00:43:54.160 --> 00:43:55.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: inform the person

asr-000634
00:43:55.720 --> 00:43:57.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: ahead of time

asr-000635
00:43:57.140 --> 00:43:58.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that we will put a...

asr-000636
00:43:58.980 --> 00:44:00.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will inspect their premises

asr-000637
00:44:00.760 --> 00:44:01.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: for how they

asr-000638
00:44:02.140 --> 00:44:03.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: safekeep their guns

asr-000639
00:44:03.300 --> 00:44:04.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that we can have

asr-000640
00:44:04.580 --> 00:44:05.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: a checklist

asr-000641
00:44:05.420 --> 00:44:06.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and remind them

asr-000642
00:44:06.700 --> 00:44:07.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the proper practices.

asr-000643
00:44:07.780 --> 00:44:09.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Mind you, sir,

asr-000644
00:44:09.800 --> 00:44:11.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: there are eight million,

asr-000645
00:44:11.020 --> 00:44:11.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: over eight million

asr-000646
00:44:13.380 --> 00:44:15.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: no, there are over

asr-000647
00:44:15.000 --> 00:44:15.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: four million handguns

asr-000648
00:44:15.920 --> 00:44:18.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that are legal

asr-000649
00:44:18.160 --> 00:44:19.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in this country.

asr-000650
00:44:20.140 --> 00:44:21.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Both from uniformed personnel

asr-000651
00:44:21.780 --> 00:44:24.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and private owners.

asr-000652
00:44:24.020 --> 00:44:24.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So,

asr-000653
00:44:24.480 --> 00:44:25.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think it should be

asr-000654
00:44:25.560 --> 00:44:26.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the responsibility

asr-000655
00:44:26.100 --> 00:44:27.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the PNP

asr-000656
00:44:27.480 --> 00:44:28.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to inspect

asr-000657
00:44:28.860 --> 00:44:29.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: how they

asr-000658
00:44:29.380 --> 00:44:30.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: safekeep their guns

asr-000659
00:44:30.600 --> 00:44:31.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and to make sure

asr-000660
00:44:31.580 --> 00:44:32.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it is out of reach

asr-000661
00:44:32.100 --> 00:44:32.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of children.

asr-000662
00:44:33.900 --> 00:44:34.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you po.

asr-000664
00:44:34.960 --> 00:44:37.040
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: At as chairman of

asr-000665
00:44:37.040 --> 00:44:38.280
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Public Order and Safety

asr-000666
00:44:38.280 --> 00:44:39.100
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: dito sa Congress,

asr-000667
00:44:39.320 --> 00:44:40.160
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: anytime naman,

asr-000668
00:44:40.240 --> 00:44:41.720
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: tinatapos ko lang itong

asr-000669
00:44:43.520 --> 00:44:44.520
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: appropriation hearing,

asr-000670
00:44:44.520 --> 00:44:46.280
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: mag-hear din naman kami

asr-000671
00:44:46.280 --> 00:44:47.140
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: motu proprio

asr-000672
00:44:47.140 --> 00:44:48.680
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: regarding diyan sa shooting

asr-000673
00:44:48.680 --> 00:44:49.900
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: na nangyayari ngayon.

asr-000674
00:44:49.900 --> 00:44:51.420
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Anong thoughts mo, Sek,

asr-000675
00:44:51.580 --> 00:44:52.920
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: sa nangyayari na ito?

asr-000676
00:44:53.040 --> 00:44:54.700
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: At ano yung dapat

asr-000677
00:44:54.700 --> 00:44:56.180
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: proactive tayo eh, di ba?

asr-000678
00:44:56.320 --> 00:44:56.820
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Actually,

asr-000679
00:44:56.880 --> 00:44:57.460
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yun ang nagiging

asr-000680
00:44:57.460 --> 00:44:58.100
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: comment ng tao.

asr-000690
00:44:58.100 --> 00:45:05.620
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: In the future, ano yung plano ninyo or ano yung measure na ginagawa ninyo para ma-prevent yung mga ganyang happenings?

asr-000690-split-1
00:45:05.700 --> 00:45:26.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well, number one, I have been very vocal in public about Congress acting on repealing the Robin Padilla law. Sir, as of our statistics, 98% of violent crimes are committed with loose firearms, not lawful firearms. Number two,

asr-000691
00:45:26.460 --> 00:45:45.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's about time that we, as a country, reflect upon the use of children of first-person point-of-view shooters, which in this case was Roblox, which was used by the two CICLs.

asr-000692
00:45:45.900 --> 00:45:54.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If you look at the game, which I am not a gamer, but maybe there are others here, there are chat groups behind it.

asr-000693
00:45:54.140 --> 00:45:57.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And Roblox in particular has a very...

asr-000694
00:45:57.620 --> 00:46:04.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: insidious community which goads children into acting into their violent tendencies.

asr-000695
00:46:05.120 --> 00:46:10.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's why I'm proposing that Roblox be banned in the Philippines for you, in its entirety.

asr-000696
00:46:12.550 --> 00:46:14.500
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So, i-ban yung mga ganyang...

asr-000697
00:46:15.320 --> 00:46:23.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well, not all first-person shooter games have that kind of community, but Roblox in particular has a deep, dark community

asr-000698
00:46:23.620 --> 00:46:25.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: which incites

asr-000699
00:46:29.020 --> 00:46:31.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: unformed young minds into acting into their impulses.

asr-000700
00:46:32.600 --> 00:46:35.300
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you. So, iwanan ko na po yung issue [unclear] Chair.

asr-000701
00:46:35.380 --> 00:46:39.280
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Dito na tayo ulit sa Mr. Secretary, sa budgeting.

asr-000702
00:46:39.900 --> 00:46:42.960
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Ano ang utilization niyo po noong 2025? Ilang percent?

asr-000703
00:46:43.280 --> 00:46:46.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ninety-five point two percent, I think, sir.

asr-000704
00:46:47.040 --> 00:46:51.940
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: And 2026, halos tingin niyo yun din, 95 percent.

asr-000706
00:46:52.180 --> 00:46:53.400
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kasi napansin ko po,

asr-000707
00:46:55.060 --> 00:46:57.020
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: mukhang may mga budget

asr-000709
00:46:57.020 --> 00:46:59.940
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: na natanggap or hindi masyadong naibigay yung budget.

asr-000710
00:47:00.060 --> 00:47:01.380
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Specially, chine-check ko,

asr-000711
00:47:03.080 --> 00:47:05.260
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: medyo malaki pa kulang natin sa

asr-000712
00:47:05.260 --> 00:47:09.980
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Bureau of Fire po. Opo, medyo malaki pa kulang natin sa mga firetruck, ha?

asr-000713
00:47:10.160 --> 00:47:10.760
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Opo,

asr-000714
00:47:10.820 --> 00:47:13.060
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: at mukhang hindi kasama sa budget?

asr-000715
00:47:13.420 --> 00:47:14.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-000716
00:47:14.400 --> 00:47:21.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The budget for the firetrucks comes from the collections from the fire inspection of the BFP.

asr-000717
00:47:22.960 --> 00:47:24.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Every year, [unclear],

asr-000718
00:47:24.340 --> 00:47:25.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: almost four.

asr-000719
00:47:25.760 --> 00:47:27.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Four point five billion

asr-000720
00:47:27.180 --> 00:47:31.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is collected for the fire code fees.

asr-000721
00:47:31.260 --> 00:47:35.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But this is what we remit directly into the National Treasury.

asr-000722
00:47:35.340 --> 00:47:41.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Unfortunately, that four point five billion is not committed entirely for the use of the BFP.

asr-000723
00:47:41.780 --> 00:47:47.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think this year, only one billion was committed by the Treasury,

asr-000724
00:47:47.220 --> 00:47:51.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: although it should be in a lockbox for the use of the BFP.

asr-000725
00:47:52.340 --> 00:47:55.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, sir, we have come up with a novel plan

asr-000726
00:47:55.820 --> 00:48:00.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of entering into a government-to-government deal with Korea.

asr-000727
00:48:00.340 --> 00:48:03.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We just came there recently, a few weeks ago.

asr-000728
00:48:03.460 --> 00:48:11.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And we are in the process of completing a government-to-government transaction of 1,500 trucks over the next four years

asr-000729
00:48:11.080 --> 00:48:17.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that all municipalities will be covered in the next four years.

asr-000730
00:48:17.840 --> 00:48:22.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And furthermore, we will now remove the corruption that has been endemic in the BFP

asr-000731
00:48:22.960 --> 00:48:25.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in the procurement process.

asr-000732
00:48:25.040 --> 00:48:31.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, a government-to-government transaction immediately erases all doubts

asr-000733
00:48:31.880 --> 00:48:34.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because it is only the governments that talk.

asr-000734
00:48:35.840 --> 00:48:36.200
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you.

asr-000735
00:48:36.200 --> 00:48:39.000
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: And the reason why I'm asking that, Sek,

asr-000736
00:48:39.000 --> 00:48:47.000
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kasi siyempre kung ano yung maitutulong ng Kongreso kung kailangan na magdagdag ng pondo since budget season ngayon,

asr-000737
00:48:47.000 --> 00:48:51.560
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: pero maliit lang naman din yung requirement na kailangan.

asr-000738
00:48:51.560 --> 00:48:52.400
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So, Mr. Chair,

asr-000739
00:48:52.400 --> 00:48:57.820
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: I move sana na mahanapan pa natin ng additional budget

asr-000740
00:48:57.820 --> 00:49:02.400
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung DILG, especially the Bureau of Fire, tsaka yung PNP,

asr-000741
00:49:02.540 --> 00:49:05.340
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: and also ito na rin, Bureau of Jail Management,

asr-000742
00:49:05.560 --> 00:49:08.800
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: para kahit papaano makaganap sila ng katungkulan.

asr-000743
00:49:08.840 --> 00:49:13.360
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kasi parang narinig ko, ang firetruck is mga forty years na?

asr-000744
00:49:13.840 --> 00:49:15.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Meron, meron tayo, sir.

asr-000745
00:49:15.000 --> 00:49:16.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Nineteen eighty-six, functional pa rin.

asr-000746
00:49:17.080 --> 00:49:18.580
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Baka tinutulak na lang yun, sir.

asr-000747
00:49:18.680 --> 00:49:20.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Hindi, gumagana pa naman, surprisingly.

asr-000748
00:49:20.300 --> 00:49:24.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's why yung refleeting program [unclear] is a four-year program,

asr-000749
00:49:24.220 --> 00:49:25.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 1,500 trucks.

asr-000750
00:49:26.340 --> 00:49:30.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Purchased at 40% less of the cost of the previous fire trucks.

asr-000751
00:49:30.740 --> 00:49:33.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And it will have a maintenance contract with it

asr-000752
00:49:33.580 --> 00:49:38.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that we will make sure that all municipalities can maintain all their trucks.

asr-000753
00:49:38.340 --> 00:49:41.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, if you allow me,

asr-000754
00:49:41.680 --> 00:49:46.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if we do repeal the Robin Padilla law

asr-000755
00:49:46.120 --> 00:49:50.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and I hope that this distinguished body acts on it,

asr-000756
00:49:50.760 --> 00:49:55.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I would request that you add additional funds for the BJMP

asr-000757
00:49:55.060 --> 00:49:58.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to enhance their facilities.

asr-000758
00:50:00.040 --> 00:50:04.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Because the loose firearms in this country are prevalent,

asr-000759
00:50:04.120 --> 00:50:05.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and if we catch them, it will be non-bailable.

asr-000760
00:50:06.160 --> 00:50:07.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we will need more room in our jails.

asr-000761
00:50:07.820 --> 00:50:10.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Pag na-repeal yun, mapupuno natin yung BJMP.

asr-000762
00:50:10.740 --> 00:50:11.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: More than,

asr-000763
00:50:11.900 --> 00:50:15.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if you're at 200 capacity, baka mag-300% capacity tayo, sir.

asr-000764
00:50:15.860 --> 00:50:16.460
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Yeah.

asr-000765
00:50:16.560 --> 00:50:19.840
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: As a matter of fact, Mr. Secretary, Mr. Chair,

asr-000766
00:50:20.860 --> 00:50:23.680
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Natapos na dito sa Congress yung batas natin,

asr-000767
00:50:23.700 --> 00:50:25.960
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung from 56 to 57 years old.

asr-000768
00:50:25.960 --> 00:50:28.700
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Then extend natin yung ng one year in PNP.

asr-000769
00:50:28.700 --> 00:50:29.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-000770
00:50:29.420 --> 00:50:32.900
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kasunod na rin yung sa Bureau of Fire, tsaka yung sa BJMP.

asr-000771
00:50:32.900 --> 00:50:34.000
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Are you agree with that?

asr-000772
00:50:34.300 --> 00:50:35.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-000773
00:50:35.020 --> 00:50:36.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, if I were to,

asr-000774
00:50:36.880 --> 00:50:38.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if I had my choice,

asr-000775
00:50:39.200 --> 00:50:40.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: sir, I would extend it to 60.

asr-000776
00:50:42.680 --> 00:50:44.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And then let me explain.

asr-000777
00:50:44.260 --> 00:50:46.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: When the law was enacted in 1992,

asr-000778
00:50:46.780 --> 00:50:48.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The PNP

asr-000780
00:50:48.720 --> 00:50:50.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: -INP law was enacted in 1992,

asr-000781
00:50:51.160 --> 00:50:56.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the average life expectancy age of a Filipino then was 64 years old.

asr-000782
00:50:56.660 --> 00:51:00.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And that was 34 years ago.

asr-000783
00:51:00.640 --> 00:51:05.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Today, sir, our life expectancy for the Filipino is 70.5 years old.

asr-000784
00:51:05.540 --> 00:51:07.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So it is increased already.

asr-000785
00:51:07.780 --> 00:51:08.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Health is better.

asr-000786
00:51:09.020 --> 00:51:10.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: They are more productive.

asr-000787
00:51:10.380 --> 00:51:14.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And the knowledge that they have accumulated through the years are invaluable.

asr-000788
00:51:15.780 --> 00:51:17.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But I will live with 57,

asr-000789
00:51:17.860 --> 00:51:22.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but hopefully over the years we can increase the retirement age

asr-000790
00:51:22.160 --> 00:51:26.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because the experience that they gain is much too valuable just to let them retire.

asr-000791
00:51:27.480 --> 00:51:30.740
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Pero Mr. Secretary, Secretary, during the hearing,

asr-000792
00:51:30.780 --> 00:51:32.780
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kasi ako chairman ng public order noon,

asr-000793
00:51:33.440 --> 00:51:35.920
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kinuha namin ang inputs ng PNP.

asr-000794
00:51:36.100 --> 00:51:39.480
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: And according to them, as a matter of fact, gusto namin 60.

asr-000795
00:51:40.000 --> 00:51:42.740
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Pero sabi lang kasi ng PNP hierarchy,

asr-000796
00:51:43.240 --> 00:51:43.660
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: ano raw,

asr-000797
00:51:44.260 --> 00:51:45.920
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: sama na yung training nila.

asr-000798
00:51:46.000 --> 00:51:49.280
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So pagdating ng 60, medyo exhausted na sila.

asr-000799
00:51:49.840 --> 00:51:52.580
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Ang sabi ko nga, nakikita ko pa,

asr-000800
00:51:52.660 --> 00:51:54.540
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung ibang PNP nga nakakatakbo pa,

asr-000801
00:51:54.600 --> 00:51:55.620
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: even after 60.

asr-000802
00:51:55.740 --> 00:51:56.040
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Di ba?

asr-000803
00:51:56.100 --> 00:51:57.620
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: [unclear] ng hagdan eh.

asr-000805
00:51:57.620 --> 00:51:59.520
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Nadadapa nga lang minsan.

asr-000807
00:52:00.200 --> 00:52:03.820
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kaya sila rin, idea rin nila na maging 57 lang.

asr-000809
00:52:03.820 --> 00:52:09.340
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: kasi parang sinama nila yung training nila bago sila pumasok sa sa serbisyo.

asr-000811
00:52:09.340 --> 00:52:13.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, ang 57 is still prime productivity for a policeman.

asr-000812
00:52:13.860 --> 00:52:16.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think in this body,

asr-000813
00:52:17.440 --> 00:52:19.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sino ba 57 years old dito?

asr-000814
00:52:19.640 --> 00:52:21.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Congressman Richard?

asr-000815
00:52:24.120 --> 00:52:27.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Si Congressman Richard is only 37 years old.

asr-000816
00:52:27.240 --> 00:52:28.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, Congressman Teves, I think,

asr-000817
00:52:28.800 --> 00:52:33.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and a lot of us here are past 57 years old

asr-000818
00:52:33.060 --> 00:52:34.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but are still very productive.

asr-000819
00:52:34.600 --> 00:52:39.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And our wealth of knowledge is incalculable into making the department run better.

asr-000820
00:52:39.840 --> 00:52:41.120
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So, yun lang, Mr. Chair.

asr-000821
00:52:41.140 --> 00:52:43.600
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Sa mga tanong pa, wala naman akong masyadong tanong

asr-000822
00:52:43.600 --> 00:52:44.480
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: dahil natanong nila.

asr-000823
00:52:45.380 --> 00:52:48.500
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: I-move ko lang sana na ibang mga natanggal na budget nila,

asr-000824
00:52:48.560 --> 00:52:50.980
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: mahanapan natin ang budget.

asr-000825
00:52:50.980 --> 00:52:55.180
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Kasi nakikita ko minsan pag may sunog, parang 5 is to 1,

asr-000826
00:52:55.260 --> 00:52:56.960
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: yung volunteer, isa lang yung...

asr-000827
00:52:57.340 --> 00:52:57.840
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: eh

asr-000828
00:52:57.840 --> 00:53:03.520
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: hindi ko naman masisi dahil ang tingin ko nga, kakulangan din ng budgetary.

asr-000829
00:53:03.520 --> 00:53:06.020
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: So kung may magagawa po kami rito sa Kongreso,

asr-000831
00:53:06.060 --> 00:53:08.600
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: tutal, naghihimay-himay pa tayo ng budget,

asr-000832
00:53:08.920 --> 00:53:12.380
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: malagyan natin ng kaukulang budget tong

asr-000833
00:53:12.380 --> 00:53:16.700
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: PNP, Bureau of Fire, and the rest of your family.

asr-000834
00:53:17.000 --> 00:53:17.880
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you, Mr. Sec.

asr-000835
00:53:18.000 --> 00:53:18.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You're welcome.

asr-000836
00:53:18.620 --> 00:53:19.340
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you very much, sir.

asr-000836-split-1
00:53:19.340 --> 00:53:21.560
Rep. Rolando M. Valeriano: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000837
00:53:22.140 --> 00:53:22.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-000840
00:53:22.820 --> 00:53:25.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: In addition lang po regarding the fire trucks,

asr-000841
00:53:25.800 --> 00:53:33.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kung ang DBM lang po ay ibigay kahit 72% ng collection po nila in one year,

asr-000842
00:53:34.500 --> 00:53:39.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung 100 fire trucks natin and even 40 plus fire stations in one year,

asr-000843
00:53:39.540 --> 00:53:40.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: tapos na po tayo.

asr-000844
00:53:41.400 --> 00:53:43.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, tulungan po natin sila.

asr-000845
00:53:43.640 --> 00:53:47.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Siguro, there's a need to pressure the DBM para lumabas yung...

asr-000845-split-1
00:53:47.180 --> 00:53:49.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 25% lang po ng collection nga.

asr-000846
00:53:49.660 --> 00:53:53.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We're asking for 72%, so we will support Secretary Remulla.

asr-000847
00:53:53.500 --> 00:53:57.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Since malinis naman po ang BFP.

asr-000848
00:53:57.440 --> 00:53:58.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Malinis na po natin.

asr-000849
00:53:58.880 --> 00:54:00.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And the government-to-government also.

asr-000850
00:54:01.120 --> 00:54:06.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, Secretary, may I suggest also that not only Korea, let's venture out Japan.

asr-000851
00:54:07.220 --> 00:54:09.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kasi yung mga Isuzu parang 40 years.

asr-000852
00:54:09.700 --> 00:54:10.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We checked it out, sir.

asr-000853
00:54:10.900 --> 00:54:12.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's 30% more expensive.

asr-000854
00:54:13.280 --> 00:54:13.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-000855
00:54:13.760 --> 00:54:14.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yeah.

asr-000856
00:54:14.120 --> 00:54:17.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, I think Korea is the best option for us right now.

asr-000857
00:54:17.860 --> 00:54:18.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes.

asr-000858
00:54:18.280 --> 00:54:21.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I believe in your wisdom and leadership, Senior Brod.

asr-000859
00:54:23.160 --> 00:54:33.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, before I go to the next interpellator, I would like to recognize Representative Julius Vergara,

asr-000860
00:54:33.100 --> 00:54:39.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Deputy Majority Leader Alyssa Mica Gonzales,

asr-000861
00:54:39.040 --> 00:54:42.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congresswoman Florabel Yatco,

asr-000862
00:54:43.120 --> 00:54:45.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Zaldy Villa.

asr-000863
00:54:47.800 --> 00:54:54.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: For the next representative from the minority, may I recognize Representative Percival Cendaña.

asr-000864
00:54:54.940 --> 00:54:56.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sir, you have the floor.

asr-000865
00:54:58.700 --> 00:54:59.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000866
00:54:59.820 --> 00:55:02.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Magandang umaga po, Mr. Secretary at sa buong DILG family.

asr-000867
00:55:03.140 --> 00:55:07.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po, simulan natin yung unang round with a question on the burning issue.

asr-000868
00:55:07.680 --> 00:55:09.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Matagal na po natin naririnig.

asr-000869
00:55:09.280 --> 00:55:10.600
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ako po, taga-[unclear] Visaya ako,

asr-000870
00:55:10.820 --> 00:55:12.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mga kaibigan ko sa North,

asr-000871
00:55:12.160 --> 00:55:15.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: yung usapin po ng slots for sale sa BFP.

asr-000872
00:55:15.960 --> 00:55:19.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ito po, recently may nakita tayo, may nahuli na hiring official.

asr-000873
00:55:19.760 --> 00:55:22.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano po ang nangyayari sa BFP dito sa slots for sale?

asr-000874
00:55:22.780 --> 00:55:25.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano pong ginagawa natin para tugunan nito?

asr-000876
00:55:25.300 --> 00:55:28.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number one, sir, the case is officially solved.

asr-000877
00:55:28.560 --> 00:55:31.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yung slots for sale na isang nahuli natin.

asr-000878
00:55:31.540 --> 00:55:40.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Right now, I will defer to the BFP chief to explain our new hiring procedures and how we make it almost impossible to have the slots for sale.

asr-000879
00:55:40.760 --> 00:55:42.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Take note that before this,

asr-000880
00:55:42.200 --> 00:55:47.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the slots for sale ranged from 200,000 to 800,000 per slot.

asr-000881
00:55:48.100 --> 00:55:53.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But for one slot, with our new system, which I will defer to the BFP chief to explain,

asr-000882
00:55:53.920 --> 00:55:57.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we will make it almost impossible for that so that the slots will be for sale.

asr-000883
00:55:58.040 --> 00:55:58.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Chief Kwan Tiu?

asr-000884
00:56:00.220 --> 00:56:00.620
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you.

asr-000885
00:56:00.620 --> 00:56:04.900
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair, and Your Honors, and to our good Secretary.

asr-000886
00:56:04.900 --> 00:56:08.000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: To cut the story short, Mr. Chair,

asr-000887
00:56:08.000 --> 00:56:20.870
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: the Oplansang Tindig of the BFP, a mechanism that prevents and arrests persons who are into corruptions,

asr-000888
00:56:20.880 --> 00:56:24.310
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: not only outside but also the inside personnel of the BFP.

asr-000889
00:56:24.320 --> 00:56:34.420
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: It's working, and that is why just recently, nahuli po natin yung isang SFO1 na nag-engage into anomalies.

asr-000890
00:56:35.700 --> 00:56:36.400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Mr. Chair,

asr-000891
00:56:36.400 --> 00:56:40.760
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: matagal na pong naging kuwento ng BFP ang slot for sale.

asr-000892
00:56:41.100 --> 00:56:50.960
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Gumawa po tayo ng bagong makinarya, and we called it the e-hiring that somehow prevents this kind of people doing anomalies during recruitment.

asr-000893
00:56:51.900 --> 00:56:57.400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And so far, wala po tayong narinig on the first part of recruitment because it's system-generated.

asr-000894
00:56:57.500 --> 00:57:00.740
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: It's online application at the doorstep of their home,

asr-000895
00:57:00.880 --> 00:57:02.860
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: pwede na po silang mag-apply sa BFP,

asr-000896
00:57:02.880 --> 00:57:03.940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: wala po silang gagastusin,

asr-000897
00:57:03.980 --> 00:57:04.680
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: and during examination,

asr-000898
00:57:05.760 --> 00:57:07.500
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: automatically makukuha po nilang result,

asr-000899
00:57:07.680 --> 00:57:08.840
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: system-generated po.

asr-000900
00:57:08.920 --> 00:57:10.120
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So natigilan po natin noon.

asr-000901
00:57:10.160 --> 00:57:15.340
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: However, as I said, hindi 100% na nagagawa namin kasi human na po itong pagdating sa dulo.

asr-000902
00:57:15.640 --> 00:57:25.240
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So ang ginawa po nung isang bumbero na ito ay tiningnan niya sino po yung umabot na sa stage na kung saan matatapos na po yung recruitment phase sa kanya.

asr-000903
00:57:25.500 --> 00:57:32.240
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So randomly, tiningnan niya sa Facebook at nung may nakita siyang may sumagot sa kanya, nag-offer po siya ng tulong.

asr-000904
00:57:32.460 --> 00:57:35.720
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ito po ay panibagong mekanismo

asr-000905
00:57:35.720 --> 00:57:38.380
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: na naman na ginagawa ng mga kasamahan po namin.

asr-000906
00:57:38.400 --> 00:57:40.540
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Just very unfortunate na kasamahan nga po namin.

asr-000907
00:57:40.840 --> 00:57:48.880
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: The entire men and women of BFP felt sad on what transpired just recently. Kasi nga po lahat kami ang direksyon ay gusto na pong pag-uwi.

asr-000908
00:57:49.160 --> 00:57:50.000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Nahuli na po siya.

asr-000909
00:57:50.000 --> 00:57:54.560
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: As I said, epektibo po yung mekanismo ng Oplansang Tindig.

asr-000910
00:57:54.560 --> 00:58:02.860
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And I commend the bravery and courage of that applicant para ho isumbong niya dahil naniniwala siya na nagbabago na ho ang pananaw ng BFP, Mr. Chair.

asr-000912
00:58:04.100 --> 00:58:06.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-000914
00:58:07.200 --> 00:58:09.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At linawin po natin,

asr-000915
00:58:09.120 --> 00:58:11.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: so sana simula pa lamang ito

asr-000916
00:58:11.280 --> 00:58:16.940
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at mas maging matindi sana yung pagbabantay natin kasi nakalulungkot po na may galawang sindikato sa loob ng BFP pagdating po dito sa slots for sale.

asr-000917
00:58:16.940 --> 00:58:19.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to a more pressing issue.

asr-000918
00:58:19.320 --> 00:58:25.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa ngayon po, nagluluksa ang buong bansa dito sa sunod-sunod na karahasan sa ating mga eskwelahan.

asr-000919
00:58:25.380 --> 00:58:31.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi lamang po ito red flag, kundi isa na pong red alert ang nababalitaan natin na school violence.

asr-000920
00:58:32.020 --> 00:58:35.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Last week lang yung school shooting sa Zamboanga,

asr-000921
00:58:35.440 --> 00:58:36.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: tapos sa Tacloban, two months ago.

asr-000922
00:58:37.080 --> 00:58:38.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero hindi po ito yung buong kuwento.

asr-000923
00:58:38.820 --> 00:58:47.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Recently yung PNP nagsabi that they recorded at least 50 incidents in schools involving children in conflict with the law from June 16 to August 19.

asr-000924
00:58:47.980 --> 00:58:55.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ang range po niyan ay bomb threats, alleged shooting threats, stabbing incidents, illegal possession of firearms, death threats.

asr-000925
00:58:56.240 --> 00:59:00.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dito po sa nakaraang Senate hearing chaired by our colleague, Sen. Risa Hontiveros,

asr-000926
00:59:00.900 --> 00:59:09.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: the PNP sa Anti-Cybercrime Group said that they had handled 74 cases linked to nihilistic violent extremism,

asr-000927
00:59:09.540 --> 00:59:13.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at they rescued 42 minors in connection with these cases.

asr-000928
00:59:14.220 --> 00:59:19.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nagbago po ba ang strategy ng DILG at PNP after the recent events?

asr-000929
00:59:19.600 --> 00:59:25.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano po yung mga efforts to closely monitor and apprehend nihilistic violent extremism online?

asr-000930
00:59:25.880 --> 00:59:27.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, there are two parts to that.

asr-000931
00:59:27.820 --> 00:59:30.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: One is the physical manifestation

asr-000932
00:59:30.840 --> 00:59:35.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of how we deal with the children in conflict with the law

asr-000933
00:59:35.400 --> 00:59:36.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and how we prevent.

asr-000934
00:59:37.580 --> 00:59:46.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Again, the PNP is present in all schools in the country during entry and dismissal.

asr-000935
00:59:46.680 --> 00:59:47.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's number one.

asr-000936
00:59:47.680 --> 00:59:54.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number two, again, as I repeat, we have barangay tanods who will inspect the bags and identify the children who enter the school.

asr-000937
00:59:54.720 --> 00:59:55.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However,

asr-000938
00:59:55.440 --> 00:59:59.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: what happens in their homes that influence them

asr-000939
00:59:59.520 --> 01:00:01.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is beyond our control.

asr-000940
01:00:01.520 --> 01:00:07.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I urge the country, all of us, the government as a whole,

asr-000941
01:00:07.980 --> 01:00:10.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to act on these nihilistic sites

asr-000942
01:00:10.340 --> 01:00:12.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and have them cancelled as soon as possible.

asr-000943
01:00:14.180 --> 01:00:15.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Other countries have done that.

asr-000944
01:00:16.740 --> 01:00:20.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Australia is very successful in handling the use of

asr-000945
01:00:20.320 --> 01:00:22.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: minors using the internet.

asr-000946
01:00:22.860 --> 01:00:26.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: China is very good at handling that. It is not

asr-000947
01:00:26.680 --> 01:00:28.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: censorship but rather

asr-000948
01:00:28.560 --> 01:00:31.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it is a filtering out of dangerous

asr-000949
01:00:32.200 --> 01:00:35.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: sites so that children will not get influenced.

asr-000950
01:00:35.940 --> 01:00:42.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You will be surprised at the depravity of these websites.

asr-000951
01:00:42.420 --> 01:00:46.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: They espouse everything from satanism to nihilism

asr-000952
01:00:46.840 --> 01:00:52.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: anti-semitism to anti-LGBT,

asr-000953
01:00:52.480 --> 01:00:55.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and they encourage the children to act on this.

asr-000954
01:00:55.320 --> 01:00:55.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So this is

asr-000955
01:00:55.980 --> 01:00:58.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: something that the DICT, the DILG

asr-000956
01:00:58.480 --> 01:01:00.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and all other governments and even Congress

asr-000957
01:01:00.860 --> 01:01:03.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: can act upon so that these sites can be banned.

asr-000958
01:01:04.960 --> 01:01:07.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000959
01:01:07.200 --> 01:01:11.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para lang po sa NYC, ano po ang ginagawa natin

asr-000960
01:01:11.200 --> 01:01:16.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po mailayo yung mga kabataan natin sa mga nihilistic violent extremism?

asr-000961
01:01:17.820 --> 01:01:22.540
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, currently ang NYC po ay nag-a-allocate ng pondo

asr-000962
01:01:22.540 --> 01:01:23.920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: para sa Mental Health Youth Hub.

asr-000963
01:01:24.080 --> 01:01:25.720
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Ito po ay ang pagpapadala ng

asr-000965
01:01:26.040 --> 01:01:26.780
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: mga mental health

asr-000966
01:01:26.780 --> 01:01:28.300
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: peer-to-peer support facilitators

asr-000967
01:01:28.300 --> 01:01:31.120
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: sa mga areas gaya ng Zamboanga.

asr-000968
01:01:31.120 --> 01:01:35.000
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So nung nangyari po yung Zamboanga incident,

asr-000969
01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:37.100
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: nakipag-usap agad kami sa presidente

asr-000970
01:01:37.100 --> 01:01:39.300
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: and minobilize po namin yung mga facilitators namin.

asr-000971
01:01:39.680 --> 01:01:42.870
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Nung recent Senate Committee hearing po,

asr-000972
01:01:42.870 --> 01:01:46.870
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: it was recognized that there is a lack of guidance counselors.

asr-000973
01:01:46.880 --> 01:01:49.120
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So we work with DSWD,

asr-000974
01:01:49.120 --> 01:01:53.860
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: meron po silang programa na Tara-Usap,

asr-000975
01:01:53.860 --> 01:01:55.200
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: and may cash for work po iyan

asr-000976
01:01:55.200 --> 01:01:59.120
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: para sa mga volunteers na tutulong sa mental health peer support.

asr-000977
01:01:59.120 --> 01:02:05.960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, hindi po. I think it's not an accident. It's by design na magkasama sa DILG family ang PNP at ang NYC.

asr-000978
01:02:07.600 --> 01:02:13.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nasusundan po ba natin kung nasaan yung incidents, nung mga nabanggit ko kanina ng report ng PNP?

asr-000979
01:02:13.500 --> 01:02:18.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ano po ang ginagawa natin? Halimbawa po, if you have this caravan, kapag may report na ganito sa isang area,

asr-000980
01:02:18.680 --> 01:02:22.500
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nasusundan po ba natin at natatapatan natin ng immediate response, Mr. Chair?

asr-000981
01:02:22.500 --> 01:02:28.060
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Yes, Mr. Chair, naglabas po kami ng mga statements sa mga nangyari.

asr-000982
01:02:28.060 --> 01:02:32.480
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And limited po ang NYC sa pagpapadala ng support.

asr-000983
01:02:32.480 --> 01:02:37.460
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So ang pinakamabilis na magagawa lang po namin is magpadala ng mga facilitators.

asr-000984
01:02:37.460 --> 01:02:45.420
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And siguro I'll take this chance na rin po. Nag-propose po kami ng anti-bullying summit for next year na in-approve naman po ng DBM.

asr-000985
01:02:45.420 --> 01:02:51.440
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So we hope to work with you, Mr. Chair, para gawin yung programa nito for next year. Salamat po.

asr-000986
01:02:52.020 --> 01:02:53.560
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-000987
01:02:53.560 --> 01:02:55.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po halimbawa dito sa report ng PNP,

asr-000988
01:02:55.860 --> 01:02:59.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: merong 12 alleged shooting threats, 4 stabbing incidents,

asr-000989
01:02:59.100 --> 01:03:03.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: 4 arrests for illegal possession of firearms, at dalawang death threats.

asr-000990
01:03:03.240 --> 01:03:09.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung ma-map po natin kung nasaan ito, baka dapat dito rin yung tutok nung ating intervention when it comes to mental health services.

asr-000991
01:03:10.260 --> 01:03:14.680
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, I would like to add as well that nag-partner po kami with META.

asr-000992
01:03:14.680 --> 01:03:18.240
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And currently ongoing po yung META camps namin.

asr-000993
01:03:18.240 --> 01:03:22.920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Tinuturuan po namin per province and select sites how to use the tools of META

asr-000994
01:03:22.920 --> 01:03:28.960
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: kasi currently po marami po daw nagre-report sa META ng mga bullying, so ginawan po kami ng

asr-000995
01:03:28.960 --> 01:03:34.140
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: direct line ng META na kung may magre-report po sa NYC, puwede po namin silang direct na tawagan.

asr-000996
01:03:34.140 --> 01:03:35.800
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So iyon po yung ginagawa namin, Mr. Chair.

asr-000997
01:03:35.800 --> 01:03:37.020
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000998
01:03:37.020 --> 01:03:38.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I agree with the good Secretary.

asr-000999
01:03:38.420 --> 01:03:41.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Malaki po yung papel din ng ating mga tahanan,

asr-001000
01:03:41.720 --> 01:03:48.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kaya nga hindi lamang whole-of-government approach ang kailangan natin dito sa pagtugon sa karahasan sa ating mga eskwelahan,

asr-001001
01:03:48.620 --> 01:03:50.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: kung hindi whole-of-nation approach.

asr-001002
01:03:51.160 --> 01:03:53.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And let me move on to an equally important issue.

asr-001004
01:03:54.040 --> 01:03:59.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Yung issue po ng ating mga mas bata kesa sa mga kabataang pinag-uusapan natin kanina.

asr-001005
01:03:59.380 --> 01:04:07.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sabi po ng EDCOM sa kanilang Early Childhood Dashboard, aabot sa 4,600 na barangay ang walang Child Development Center sa ating bansa.

asr-001006
01:04:08.020 --> 01:04:10.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito po mga CDCs,

asr-001007
01:04:10.100 --> 01:04:13.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: baka mas familiar po ang ating mga kababayan sa tawag na daycare centers.

asr-001008
01:04:13.560 --> 01:04:17.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ulitin ko po, 4,600 na barangay ang walang daycare centers.

asr-001009
01:04:17.840 --> 01:04:22.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ngayon ba lang po pinirmahan ang IRR ng Early Child Care and Development System Act?

asr-001011
01:04:22.820 --> 01:04:26.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa tingin po ba natin sa DILG ay matutugunan na ang kakulangan?

asr-001012
01:04:26.640 --> 01:04:31.140
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sorry, matutugunan na ba ang kakulangan sa daycare centers because of this new law?

asr-001013
01:04:32.080 --> 01:04:36.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the daycare centers are allotted in the budget of the barangay.

asr-001014
01:04:36.180 --> 01:04:37.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It should be part of the barangay budget.

asr-001015
01:04:37.940 --> 01:04:48.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If you look at the DILG budget, sir, 96% is either for MOOE or salaries.

asr-001016
01:04:48.960 --> 01:04:53.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So in terms of this, sir, for additional daycare centers, it is not

asr-001017
01:04:53.680 --> 01:04:56.470
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the DILG's budget that is involved,

asr-001018
01:04:56.480 --> 01:05:02.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but rather the DPWH, the province, and the other local government units that are involved.

asr-001019
01:05:02.640 --> 01:05:08.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And I can imagine, mahalaga po ang magiging papel ng ECCDC para i-facilitate po ito.

asr-001020
01:05:08.980 --> 01:05:13.100
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero napansin ko po, isa yung ECCDC sa mayroong budget cuts this year.

asr-001021
01:05:14.160 --> 01:05:23.350
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, there are 124 million ang budget.

asr-001022
01:05:25.200 --> 01:05:30.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: A lot of this will go, sir, to the feeding program and capacity building for the children, sir.

asr-001023
01:05:31.060 --> 01:05:37.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sige po. Baka mahalaga po na magkaroon ng convergence to be able to facilitate yung gap na ito between the DILG and the other concerned agencies.

asr-001024
01:05:37.840 --> 01:05:38.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You're very cognizant of it, sir.

asr-001025
01:05:39.220 --> 01:05:40.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001027
01:05:42.340 --> 01:05:47.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Punta naman po ako doon sa usapin ng HIV, particularly among young people.

asr-001028
01:05:47.980 --> 01:05:50.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pasensya na po, medyo malapit talaga sa puso ko ito.

asr-001029
01:05:50.260 --> 01:05:53.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This was my area of work when I was working in the NYC.

asr-001030
01:05:53.920 --> 01:05:59.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At nabalitaan po natin, ang NYC mayroong ginawang training program to capacitate the SK

asr-001031
01:05:59.480 --> 01:06:05.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pagdating sa HIV-AIDS programming and budgeting in partnership with our friends from UNAIDS and HASH.

asr-001032
01:06:05.740 --> 01:06:08.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sa anong regions or provinces po natin na-implement yung programa?

asr-001033
01:06:09.180 --> 01:06:12.200
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, nag-pilot po tayo dito sa Metro Manila.

asr-001034
01:06:12.300 --> 01:06:14.080
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Pero ang pinakasignificant po actually,

asr-001035
01:06:14.260 --> 01:06:18.520
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, is yung participation natin sa Love, Laban Pride Parade.

asr-001036
01:06:18.740 --> 01:06:23.920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And this was the first time na nag-attend po ang National Youth Commission actually in 2025.

asr-001037
01:06:25.200 --> 01:06:33.480
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And ito pong 2026, ito po ang pinakamalaking contribution ng gobyerno through the National Youth Commission sa ating LGBTQ Pride Parade.

asr-001038
01:06:33.480 --> 01:06:43.620
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Nagkaroon po tayo ng almost half a million, Mr. Chair, attendees and a lot of them actually went to the booths na meron po tayong HIV tests.

asr-001039
01:06:43.620 --> 01:06:47.100
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So kailangan lang po namin, Mr. Chair, kunin yung mga numero

asr-001040
01:06:47.100 --> 01:06:50.960
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: kung ilan talaga nagpa-test, then we can give it to you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001042
01:06:51.500 --> 01:06:56.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So sa NYC, halos Quezon City lang po yung Love Laban ito na pilot, tama po ba?

asr-001043
01:06:56.800 --> 01:07:03.280
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, actually ang Love Laban po nangyari po iyan in multiple locations at different times to celebrate the pride.

asr-001044
01:07:03.280 --> 01:07:08.550
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So ang count po sa Quezon City is around 300,000.

asr-001045
01:07:08.560 --> 01:07:10.940
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: National po in different parts of the Philippines was 500,000.

asr-001047
01:07:11.240 --> 01:07:16.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ano po ang plano natin to be able to replicate this in other areas around the country?

asr-001048
01:07:16.560 --> 01:07:22.260
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Mr. Chair, sa sobrang maganda na effect na binigay nito sa ating kabataan,

asr-001049
01:07:22.800 --> 01:07:28.080
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: nag-commit po ang NYC for a Visayas and Mindanao leg for the Pride Parade.

asr-001050
01:07:28.080 --> 01:07:33.460
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: However, wala pa po siya sa NEP namin. Meron lang po kaming 5 million for Manila.

asr-001051
01:07:33.680 --> 01:07:40.740
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: But we are requesting sana po para magkaroon tayo ng Visayas at Mindanao leg, an additional 5 million per island-wide po.

asr-001053
01:07:40.880 --> 01:07:41.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So magkano po ang total?

asr-001054
01:07:42.200 --> 01:07:45.900
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Total po is 15 million, Mr. Chair.

asr-001055
01:07:45.900 --> 01:07:51.920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Pero given the nature na binigyan po kami ng 8 million, we are requesting for additional 12 million po.

asr-001056
01:07:51.960 --> 01:07:56.800
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Para kasama na po dito yung kababaihan, kasama na rin po dito yung adolescent sexual reproductive health.

asr-001057
01:07:56.800 --> 01:07:58.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001058
01:07:58.680 --> 01:08:07.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: I cannot overemphasize how important yung intervention among young key population, YKP kung tawagin natin, sa HIV-AIDS programming ng bansa.

asr-001059
01:08:07.060 --> 01:08:12.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And I think the most capable agency to do that would be the NYC in partnership with our SK.

asr-001062
01:08:12.500 --> 01:08:19.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At dahil din po sa fiscal autonomy ng SK, talagang malaki ang puwedeng gawin at the community level ng ating mga youth leaders.

asr-001064
01:08:19.860 --> 01:08:25.440
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para tiyakin na ikakalat natin ang impormasyon, tamang impormasyon for responsible behavior.

asr-001065
01:08:25.440 --> 01:08:30.420
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at maging accessible ang mga services tulad ng testing at iba pa.

asr-001066
01:08:30.540 --> 01:08:35.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At kasama po dito, yung pagbawas ng stigma and discrimination pagdating sa HIV and AIDS.

asr-001067
01:08:35.680 --> 01:08:37.800
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Last questions na lang po.

asr-001068
01:08:39.000 --> 01:08:41.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Alam natin kung gaano kahalaga ang ating mga barangay health workers,

asr-001070
01:08:41.960 --> 01:08:44.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: speaking of frontliners at the community level,

asr-001071
01:08:44.760 --> 01:08:47.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pero sana mas alam po natin ang pinagdadaanan nila.

asr-001072
01:08:47.520 --> 01:08:48.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Hindi ko na po ulitin iyan.

asr-001073
01:08:48.560 --> 01:08:52.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Walang sahod, sa bulsang kinukuha ang pamasahe ng pasyente, et cetera.

asr-001074
01:08:53.380 --> 01:08:55.200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May plano po ba ang DILG

asr-001075
01:08:55.200 --> 01:09:01.000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: na suportahan ang transportation costs ng ating mga BHW at i-cover ang gamot ng kanilang mga pasyente?

asr-001076
01:09:02.360 --> 01:09:11.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Again, sir, the DILG is supervisory over the LGUs who handle the BHWs.

asr-001077
01:09:11.160 --> 01:09:15.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As of current, sir, the BHWs are listed down by the barangay captains, passed on to the municipalities,

asr-001078
01:09:15.420 --> 01:09:22.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and then given allowance by the governors and the other LCEs.

asr-001079
01:09:22.820 --> 01:09:28.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So as far as that is concerned, it is not in our budget but we have supervisory authority over it.

asr-001080
01:09:29.480 --> 01:09:30.080
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Perci,

asr-001081
01:09:30.770 --> 01:09:31.420
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Mr. Chair,

asr-001082
01:09:31.580 --> 01:09:32.580
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Mr. Chair,

asr-001083
01:09:39.260 --> 01:09:39.840
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Interjection.

asr-001084
01:09:40.450 --> 01:09:41.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We do not allow.

asr-001085
01:09:41.420 --> 01:09:47.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Can we let Kong Perci finish his interpellation?

asr-001086
01:09:47.680 --> 01:09:48.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Sorry, Kong Jay.

asr-001087
01:09:50.220 --> 01:09:55.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Napakahalaga po kasi ng papel ng ating mga BHWs and I'm sure that as former governor, you really appreciate that.

asr-001088
01:09:55.820 --> 01:10:02.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: And we would appreciate interventions from the DILG to be able to facilitate this when it comes to the implementation at the LGU level.

asr-001089
01:10:02.580 --> 01:10:10.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, baka po, a set of guidelines, a set of recommendations to the LGU will be very helpful in this area, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001090
01:10:11.120 --> 01:10:12.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well taken, sir.

asr-001091
01:10:12.120 --> 01:10:12.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will do so.

asr-001092
01:10:13.040 --> 01:10:15.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairman. Maraming salamat po.

asr-001093
01:10:15.320 --> 01:10:16.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Perci.

asr-001094
01:10:16.880 --> 01:10:22.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Just to remind everyone, our colleagues, we do not allow any interjection.

asr-001095
01:10:23.560 --> 01:10:24.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-001096
01:10:24.100 --> 01:10:27.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And this is about our rules.

asr-001097
01:10:27.980 --> 01:10:30.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, so, sorry, Congressman Jay Vergara.

asr-001098
01:10:30.920 --> 01:10:36.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next to interpolate, Congressman Bong Teves, you have one minute.

asr-001099
01:10:36.200 --> 01:10:37.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: The good one.

asr-001100
01:10:40.280 --> 01:10:41.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Bong Teves, the good one.

asr-001101
01:10:47.440 --> 01:10:48.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair,

asr-001102
01:10:49.600 --> 01:11:02.980
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The DILG family, of course, the number one agency na pinagtitiwalaan ng sambayan ng Pilipino, Philippine National Police, headed by our PNP chief

asr-001103
01:11:02.980 --> 01:11:04.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Police General Nartatez,

asr-001104
01:11:04.400 --> 01:11:12.580
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: kasama ang masipag na komisyoner ng NAPOLCOM, Commissioner Vicente Calinisan,

asr-001105
01:11:12.580 --> 01:11:18.500
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: and of course, the DOJ Secretary,

asr-001106
01:11:18.500 --> 01:11:31.220
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang ating kumpare, ating matagal nang kaibigan, energetic and handsome Secretary, Secretary Boying Remulla.

asr-001107
01:11:33.620 --> 01:11:36.480
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Good morning po sa inyo lahat.

asr-001108
01:11:39.340 --> 01:11:47.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair, alam naman natin na matagal nang napapabayaan ang Bureau of Fire Protection

asr-001109
01:11:47.080 --> 01:11:53.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: tulad ng sinabi po kanina ng ating kasama, si Congressman Valeriano.

asr-001110
01:11:53.000 --> 01:11:59.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang kanila pong mandato ay bukod sa umapula ng sunog,

asr-001111
01:11:59.000 --> 01:12:02.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ay mag-responde sa natural at man-made disasters.

asr-001112
01:12:04.420 --> 01:12:06.840
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Lagi natin silang nakikita sa kalsada,

asr-001113
01:12:06.880 --> 01:12:08.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: tuwing may kalamidad,

asr-001114
01:12:08.780 --> 01:12:11.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: baha, lindol, sunog,

asr-001115
01:12:11.360 --> 01:12:13.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: lagi silang andiyan.

asr-001116
01:12:14.600 --> 01:12:15.800
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair,

asr-001117
01:12:16.080 --> 01:12:18.820
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang budget ng Bureau of Fire

asr-001118
01:12:18.820 --> 01:12:21.680
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ay tumaas ng Php 2.9 billion

asr-001119
01:12:21.680 --> 01:12:24.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: from Php 35 billion for year 2026

asr-001120
01:12:24.960 --> 01:12:28.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: to Php 38 billion for 2027

asr-001121
01:12:28.520 --> 01:12:32.380
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: pero bumaba naman nang malaki

asr-001122
01:12:32.380 --> 01:12:38.600
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang kanilang capital outlay from P1.4 billion for 2026

asr-001123
01:12:38.600 --> 01:12:44.100
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: to P362 million na lang for year 2027.

asr-001124
01:12:44.660 --> 01:12:46.380
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Malaking kakulangan nito

asr-001125
01:12:46.380 --> 01:12:49.600
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: dahil dapat tayo ay nagpre-prepare para ngayon

asr-001126
01:12:49.600 --> 01:12:56.760
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: sa parating na El Niño sa susunod na taon at iba pang natural disasters.

asr-001132
01:12:57.700 --> 01:13:01.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang PNP ay tumaas ng capital outlay

asr-001133
01:13:01.080 --> 01:13:04.740
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ng 61% from Php 2.4 billion

asr-001134
01:13:04.740 --> 01:13:08.560
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: this 2026 to Php 6.2 billion

asr-001135
01:13:08.560 --> 01:13:10.300
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: for the year 2027.

asr-001136
01:13:10.560 --> 01:13:12.360
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Tama naman

asr-001137
01:13:12.360 --> 01:13:13.860
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: dahil ito po ay ating pinagtitiwalaan.

asr-001138
01:13:15.800 --> 01:13:16.480
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Sir,

asr-001139
01:13:16.480 --> 01:13:18.900
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: kailangan po ng Bureau of Fire Protection

asr-001140
01:13:18.900 --> 01:13:21.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ng 67 new fire stations

asr-001141
01:13:21.080 --> 01:13:22.420
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: sa buong Pilipinas

asr-001142
01:13:22.420 --> 01:13:24.420
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: tulad ng hiningi ko

asr-001143
01:13:24.420 --> 01:13:26.040
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: sa ating butihing Secretary

asr-001144
01:13:26.040 --> 01:13:27.700
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: na lagyan ng

asr-001145
01:13:27.700 --> 01:13:30.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: isang fire station

asr-001146
01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:31.940
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ang Virac at ito naman ay kanyang

asr-001147
01:13:31.940 --> 01:13:32.480
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: pinangako.

asr-001148
01:13:33.480 --> 01:13:35.420
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: 74 collapsed structures

asr-001149
01:13:35.420 --> 01:13:37.740
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: and rescue trucks para sa bawat

asr-001150
01:13:37.740 --> 01:13:39.680
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: probinsya. Dahil sa

asr-001151
01:13:39.680 --> 01:13:42.260
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: kasalukuyan, mayroon

asr-001152
01:13:42.260 --> 01:13:44.500
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: lamang silang 8 rescue trucks

asr-001153
01:13:44.500 --> 01:13:46.380
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: and additional

asr-001154
01:13:46.380 --> 01:13:48.540
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: 2,000

asr-001155
01:13:48.540 --> 01:13:50.500
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: BFP

asr-001156
01:13:50.500 --> 01:13:52.540
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: personnel. Tama rin po

asr-001157
01:13:52.540 --> 01:13:54.660
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: yung sinabi ng ating

asr-001158
01:13:54.660 --> 01:13:57.660
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: kasamang congressman dito. Ito, kada

asr-001159
01:13:57.660 --> 01:13:58.940
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: taon para mas

asr-001160
01:13:58.940 --> 01:14:00.600
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: malawak ang kanilang

asr-001161
01:14:00.600 --> 01:14:02.680
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: emergency and rescue response.

asr-001162
01:14:05.040 --> 01:14:06.420
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001163
01:14:06.960 --> 01:14:08.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The reason for

asr-001164
01:14:08.440 --> 01:14:10.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the reduction

asr-001165
01:14:10.360 --> 01:14:12.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the capital outlay was because we had

asr-001166
01:14:12.140 --> 01:14:14.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to reconstitute our procurement

asr-001167
01:14:14.280 --> 01:14:15.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: program for the BFP.

asr-001168
01:14:16.140 --> 01:14:17.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Before I entered,

asr-001169
01:14:17.920 --> 01:14:19.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the corruption

asr-001170
01:14:19.160 --> 01:14:21.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the procurement in the

asr-001171
01:14:21.480 --> 01:14:22.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: BFP was

asr-001172
01:14:22.880 --> 01:14:25.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: rampant. But now

asr-001173
01:14:25.680 --> 01:14:27.940
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: now that we have instituted a system,

asr-001174
01:14:28.180 --> 01:14:29.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: you will see that in this year,

asr-001175
01:14:30.060 --> 01:14:31.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: calendar year 2027,

asr-001176
01:14:31.620 --> 01:14:34.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the capital outlay will increase

asr-001177
01:14:34.040 --> 01:14:36.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because we have instituted reforms

asr-001178
01:14:36.440 --> 01:14:37.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and systems so that the

asr-001179
01:14:37.920 --> 01:14:40.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: corruption which used to be endemic before in the department

asr-001180
01:14:40.300 --> 01:14:41.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: will now

asr-001181
01:14:41.920 --> 01:14:44.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: be almost zero.

asr-001182
01:14:44.020 --> 01:14:45.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That is in the procurement,

asr-001183
01:14:46.320 --> 01:14:47.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that is in the recruitment,

asr-001184
01:14:47.720 --> 01:14:49.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that is in the deployment.

asr-001185
01:14:49.140 --> 01:14:51.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: All of that, sir, we have reformed

asr-001186
01:14:51.880 --> 01:14:53.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and now you can expect a more

asr-001187
01:14:53.580 --> 01:14:56.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: streamlined and efficient BFP.

asr-001188
01:14:57.840 --> 01:14:59.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001189
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:14.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Isa rin sa napunako rito. Tumaas ng halos 16 billion ang budget ng PNP pero bumaba naman ng halos P150M ang panukalang budget ng NAPOLCOM.

asr-001190
01:15:15.460 --> 01:15:25.740
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Paano po natin mapapalakas ang ating kapulisan kung babawasan natin ang pondong nakalaan para sa kanilang supervision, discipline at accountability?

asr-001191
01:15:26.740 --> 01:15:42.320
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Hindi po ba sapat na nagdagdag lamang ng pondo ng PNP? Kailangan din nating palakasin ang ahensyang tumitiyak na ang ating mga pulis ay propesyonal, disiplinado at mananagot sa batas.

asr-001192
01:15:43.000 --> 01:15:43.820
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair,

asr-001193
01:15:43.860 --> 01:15:53.200
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kung kinakailangan, i-encourage po natin ang ating mga kasama na mga congressman na dagdagan ang pondo ng DILG,

asr-001194
01:15:53.280 --> 01:16:02.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: bakit hindi nang sa ganoon ang mga importanteng ahensiya na nandito po ngayon under ng DILG ay ating pong masuportahan?

asr-001195
01:16:03.440 --> 01:16:08.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much, Chair. I would like to commend the performance of the NAPOLCOM.

asr-001196
01:16:08.940 --> 01:16:15.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: When we assumed office in 2024, there was a 15,000 case backlog in the cases in NAPOLCOM.

asr-001197
01:16:15.480 --> 01:16:23.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Some dated up to 2001. So the cases were 25 years old and unacted upon.

asr-001198
01:16:23.380 --> 01:16:41.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Upon the leadership of our VCEO, in a matter of one year, we eliminated all 15,000 cases, disposed of it, rendered judgment on it, and now we have a zero backlog profile in the NAPOLCOM.

asr-001199
01:16:41.000 --> 01:16:43.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, the reason for the reduction of this, sir,

asr-001200
01:16:43.900 --> 01:16:52.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is what the Chair VCEO requested and what the DBM approved are two different things.

asr-001201
01:16:53.060 --> 01:16:59.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, if you can accommodate the request of the Vice Chairman for the budget needed, that would be most greatly appreciated.

asr-001202
01:17:01.040 --> 01:17:06.820
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Siguro naman napakinggan natin ang paliwanag ng ating butihing Secretary.

asr-001203
01:17:07.420 --> 01:17:10.260
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Siguro pagtulong-tulungan natin dagdagan ang pondo.

asr-001204
01:17:11.000 --> 01:17:13.000
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: And lastly, Mr. Chair,

asr-001205
01:17:13.180 --> 01:17:19.740
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: last week, nagkaroon po ng matinding pagbaha sa Metro Manila.

asr-001206
01:17:20.420 --> 01:17:27.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Halos nakita natin kung paano pumara ang basura sa kanal.

asr-001207
01:17:28.720 --> 01:17:39.760
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: The DILG is in charge of overseeing the LGU on the implementation of solid waste management under Republic Act 9003.

asr-001208
01:17:39.760 --> 01:17:43.520
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang katanungan ko po, meron na po ba ngang

asr-001209
01:17:43.520 --> 01:17:45.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: naimbestigahang

asr-001210
01:17:45.400 --> 01:17:50.440
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: siyudad tungkol po rito

asr-001211
01:17:50.440 --> 01:17:58.640
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: at tulad po ng sinasabi ng ating isang butihing Secretary, Secretary Boying Remulla,

asr-001212
01:17:58.700 --> 01:18:06.960
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: na merong mga siyudad o bayan na may korupsiyon sa basura.

asr-001213
01:18:06.960 --> 01:18:14.680
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ang akala po ni Congressman Bong Teves ng TGP Party-list ay may kita sa basura.

asr-001214
01:18:15.220 --> 01:18:18.260
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Ngayon po, may korupsiyon na pala sa basura.

asr-001215
01:18:19.620 --> 01:18:20.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you very much, sir.

asr-001216
01:18:21.060 --> 01:18:25.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think the greater defect lies in the local government code

asr-001217
01:18:25.840 --> 01:18:36.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that we have to redefine. According to the local government code, waste disposal is on the municipal and city level.

asr-001218
01:18:37.120 --> 01:18:45.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So let's say Catanduanes, it is not the governor who is in charge who creates a master plan for

asr-001219
01:18:45.360 --> 01:18:47.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: garbage collection.

asr-001220
01:18:48.200 --> 01:18:53.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is a plan of each and every municipality that is not necessarily integrated.

asr-001221
01:18:54.620 --> 01:18:59.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So garbage collection is a scale business.

asr-001222
01:18:59.780 --> 01:19:10.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If a small municipality engages in contracts left by themselves, then the costs become higher and more inefficient.

asr-001223
01:19:10.760 --> 01:19:15.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If we can restudy the local government code to make it a regional program,

asr-001224
01:19:15.700 --> 01:19:23.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: a regional approach to solving the garbage problem, then that can be more efficient, sir.

asr-001225
01:19:25.120 --> 01:19:26.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001226
01:19:26.600 --> 01:19:31.460
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Siguro ang kailangan din nating i-revisit ang Republic Act 9003.

asr-001227
01:19:31.680 --> 01:19:32.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001228
01:19:32.420 --> 01:19:37.640
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: And lastly, Mr. Chair, may I know what the stage of the,

asr-001229
01:19:37.720 --> 01:19:43.620
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: with regards to the hazing accident na nangyari po kay Mark Kenneth Alcedo?

asr-001230
01:19:45.820 --> 01:19:46.340
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At

asr-001231
01:19:46.340 --> 01:19:47.120
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: alam ko po

asr-001232
01:19:47.120 --> 01:19:47.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ito'y

asr-001234
01:19:47.400 --> 01:19:52.400
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: naimbestigahan ng ating NAPOLCOM through sa CIDG.

asr-001235
01:19:52.400 --> 01:19:55.120
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kasi ang lumalabas po sa aming pag-

asr-001236
01:19:55.120 --> 01:19:59.380
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: aaral

asr-001237
01:19:59.380 --> 01:20:02.500
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: ay isa pong PNP ang leader nito.

asr-001238
01:20:02.680 --> 01:20:12.280
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At kayo po mismo, Secretary, ang nagsabi sa akin na pagtulungan natin na ma-resolve ang kasong ito at huwag nang maulit.

asr-001239
01:20:12.540 --> 01:20:16.620
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Kaya siguro, nandito po ang ating PNP chief.

asr-001240
01:20:17.920 --> 01:20:27.860
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Sana maaksyunan po ninyo ito, lalong-lalo na ang leader pong involved dito ay isang kabaro ninyo, ay colonel ng PNP.

asr-001241
01:20:28.040 --> 01:20:29.540
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-001242
01:20:29.640 --> 01:20:30.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001243
01:20:30.460 --> 01:20:34.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: This regards to the death of a student in Dasmariñas, Cavite.

asr-001244
01:20:35.640 --> 01:20:40.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have almost—I think we have resolved the case already.

asr-001245
01:20:41.000 --> 01:20:44.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But the anti-hazing law must be strengthened even more.

asr-001246
01:20:45.780 --> 01:20:46.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: As of now,

asr-001247
01:20:47.000 --> 01:20:55.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: as of now, the PNP has been vigilant in their own departments, the PNPA.

asr-001248
01:20:55.680 --> 01:20:57.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, in school-based,

asr-001249
01:20:57.680 --> 01:21:02.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in community-based organizations, we have a more difficult time in monitoring that.

asr-001250
01:21:02.780 --> 01:21:12.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think the best way to do that is to have a community-based ID so that we will know the actors in these certain communities.

asr-001251
01:21:12.560 --> 01:21:14.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But that case has been solved, sir.

asr-001252
01:21:15.160 --> 01:21:15.720
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Okay.

asr-001253
01:21:16.220 --> 01:21:17.640
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001255
01:21:18.700 --> 01:21:28.180
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Mr. Chair, this representation manifests its full support of the proposed budget of the Department of Interior and Local Government

asr-001256
01:21:28.900 --> 01:21:34.460
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: under the productive leadership of Secretary Boying Remulla.

asr-001257
01:21:35.000 --> 01:21:44.080
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: At tulad ng sinasabi ko po, I encourage my fellow congressmen to support the budget of the DILG as an agency.

asr-001258
01:21:44.280 --> 01:21:45.120
Rep. Jose "Bong" J. Teves Jr.: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001259
01:21:45.200 --> 01:21:47.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Bong Teves.

asr-001261
01:21:47.900 --> 01:21:52.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next to interpellate, we have Representative Sarah Jane Elago.

asr-001262
01:21:52.740 --> 01:21:53.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ma'am, you have the floor.

asr-001263
01:21:55.600 --> 01:21:57.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you, maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-001264
01:21:57.300 --> 01:22:03.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa Philippine Commission on Women, may malaking budget cut na P27 million para sa susunod na taon.

asr-001265
01:22:04.120 --> 01:22:13.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maaaring niyo bang maibahagi sa atin kung paano maapektuhan ang inyong napakahalagang mandato at serbisyo pagdating sa napakalaking makakalta sa inyong pondo?

asr-001266
01:22:16.920 --> 01:22:17.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: PCW?

asr-001268
01:22:17.820 --> 01:22:20.540
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: Thank you very much for that question

asr-001269
01:22:20.540 --> 01:22:22.240
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: and magandang umaga po sa ating lahat.

asr-001270
01:22:22.240 --> 01:22:37.620
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: The Philippine Commission on Women has asked for P266,360,000 and it was given only P177,000.

asr-001271
01:22:37.680 --> 01:22:41.840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, can we request the PCW Chair to move closer to the microphone?

asr-001272
01:22:42.780 --> 01:22:47.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kindly speak closer to the microphone. We can't really hear you, ma'am. Thank you.

asr-001275
01:22:51.620 --> 01:22:53.140
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: I'm closer, ma'am.

asr-001275-split-1
01:22:53.900 --> 01:22:54.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Please, pakilapit po sa inyo.

asr-001276
01:22:55.780 --> 01:23:14.760
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: The areas of our work which will be affected by the cuts in our budget proposal are basically the areas of regionalization because last year you gave us like P30 million and we are now in the Visayas because of the support that was given by this committee.

asr-001277
01:23:14.760 --> 01:23:20.960
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: And we hope that before the end of the administration of the President, we can go to Mindanao.

asr-001278
01:23:21.460 --> 01:23:29.360
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: If we can be given another P30 million, but for the rest, we are prepared to live with what we are given.

asr-001279
01:23:30.020 --> 01:23:40.800
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: I think that the most important part of our work is to be able to reach the women. We are 51 years now, but this is the only time that we are moving down to the local level.

asr-001280
01:23:42.880 --> 01:23:55.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nag-issue ang PCW ng proper utilization and safeguards para sa GAD. Kumusta ho ang inyong assessment sa ating mga national government agencies

asr-001281
01:23:55.400 --> 01:24:02.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and bureaus pagdating sa kanilang GAD compliance? Mahalaga ito, Mr. Chair, dahil at least 5% dapat na gagastos para sa gender and development mandate.

asr-001282
01:24:02.600 --> 01:24:09.020
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: Tama po iyan kasi if we have a policy, we have a very strong policy on women, but if we don't have a budget, then that is a joke.

asr-001283
01:24:09.720 --> 01:24:19.460
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: So we have strengthened our approach in GAD planning and budgeting with our partnership with the Commission on Human Rights,

asr-001284
01:24:19.600 --> 01:24:22.840
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: which is the ombuds machinery of the Philippines for gender equality.

asr-001285
01:24:23.220 --> 01:24:37.620
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: And just to show you that we have improved a lot, as of 2025, December, we had 378 government agencies that were registered in our gender mainstreaming system,

asr-001286
01:24:37.940 --> 01:24:51.640
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: which means that they are submitting and complying. But as of now, July 2026, we have 488, which is about 77.46% compliance in a period of six months.

asr-001287
01:24:51.640 --> 01:25:04.400
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: Because what we did is we reminded the heads of government agencies about their liability, that they can be charged administratively if they do not comply with the provisions of the Magna Carta of Women.

asr-001288
01:25:04.400 --> 01:25:18.360
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: So we are pushing hard to get things done. And we are also focusing on assessment of the performance because after one year, they submit their annual report and we assess the performance.

asr-001289
01:25:18.780 --> 01:25:22.580
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: And before, we used to focus on how much was allocated,

asr-001290
01:25:22.580 --> 01:25:32.580
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: how much was spent. But this year, we are focusing on what has been the good or the benefits that has reached women as a result of the expenditures on the GAD budget.

asr-001291
01:25:32.580 --> 01:25:42.280
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: And we are now in the process of assessment. By September, we will be providing awards to those who are complying well.

asr-001292
01:25:42.660 --> 01:25:48.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, mahalaga ang regionalization at pagtitiyak ng GAD compliance ng ating mga NGAs.

asr-001293
01:25:48.520 --> 01:25:52.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya dapat ma-restore ang budget ng PCW doon

asr-001294
01:25:52.280 --> 01:25:59.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa 2026 level at kung kaya pa ngang mataasan para magawa nila ang kanilang napakahalagang mandato.

asr-001295
01:25:59.180 --> 01:26:06.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, pagdating naman sa ECCDC, ito ay nalipat na mula sa DepEd at tungo sa DILG.

asr-001296
01:26:06.540 --> 01:26:14.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit sa paglipat na ito, nakita rin natin iyong napakalaking budget cut para po sa kanilang pondo para sa 2027.

asr-001297
01:26:15.580 --> 01:26:19.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mababawasan ng P232 million para sa taong 2027.

asr-001298
01:26:19.960 --> 01:26:22.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: What explains this huge budget cut?

asr-001299
01:26:29.520 --> 01:26:31.750
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kindly answer, please.

asr-001300
01:26:31.760 --> 01:26:38.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, we submitted the budget to the DBM and that we thought was adequate.

asr-001301
01:26:40.520 --> 01:26:44.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, DBM was the one who cut our budget so that is what was presented.

asr-001302
01:26:44.980 --> 01:26:50.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If it could be restored as we asked, then I think we will have a more effective and usable budget, ma'am.

asr-001303
01:26:51.880 --> 01:26:53.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001304
01:26:53.120 --> 01:26:57.620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sorry. Mr. Chair, can we hear from the ECCDC

asr-001305
01:26:57.620 --> 01:27:03.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: how this huge budget cut will affect their services and their mandate for 2027?

asr-001306
01:27:04.380 --> 01:27:05.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ma'am, kayo na ba?

asr-001307
01:27:06.160 --> 01:27:20.440
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: Mr. Chair, Your Honor, the conversion of this daycare center and child development center will be affected greatly.

asr-001308
01:27:20.720 --> 01:27:23.820
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: Because we do not have the FALGU.

asr-001309
01:27:23.820 --> 01:27:33.920
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: Actually, funding only covers the rehabilitation and repair of the DCC, not including contents as provided in GAA.

asr-001310
01:27:34.280 --> 01:27:47.580
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: Procurement of content for CDC ensures provision of appropriate learning materials, furniture, fixtures, and other essential components for child learning and development.

asr-001311
01:27:47.580 --> 01:28:00.280
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: The ECCD Council allotted content [unclear] 360 only from [unclear] under the [unclear].

asr-001314
01:28:01.900 --> 01:28:08.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ibig sabihin ba, Mr. Chair, ilan ho ang bago nating itatayo na CDC for 2027?

asr-001315
01:28:13.000 --> 01:28:18.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang tingin po kasi dito, Mr. Chair, parang napunta na po lahat sa barangay at sa LGU yung responsibility.

asr-001316
01:28:18.960 --> 01:28:28.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero yung dati po natin na ninanais na palakasin talaga yung programa natin para sa child care ay hindi na po natin makita sa ating national budget.

asr-001317
01:28:30.800 --> 01:28:47.420
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: Your Honor, Mr. Chair, after validation with some provincial social welfare development, we lack all 3,743 centerless barangay.

asr-001318
01:28:49.780 --> 01:28:52.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At ang pondo po niyan, dapat saan po nakalagay?

asr-001319
01:28:54.580 --> 01:28:58.880
ECCD Council Executive Director Dr. Teresita G. Inciong: Under the new law, nasa LGU.

asr-001320
01:28:59.200 --> 01:29:05.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nasa LGU. Iyan nga ho, ang malaking problema dito, Mr. Chair.

asr-001321
01:29:05.000 --> 01:29:12.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pinalakas natin iyong batas, pero pagdating naman sa pondo, pinasa natin lahat sa LGU.

asr-001322
01:29:12.400 --> 01:29:19.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi naman po lahat ay may kakayahan para pondohan itong pagtatayo ng ating napakahalagang mga child development centers.

asr-001323
01:29:19.400 --> 01:29:26.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya ho, at a proper time, magpo-propose tayo ng special line item para po mapondohan itong mga child development centers na kailangan natin sa buong bansa.

asr-001324
01:29:26.600 --> 01:29:29.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Mr. Chair, pagdating ho

asr-001325
01:29:29.200 --> 01:29:39.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa temporary shelters para sa VAW victim-survivors at sa situation ng ating barangay VAW officers, may study ang PCW na tumatanggap ang mga barangay VAW desk officers

asr-001326
01:29:39.580 --> 01:29:43.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng nasa P500 lang na honorarium kada buwan.

asr-001327
01:29:43.560 --> 01:29:49.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napakababa po nito kumpara doon sa napakalaki nilang responsibility sa ating mga barangay.

asr-001328
01:29:49.200 --> 01:29:56.460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napag-aralan n'yo na ho ba kung ano iyong mga dapat nating gawin para matiyak na mapalakas ang mga barangay VAW desk officers

asr-001329
01:29:56.460 --> 01:30:00.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at madagdagan iyong kanilang mga natatanggap na kompensasyon?

asr-001330
01:30:02.260 --> 01:30:05.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: The DILG or the PCW can answer, Mr. Chair.

asr-001331
01:30:10.760 --> 01:30:16.400
PCW Chairperson Ermelita V. Valdeavilla: I would refer to the Secretary on this because we do not have a mandate at the local level.

asr-001332
01:30:18.780 --> 01:30:21.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Pardon me, ma'am. Can you, if I can...

asr-001333
01:30:21.820 --> 01:30:24.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, sana hindi po mabawas sa aking oras.

asr-001334
01:30:24.220 --> 01:30:24.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-001335
01:30:24.980 --> 01:30:30.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tinanong ko iyong kalagayan ng ating barangay VAW desk officers na madalas ay mga kagawad rin.

asr-001336
01:30:30.760 --> 01:30:35.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At napakaliit ng natatanggap na honorarium, nasa P500.

asr-001337
01:30:35.120 --> 01:30:40.780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pinapaaral po natin kung paano ba natin matitiyak na mas mataas yung kanilang compensation,

asr-001338
01:30:41.520 --> 01:30:45.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkaroon ng hazard pay dahil hindi po madali yung kanilang ginagawa.

asr-001339
01:30:45.300 --> 01:30:51.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Minsan 25-8 po iyan on-call iyong trabaho ng mga barangay VAW desk officers natin.

asr-001340
01:30:51.480 --> 01:30:57.520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May programa at mga bagong policy ba tayo para ma-improve naman yung kalagayan ng kanilang trabaho?

asr-001341
01:30:57.880 --> 01:31:00.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, that question is larger

asr-001342
01:31:00.720 --> 01:31:02.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: than what you have asked.

asr-001343
01:31:02.720 --> 01:31:09.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If you look at a barangay, on a barangay level, meron silang lupon ng tagapayapa,

asr-001344
01:31:09.700 --> 01:31:12.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: meron silang barangay tanod, meron silang barangay health workers,

asr-001345
01:31:13.260 --> 01:31:17.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: meron silang nutrition scholars, meron silang marami po iyan eh.

asr-001346
01:31:17.700 --> 01:31:20.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It adds to something like 50 to 60 per barangay.

asr-001347
01:31:21.200 --> 01:31:30.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Now, in the previous Congress, they tried to pass the Magna Carta for barangay health workers.

asr-001348
01:31:30.780 --> 01:31:37.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But it was opposed because there would have been a Barangay Magna Carta for Barangay tanods,

asr-001349
01:31:37.140 --> 01:31:39.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Barangay Magna Carta for all the others.

asr-001350
01:31:40.660 --> 01:31:48.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, that question cannot be easily answered by giving priority to one at the expense of the others.

asr-001351
01:31:48.120 --> 01:32:00.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So it is a balancing act that the local government addresses and to what capacity that they can fulfill the expectation.

asr-001352
01:32:01.780 --> 01:32:02.200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Okay.

asr-001353
01:32:02.960 --> 01:32:07.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating sa gender sensitivity training, hindi lang ng mga barangay VAW desk officers,

asr-001354
01:32:08.280 --> 01:32:13.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi ng lahat ng ating mga barangay workers, ito madalas sa LGU pa rin po,

asr-001355
01:32:13.340 --> 01:32:16.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kinukuha yung ating mga pondo para rito.

asr-001356
01:32:16.140 --> 01:32:21.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At tinatawagan natin iyong PCW, again, para matiyak na iyong mga kinakailangang training

asr-001357
01:32:21.300 --> 01:32:30.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at iyong tulong na rin para sa stress debriefing ng mga officers natin at mga workers natin at the barangay level,

asr-001358
01:32:30.400 --> 01:32:37.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na frontliners natin sa ganitong tipo ng mga kaso, ay mabibigyan din ng karampatang suporta.

asr-001359
01:32:37.180 --> 01:32:40.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon, pagdating naman po sa sexual assault investigation kit,

asr-001360
01:32:40.000 --> 01:32:50.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: naglabas ang DILG ng memorandum circular tungkol sa pagsusulong ng paggamit ng SAKIT na locally made

asr-001361
01:32:50.500 --> 01:32:54.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa ating women and children protection units.

asr-001362
01:32:54.400 --> 01:32:57.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May nakalaan ba na pondo para rito ang DILG?

asr-001363
01:32:59.840 --> 01:33:05.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's a local matter, ma'am, that we encourage them to address within their budget.

asr-001364
01:33:07.180 --> 01:33:10.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Again, Mr. Chair, wala na naman pong pondo para rito.

asr-001365
01:33:10.680 --> 01:33:21.240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya kung hindi man sa DILG, puwede po nating tingnan halimbawa sa DOH kung mapasok sa mga WCTU funding nila,

asr-001366
01:33:21.360 --> 01:33:29.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: iyong napakahalagang SAKIT, iyong access sa justice at iyong paghabol sa mga perpetrators ng gender-based violence,

asr-001367
01:33:30.080 --> 01:33:32.860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mahalaga po iyong timely collection ng forensic evidence.

asr-001368
01:33:33.100 --> 01:33:33.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-001369
01:33:33.380 --> 01:33:40.120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating naman po sa PNP-related na VAWC, naglabas po kayo ng policy on addressing VAWC among PNP personnel.

asr-001370
01:33:40.480 --> 01:33:40.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes.

asr-001371
01:33:41.300 --> 01:33:50.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit nakita po namin dito sa inyong policy na pinapayagan n'yo na magkaroon ng pag-uusap, marriage counseling

asr-001372
01:33:50.920 --> 01:33:55.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: doon sa VAWC victim at sa kanyang asawa na PNP personnel.

asr-001373
01:33:56.640 --> 01:33:59.480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito pa rin po ba iyong policy ngayon ng PNP?

asr-001374
01:33:59.560 --> 01:34:00.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ito iyong policy.

asr-001375
01:34:07.780 --> 01:34:31.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is an existing policy, ma'am, that we try to reconcile the differences within the department, but of course it has its limits, so how it is resolved eventually is beyond our control, but it has to be a mutual agreement within the two parties that the case in the VAWC.

asr-001377
01:34:32.260 --> 01:34:37.600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, ang violence against women and their children ay isang krimen sa ating mga batas.

asr-001378
01:34:37.600 --> 01:34:43.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ito simpleng away lang ng mag-asawa na pribado kahit pa po involved ang PNP personnel.

asr-001379
01:34:43.520 --> 01:34:45.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I want to give you an example.

asr-001380
01:34:46.080 --> 01:34:54.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The provincial director of Batangas was relieved of duty and about to be relieved from service

asr-001381
01:34:54.520 --> 01:35:01.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: by a simple text message alone to a fellow policewoman.

asr-001382
01:35:01.100 --> 01:35:03.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We take it very seriously, ma'am.

asr-001383
01:35:03.000 --> 01:35:05.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That if there is

asr-001384
01:35:05.180 --> 01:35:08.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: harassment among the ranks, that we will file the appropriate charges, whoever they may be.

asr-001385
01:35:08.980 --> 01:35:16.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: In fact, maybe a member of Congress was also charged by the PNP for violence against women

asr-001386
01:35:17.620 --> 01:35:21.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: among the security personnel and the charges have been filed by the DOJ.

asr-001387
01:35:21.780 --> 01:35:23.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We do not allow, ma'am.

asr-001388
01:35:23.280 --> 01:35:27.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I particularly am very sensitive about this.

asr-001389
01:35:27.000 --> 01:35:30.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If there is any complaint against harassment of women personnel in the PNP,

asr-001390
01:35:30.900 --> 01:35:33.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I take it very seriously and I prosecute.

asr-001391
01:35:33.180 --> 01:35:34.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I prosecute it to the best of my ability.

asr-001392
01:35:35.680 --> 01:35:40.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat n'yo pong baguhin itong policy na ito kasi sa ilalim pong ng anti-VAWC law,

asr-001393
01:35:40.720 --> 01:35:42.740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: bawal pong ang pag-aareglo.

asr-001394
01:35:42.740 --> 01:35:45.920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Lalong-lalo na po doon sa mga kaso po ng physical abuse.

asr-001395
01:35:46.800 --> 01:35:48.560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po dapat ito pinapayagan.

asr-001396
01:35:48.620 --> 01:35:50.320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ito iyong simpleng away lang.

asr-001397
01:35:50.900 --> 01:35:52.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, I get it.

asr-001398
01:35:52.520 --> 01:35:54.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po ay a VAWC case.

asr-001399
01:35:54.720 --> 01:36:00.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po pagdating sa VAWC case, dapat po kasama rin po iyong PNP doon sa susunod sa ating Anti-VAWC Act.

asr-001400
01:36:00.840 --> 01:36:02.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Okay. We will, duly noted, ma'am,

asr-001401
01:36:02.320 --> 01:36:03.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and we will make the necessary adjustments.

asr-001402
01:36:04.300 --> 01:36:04.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Alright.

asr-001403
01:36:04.840 --> 01:36:18.280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pagdating naman po dito sa, nakakuha po kami ng report na meron pa rin pong insensitibo na mga nilalabas na anti-rape prevention post ang Philippine National Police.

asr-001404
01:36:18.860 --> 01:36:23.020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kamusta po ang inyong guidelines pagdating dito?

asr-001405
01:36:23.020 --> 01:36:24.540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ito po iyong ilan sa mga nakarating sa aming office.

asr-001406
01:36:26.720 --> 01:36:30.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano po ba yung policy n'yo pagdating dito sa anti-rape prevention

asr-001407
01:36:30.420 --> 01:36:32.140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: guidelines and

asr-001408
01:36:32.140 --> 01:36:32.580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: posting?

asr-001409
01:36:32.800 --> 01:36:37.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: These are, ma'am, just guidelines what to do just in case.

asr-001410
01:36:38.840 --> 01:36:43.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But, ma'am, I would like to add that in our Safer Cities campaign,

asr-001411
01:36:43.920 --> 01:36:48.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: rape has gone down by 60% from April to August.

asr-001412
01:36:49.200 --> 01:36:56.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Simply because that we increase enforcement of loitering in the streets, drinking in the streets,

asr-001413
01:36:57.500 --> 01:37:01.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: shirtless individuals, minors, curfew.

asr-001414
01:37:02.060 --> 01:37:05.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Rape has drastically gone down and I think the statistics will bear it out.

asr-001415
01:37:06.660 --> 01:37:12.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Chair, bakit po ito nire-report sa amin sa Gabriela Women's Party?

asr-001416
01:37:12.260 --> 01:37:27.760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi po, tulad nitong sumigaw ng saklolo, alam n'yo po ba na numero uno hong nangyayari sa mga biktima ng sexual assault at rape ay iyong involuntary freeze dahil po sa takot, sa matinding takot.

asr-001417
01:37:27.900 --> 01:37:32.340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po sobrang insensitibo po ng ganitong tipo ng mga

asr-001418
01:37:32.340 --> 01:37:37.640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: post na sinisisi pa yung mga aksyon ng biktima.

asr-001419
01:37:37.900 --> 01:37:47.260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tulad po ng paglalakad halimbawa sa gabi, paano po iyong mga BPO workers natin na nagtatrabaho at hindi po maiwasan na maglakad ho mag-isa.

asr-001420
01:37:47.260 --> 01:37:57.180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So ang tugon, DILG matter din naman po, siyempre, pagtitiyak po ng maayos na lighting, ligtas na kalsada, ligtas na mga siyudad, katulad ng mga nasabi ninyo.

asr-001421
01:37:57.200 --> 01:38:01.220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At pagtitiyak na iyong anti-rape prevention post po natin,

asr-001422
01:38:01.220 --> 01:38:03.500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nakatutok sa saan ba lalapit?

asr-001423
01:38:03.520 --> 01:38:04.800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano iyong mga hotlines?

asr-001424
01:38:05.040 --> 01:38:06.300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano iyong mga referral system?

asr-001425
01:38:06.780 --> 01:38:12.960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ano iyong mga psychosocial services, legal assistance para sa mga nabibiktima ng rape?

asr-001426
01:38:12.960 --> 01:38:20.720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At pagpapaalala din na huwag mang-rape at habang-buhay ang pagkakakulong para sa ganyang tipo ng seryosong krimen.

asr-001427
01:38:20.900 --> 01:38:24.380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat baguhin ito, Mr. Chair, ng DILG, ng PNP,

asr-001428
01:38:24.500 --> 01:38:32.040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sana po may malinaw na commitment na ma-take down ang ganitong tipo ng mga post at palitan natin ang gender-sensitive na mga posters.

asr-001429
01:38:32.360 --> 01:38:32.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-001431
01:38:33.120 --> 01:38:39.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, just as a rejoinder, this has been corrected already.

asr-001432
01:38:39.420 --> 01:38:44.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But also, according to the latest research by OCTA,

asr-001433
01:38:44.400 --> 01:38:52.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: as of from last quarter to this quarter, 63% of women now feel safer going home alone from their jobs.

asr-001434
01:38:53.160 --> 01:38:56.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So I think that's a testament to the PNP and the Safer Cities campaign.

asr-001435
01:38:56.800 --> 01:38:59.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: However, it is not perfect and we will do better.

asr-001436
01:38:59.800 --> 01:39:00.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you.

asr-001437
01:39:00.420 --> 01:39:02.400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Just a short manifestation, Mr. Chair.

asr-001438
01:39:02.520 --> 01:39:02.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Go ahead, ma'am.

asr-001439
01:39:03.160 --> 01:39:03.360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Opo.

asr-001440
01:39:03.720 --> 01:39:10.420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May mga documents din po kami na i-request po from DILG, PNP, at sa ating mga attached agencies.

asr-001441
01:39:10.660 --> 01:39:19.000
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At PNP din po ang naglabas ng mahalagang statistics na 1 out of 10 gender-based violence victims ang hindi po nagre-report dahil sa takot.

asr-001442
01:39:19.160 --> 01:39:26.980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po dapat manguna rin tayo doon sa paglaban sa victim blaming, shaming at iyong stigma na natatanggap po ng mga biktima.

asr-001443
01:39:27.120 --> 01:39:31.060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair, at maraming salamat po sa mga kasagutan.

asr-001445
01:39:31.660 --> 01:39:32.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-001446
01:39:32.480 --> 01:39:33.460
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Kong Sara.

asr-001447
01:39:34.180 --> 01:39:41.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Before we proceed, I would like to ask our secretary, would you like a break or working lunch?

asr-001450
01:39:42.400 --> 01:39:45.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: To our colleagues, we'll proceed.

asr-001451
01:39:45.320 --> 01:39:46.420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Working lunch, continue.

asr-001452
01:39:46.820 --> 01:39:47.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-001453
01:39:47.500 --> 01:39:48.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, thank you.

asr-001454
01:39:48.320 --> 01:39:59.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, before I call on the next interpellator, I would like to recognize the presence of Assistant Minority Leader Robert Nazal,

asr-001455
01:40:01.200 --> 01:40:02.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Vice Chairperson,

asr-001456
01:40:02.080 --> 01:40:04.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Christopher Go, my co-sponsor,

asr-001457
01:40:06.660 --> 01:40:09.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Vice Chairperson, Rommel Rico Angara,

asr-001458
01:40:09.340 --> 01:40:12.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Vice Chairperson, Maria Carmen Zamora, ma'am,

asr-001459
01:40:12.700 --> 01:40:17.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Felimon Espares, Assistant Majority Leader Mark Anthony Santos,

asr-001460
01:40:18.460 --> 01:40:22.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Laarni Roque,

asr-001461
01:40:23.100 --> 01:40:26.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Deputy Minority Leader Sergio Dagooc,

asr-001462
01:40:27.260 --> 01:40:29.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative, Roy Loyola.

asr-001463
01:40:30.920 --> 01:40:32.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next to interpellate,

asr-001464
01:40:32.380 --> 01:40:35.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: we have Representative Adrian Amatong.

asr-001465
01:40:37.600 --> 01:40:38.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congressman Amatong, are you around?

asr-001466
01:40:39.740 --> 01:40:40.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Wala.

asr-001467
01:40:48.048 --> 01:40:48.824
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Majority.

asr-001468
01:40:49.740 --> 01:40:53.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Mark Cojuangco, you're recognized, sir.

asr-001469
01:40:54.820 --> 01:40:56.520
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001470
01:40:58.780 --> 01:41:07.050
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: First of all, I'd like to manifest my pleasure at the performance of the DILG

asr-001471
01:41:07.050 --> 01:41:10.660
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: led by the very competent,

asr-001472
01:41:10.660 --> 01:41:14.280
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and capable Secretary Remulla.

asr-001473
01:41:14.280 --> 01:41:17.620
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: And because of that pleasure,

asr-001474
01:41:17.620 --> 01:41:26.860
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: I would like to manifest my complete support for the budget of the DILG,

asr-001475
01:41:26.860 --> 01:41:29.380
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: most especially for Region 1.

asr-001476
01:41:31.360 --> 01:41:34.540
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: I'd just like to make a few comments,

asr-001477
01:41:34.540 --> 01:41:38.760
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and maybe the DILG can take note.

asr-001478
01:41:38.760 --> 01:41:44.420
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: The first comment is the PNP road,

asr-001479
01:41:44.420 --> 01:41:49.680
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Cadre Road in the Municipality of Lingayen,

asr-001480
01:41:49.680 --> 01:41:55.600
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: which is the capital town of the province of Pangasinan.

asr-001481
01:41:56.980 --> 01:42:06.440
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: We provided a budget of 60 million for the widening of this road.

asr-001482
01:42:06.440 --> 01:42:11.100
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: It remains unimplemented,

asr-001487
01:42:11.100 --> 01:42:14.580
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: because we have had a difficult time

asr-001488
01:42:14.580 --> 01:42:17.840
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: getting the signature of the Chief PNP.

asr-001489
01:42:18.520 --> 01:42:25.060
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: It has already passed through several Chief PNPs,

asr-001490
01:42:25.060 --> 01:42:29.480
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and up to now, we do not have a signature

asr-001491
01:42:29.480 --> 01:42:33.660
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: which allows us to build a new wall

asr-001492
01:42:33.660 --> 01:42:35.240
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: within the property of PNP

asr-001493
01:42:35.240 --> 01:42:37.380
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: so that we can demolish,

asr-001494
01:42:37.380 --> 01:42:39.060
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: the old wall,

asr-001495
01:42:39.240 --> 01:42:41.420
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: so that we can widen the road.

asr-001496
01:42:42.180 --> 01:42:47.740
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: May I know if this is forthcoming,

asr-001497
01:42:47.740 --> 01:42:53.400
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and also may I know if the Secretary also needs to sign,

asr-001498
01:42:53.400 --> 01:42:56.980
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: aside from Chief PNP Nartatez?

asr-001499
01:42:57.540 --> 01:42:58.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001500
01:42:58.620 --> 01:43:02.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That road in question was delayed by a little bit

asr-001501
01:43:02.540 --> 01:43:06.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: because of the problems of

asr-001502
01:43:06.300 --> 01:43:11.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the destruction of the perimeter wall

asr-001503
01:43:11.660 --> 01:43:14.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and gate of the PNP.

asr-001504
01:43:15.700 --> 01:43:19.320
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, that was addressed by the DPWH?

asr-001505
01:43:19.780 --> 01:43:23.100
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: There is a 60 million fund

asr-001506
01:43:23.100 --> 01:43:26.660
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: for the replacement of the wall and the gates,

asr-001507
01:43:26.660 --> 01:43:28.200
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Your Honor, since 2025.

asr-001508
01:43:29.180 --> 01:43:33.180
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: And my worry is that these funds will lapse

asr-001509
01:43:33.180 --> 01:43:34.860
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: by the end of the year

asr-001510
01:43:34.860 --> 01:43:37.120
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and be returned to the National Treasury.

asr-001511
01:43:37.480 --> 01:43:38.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will make sure, sir.

asr-001512
01:43:38.740 --> 01:43:40.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will make sure that it is implemented as [unclear], sir.

asr-001513
01:43:40.840 --> 01:43:41.360
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Okay.

asr-001514
01:43:41.360 --> 01:43:43.400
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: So, that's one point.

asr-001515
01:43:43.400 --> 01:43:44.340
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Second point,

asr-001516
01:43:44.340 --> 01:43:47.540
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: there is an adjacent property

asr-001517
01:43:47.540 --> 01:43:49.100
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: to the PNP

asr-001518
01:43:49.100 --> 01:43:55.260
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: which this representation has brought to the attention

asr-001519
01:43:55.260 --> 01:43:56.780
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: of the DILG

asr-001520
01:43:56.780 --> 01:44:01.280
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and the Secretary also

asr-001521
01:44:01.280 --> 01:44:05.220
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: that was occupied

asr-001522
01:44:05.220 --> 01:44:07.900
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: by a very, very powerful,

asr-001523
01:44:07.900 --> 01:44:11.020
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: very powerful political figure.

asr-001524
01:44:11.020 --> 01:44:14.340
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: And, what do you call it?

asr-001525
01:44:14.340 --> 01:44:16.140
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Philippine Constabulary

asr-001526
01:44:16.140 --> 01:44:22.260
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and PNP figure also.

asr-001527
01:44:22.260 --> 01:44:28.080
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: And this person has taken possession of the property

asr-001528
01:44:28.080 --> 01:44:32.460
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: which is over a hectare in size.

asr-001529
01:44:32.460 --> 01:44:36.360
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: And we have requested that

asr-001530
01:44:36.360 --> 01:44:41.180
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: several DILG secretaries already

asr-001531
01:44:41.180 --> 01:44:44.940
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: to act on this,

asr-001532
01:44:44.940 --> 01:44:48.180
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: to file a case,

asr-001533
01:44:48.180 --> 01:44:50.180
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: to take possession,

asr-001534
01:44:50.180 --> 01:44:53.640
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: that the occupiers need to be evicted.

asr-001535
01:44:55.600 --> 01:45:02.420
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and the possession of the PNP be restored to this property.

asr-001536
01:45:03.600 --> 01:45:08.140
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: May I know what the status of this is, Mr. Secretary, Mr. Chairman?

asr-001536-split-1
01:45:12.340 --> 01:45:18.660
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Good afternoon or good noon, Mr. Chair and Your Honor.

asr-001537
01:45:18.660 --> 01:45:24.920
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: In behalf of the Philippine National Police, as the Chief PNP,

asr-001538
01:45:24.920 --> 01:45:33.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: I would like to personally give you after this the update on the lot that

asr-001539
01:45:33.080 --> 01:45:40.620
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: the Congressman, Your Honor, had been saying.

asr-001540
01:45:43.960 --> 01:45:49.860
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: One of the problems of the Philippine National Police, of course, is

asr-001541
01:45:49.860 --> 01:45:53.920
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: lot acquisition. And this one is one among these

asr-001542
01:45:53.920 --> 01:45:59.720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: challenges or problems that kailangan namin makuha.

asr-001543
01:45:59.720 --> 01:46:11.380
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And to brief the Honorable Congressman, the PNP lot is now a question of

asr-001544
01:46:11.380 --> 01:46:20.000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: our dealing with the DENR, the Office of the Secretary General, Provincial Prosecutor, Assessor,

asr-001545
01:46:20.020 --> 01:46:25.420
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and other agencies such that this lot should mapunta sa amin.

asr-001546
01:46:25.420 --> 01:46:33.560
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And this will pave the way also for the construction and or giving funds as well

asr-001547
01:46:33.560 --> 01:46:38.140
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: as the utilization of funds that the Honorable Congressman have said a while ago.

asr-001548
01:46:38.480 --> 01:46:50.400
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And the PNP is committed to, committed such that this lot be finally.

asr-001549
01:46:50.400 --> 01:46:59.820
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Mr. Chair, matagal ko na pong nadidinig yung committed ang PNP pero wala pong nangyayari.

asr-001550
01:47:00.040 --> 01:47:17.940
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: E kung sabihin ko po sa inyo ngayon na sigurado lang mababalik sa PNP yung lupa, yung pong scalawag na gumawa po nitong kagagawa na inagaw ang lupa ng gobyerno,

asr-001551
01:47:19.060 --> 01:47:23.080
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: sisiguraduhin nyo ba na makasuhan itong taong ito?

asr-001552
01:47:23.220 --> 01:47:26.080
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Kasi po, nangkukulong tayo

asr-001565
01:47:26.080 --> 01:47:37.160
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ngayon ng mga politikong inaakala natin nagnanakaw sa gobyerno. E, ito bang dating nagnakaw?

asr-001566
01:47:37.200 --> 01:47:40.160
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: E, pababayaan ba nating makalibre?

asr-001567
01:47:42.640 --> 01:47:49.760
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, Mr. Chair. The PNP is committed na makapag-file ng kaso after the conduct of thorough investigation.

asr-001568
01:47:50.280 --> 01:48:03.900
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: So for the information of the DILG and the PNP, there is a DENR Administrative Order No. 2026-11

asr-001569
01:48:03.900 --> 01:48:14.880
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: dated February 25, 2026, subject declaring certain portions of the unclassified public land

asr-001570
01:48:14.880 --> 01:48:19.340
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: as forest land for permanent forest purposes.

asr-001571
01:48:19.340 --> 01:48:30.840
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Under land classification project number 47-A and 38-A of the municipalities of Lingayen and Binmaley, respectively,

asr-001572
01:48:31.500 --> 01:48:39.380
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: province of Pangasinan, signed by then-Secretary Rafael P. M. Lotilla.

asr-001573
01:48:39.680 --> 01:48:47.380
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Ito po tinrabaho ng representative ng distrito, hindi po ng PNP.

asr-001574
01:48:48.100 --> 01:48:48.500
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: So,

asr-001575
01:48:48.620 --> 01:48:51.220
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: solve na po ang problema ninyo.

asr-001576
01:48:51.780 --> 01:48:56.780
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Diniklara ng itong lupang ito ay pag-aari ng gobyerno.

asr-001577
01:48:56.780 --> 01:49:06.800
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: So, what will you do with the actions of this scalawag police that did this?

asr-001578
01:49:07.820 --> 01:49:17.940
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: If that is the basis, Mr. Chair, Your Honor, for the filing of criminal cases or even administrative case for the subject person,

asr-001579
01:49:18.260 --> 01:49:23.600
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: then we'll be referring it to that honorable body, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-001580
01:49:23.600 --> 01:49:32.240
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Sana po itong representation ay magkaroon ng regular reporting on the status of this

asr-001581
01:49:32.240 --> 01:49:40.040
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and sana po the PNP will act immediately to take possession of this property.

asr-001582
01:49:40.040 --> 01:49:47.980
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Kasi hanggang ngayon, pagamat may deklarasyon na ang DENR na ito po ay lupa ng gobyerno,

asr-001586
01:49:48.020 --> 01:49:53.880
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: yung pong taong yun ay nandun pa rin po at ginagamit ang property.

asr-001587
01:49:54.320 --> 01:49:57.140
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Rest assured of that commitment, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-001588
01:49:58.200 --> 01:50:02.760
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And ngayon pa lang nagpapasalamat na kami sa Your Honor, Sir,

asr-001589
01:50:02.860 --> 01:50:10.560
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: for that helping the Philippine National Police in as much as this should be utilized by the government,

asr-001590
01:50:10.780 --> 01:50:12.020
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: particularly the PNP.

asr-001591
01:50:12.220 --> 01:50:13.360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001592
01:50:13.420 --> 01:50:18.140
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And it will be a subject of our continuing update to the Honorable Congressman.

asr-001593
01:50:19.160 --> 01:50:20.100
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Salamat po.

asr-001594
01:50:20.340 --> 01:50:32.280
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Isa na lang punto tungkol po sa mga matagal ng laspag at tinabing mga police vehicle na Mahindra

asr-001595
01:50:32.280 --> 01:50:41.700
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: na nakaparada po sa PNP Provincial Headquarters for the longest time.

asr-001596
01:50:43.190 --> 01:50:49.060
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Nabanggit ko po ito sa isang NLQ, North Luzon

asr-001597
01:50:49.060 --> 01:50:51.000
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Quadrangle Committee Meeting.

asr-001598
01:50:54.080 --> 01:51:03.000
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Dahil [unclear] ko pong mapaayos po ito at maibigay sa mga barangay para gamitin po ng barangay,

asr-001599
01:51:03.000 --> 01:51:04.300
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: imbis na mabulok.

asr-001600
01:51:04.760 --> 01:51:11.180
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Ang nangyari po, after ko binanggit, nawala po ang lahat na ito.

asr-001601
01:51:11.180 --> 01:51:20.180
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Meron pong nagkainteres na siguro ayusin, gamitin,

asr-001602
01:51:20.180 --> 01:51:24.020
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: na privado, hindi na po gobyerno.

asr-001603
01:51:24.960 --> 01:51:34.100
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Nasasayangan po ako sa pagkakataon sana na mabigyan ng mga sasakyan ang mga barangay.

asr-001604
01:51:34.100 --> 01:51:43.120
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: May I know kung ano pa po ang recourse nitong representation po na ito

asr-001605
01:51:43.120 --> 01:51:47.500
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: para mahabol po itong mga Mahindra na ito

asr-001606
01:51:47.500 --> 01:51:49.940
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: or meron pa bang mga Mahindra

asr-001607
01:51:49.940 --> 01:51:59.200
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: na pwede po nating makuha para maibigay sa mga barangay po ng aming distrito?

asr-001608
01:51:59.200 --> 01:52:08.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, 95% of the Mahindra vehicles acquired by the PNP in 2010-2011, I think,

asr-001609
01:52:08.940 --> 01:52:11.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: are now considered beyond economic repair.

asr-001610
01:52:13.720 --> 01:52:20.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If you, in the normal life cycle of a police vehicle, it is usually 12 years,

asr-001611
01:52:20.500 --> 01:52:23.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 10 to 12 years before they are replaced.

asr-001612
01:52:23.900 --> 01:52:28.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Right now, sir, the Mahindra vehicles are between 13 and 14 years old already.

asr-001613
01:52:29.200 --> 01:52:33.860
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary, for your information,

asr-001614
01:52:35.100 --> 01:52:40.220
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ang naging kakulangan lang ng mga Mahindrang yan kaya naitenga

asr-001615
01:52:40.220 --> 01:52:44.300
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ay dahil kulang ng preno at kulang ng clutch.

asr-001616
01:52:44.600 --> 01:52:46.700
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Dahil wala pong mabili dito.

asr-001617
01:52:46.940 --> 01:52:47.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I agree, sir.

asr-001618
01:52:47.600 --> 01:52:50.400
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Wala naman pong problema na mag-order

asr-001619
01:52:50.400 --> 01:52:56.320
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: ng pyesa sa India para maisaayos po ang lahat na yan.

asr-001620
01:52:56.320 --> 01:53:02.400
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Kung hindi na po magamit ng PNP dahil deteriorated na po,

asr-001621
01:53:02.580 --> 01:53:10.660
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: gustong gusto po ng mga barangay na gamitin po yan para sa mga local functions po nila.

asr-001622
01:53:11.054 --> 01:53:11.543
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Okay, sir.

asr-001623
01:53:11.763 --> 01:53:12.160
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Yes.

asr-001624
01:53:12.160 --> 01:53:19.740
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: So, sana po this representation will be informed. Kung meron pa po kami na makukuha.

asr-001625
01:53:19.900 --> 01:53:24.580
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: We have 231 barangays in District 2.

asr-001626
01:53:24.580 --> 01:53:33.620
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: and if we can get 231 ex-Mahindras police vehicles, we would be very thankful, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001627
01:53:34.120 --> 01:53:35.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Well taken, sir.

asr-001628
01:53:35.100 --> 01:53:38.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will take an accounting and keep you up to date on the status of the vehicles.

asr-001629
01:53:38.260 --> 01:53:38.640
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Thank you po.

asr-001630
01:53:38.780 --> 01:53:39.980
Rep. Mark O. Cojuangco: Mr. Chairman.

asr-001631
01:53:41.240 --> 01:53:42.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, thank you.

asr-001632
01:53:42.780 --> 01:53:46.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Chel Diokno. The floor.

asr-001633
01:53:56.580 --> 01:53:58.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Chel Diokno, are you around?

asr-001634
01:54:06.360 --> 01:54:08.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Representative Antonio Tinio.

asr-001635
01:54:08.140 --> 01:54:09.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Chair.

asr-001636
01:54:10.980 --> 01:54:12.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Chair, may PowerPoint po.

asr-001637
01:54:13.520 --> 01:54:14.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paki-ready.

asr-001638
01:54:14.360 --> 01:54:21.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In the meantime, pagbati po sa DILG at kay classmate, Sec. John Vic.

asr-001639
01:54:22.920 --> 01:54:24.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Good afternoon po sa inyo.

asr-001640
01:54:26.140 --> 01:54:26.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001641
01:54:26.840 --> 01:54:27.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

asr-001642
01:54:28.240 --> 01:54:34.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang mga tanong po tungkol sa LGSF, Local Government Support Fund.

asr-001643
01:54:35.350 --> 01:54:36.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Special purpose.

asr-001644
01:54:36.320 --> 01:54:36.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Fund.

asr-001645
01:54:36.540 --> 01:54:40.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero may role ang DILG sa implementation and monitoring nito.

asr-001646
01:54:41.840 --> 01:54:50.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In the 2026 budget, talagang nilakihan, lumobo po nang husto yung LGSF,

asr-001647
01:54:50.120 --> 01:54:53.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particular yung Financial Assistance to Local Government Units.

asr-001648
01:54:53.900 --> 01:54:59.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, nakikita diyan, originally sa NEP, 5 billion ang proposal,

asr-001649
01:54:59.660 --> 01:55:03.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero at the end of the budget process, naging 37.4 billion.

asr-001650
01:55:04.600 --> 01:55:11.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun ang pinakamalaking component ng paglobo ng LGSF. Next slide.

asr-001651
01:55:12.790 --> 01:55:19.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At that time, and up to now, pinuna natin ito, tinawag nating LGU Pork.

asr-001652
01:55:19.660 --> 01:55:25.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At pinoint out natin na kaya lumakihan dahil yung pera, saan ang galing?

asr-001653
01:55:26.560 --> 01:55:34.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Binawasan yung original proposal para pang sweldo, benepisyo at pensyon ng government employees.

asr-001654
01:55:35.080 --> 01:55:36.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So doon ang galing yung increase.

asr-001656
01:55:36.760 --> 01:55:38.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Why did we call it pork?

asr-001657
01:55:39.380 --> 01:55:48.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi yes, makakatulong, pero discretionary sa executive at ginagamit sa politika.

asr-001658
01:55:49.660 --> 01:55:51.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We have a clip.

asr-001659
01:55:51.200 --> 01:55:52.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Video clip po.

asr-001660
01:55:55.940 --> 01:55:57.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May pakiplay lang po.

asr-001661
01:55:59.980 --> 01:56:09.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito ay video ng Executive Secretary Recto sa League of Municipalities just two days ago sa Iloilo.

asr-001662
01:56:11.020 --> 01:56:12.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Please play.

asr-001663
01:56:17.260 --> 01:56:19.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May audio 'yan, ah?

asr-001664
01:56:24.796 --> 01:56:31.445
Presentation video: ...

asr-001665
01:56:33.280 --> 01:56:35.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, medyo mahina po yung audio, pero essentially...

asr-001666
01:56:42.100 --> 01:56:46.720
Presentation video: ...

asr-001668
01:56:46.840 --> 01:56:54.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang nangyayari po diyan ay distribution ng SARO ng financial assistance to LGUs.

asr-001669
01:56:55.310 --> 01:56:59.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, pinapamahagi sa mga mayor.

asr-001670
01:56:59.260 --> 01:57:01.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In this case mga mayor ng Luzon, convention

asr-001671
01:57:01.860 --> 01:57:12.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nila yan. So, ano ang gusto nating i-highlight dito? Na yung dapat purely bureaucratic transmittal

asr-001672
01:57:12.180 --> 01:57:18.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng SARO sa ilalim ng administrasyong ito, ginawa na talagang full-blown official ceremony

asr-001673
01:57:18.280 --> 01:57:24.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng pork barrel distribution. Ganun ang tawag natin dito. Of course, hindi ito concern

asr-001674
01:57:24.560 --> 01:57:37.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ni Secretary John Vic. My question to the DILG is, importante po ang, well, una sa guidelines

asr-001675
01:57:37.540 --> 01:57:48.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng financial assistance, may nilabas ang DBM, at magkano yung assistance? Meron lang general

asr-001676
01:57:48.120 --> 01:57:54.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: guidelines dito. Pagka-ayuda, yung ibibigay na ayuda sa constituents,

asr-001677
01:57:54.700 --> 01:58:01.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: maximum of 5 million pag barangay level, tapos 50 million pagka-province and city,

asr-001678
01:58:02.160 --> 01:58:12.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 20 million pagka-municipality for ayuda. Yung mga para sa AICS, medical, etc. Pero pagka-

asr-001679
01:58:12.020 --> 01:58:20.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: infrastructure, sa barangay may maximum, 10 million din. Pero pagka-municipality, city,

asr-001680
01:58:20.600 --> 01:58:23.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: province, silent ang...

asr-001681
01:58:23.560 --> 01:58:32.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: guidelines. In other words, it's up to the discretion of the DBM and the DILG. Tama po ba?

asr-001682
01:58:34.560 --> 01:58:39.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, these are all guidelines issued by the DBM and not the DILG, sir.

asr-001683
01:58:39.780 --> 01:58:42.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But, accurate po ba yung sinabi ko?

asr-001684
01:58:42.380 --> 01:58:49.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: No. We are strictly on monitoring basis and we have no policy-making basis regarding the

asr-001685
01:58:49.100 --> 01:58:52.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: distribution and utilization of the FALGU.

asr-001686
01:58:52.680 --> 01:58:54.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And can I add lang sa answer ni Secretary?

asr-001687
01:58:55.460 --> 01:59:05.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, ang LGSF ay wala po sa DILG. So ang DILG lang is to supervise kung tama yung paggawa

asr-001688
01:59:05.620 --> 01:59:11.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: since lahat po ng local government ay may mga officer tayo from DILG.

asr-001689
01:59:11.400 --> 01:59:17.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We are not in the policy nor in the distribution side of the funds.

asr-001690
01:59:17.600 --> 01:59:18.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

asr-001691
01:59:19.560 --> 01:59:24.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But in DBM LBC No. 169, ito yung guidelines.

asr-001692
01:59:25.000 --> 01:59:35.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron portion po roon na, for example, mga requests, nakalagay po rito, 3.4.3.4.

asr-001693
01:59:36.100 --> 01:59:45.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The DBM, when necessary, shall forward the request to the DILG for the determination of the recommended amount for each LGU.

asr-001694
01:59:45.400 --> 01:59:46.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So meron po kayong discretion.

asr-001695
01:59:47.660 --> 01:59:52.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If it is referred to us, sir. If it is necessary or not.

asr-001696
01:59:53.960 --> 02:00:03.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have received very few. The USECs take care of that. Yes, it is mostly, sir, on the water

asr-001697
02:00:03.620 --> 02:00:11.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: systems that we are associated with. But otherwise, sir, there are far and few

asr-001698
02:00:11.700 --> 02:00:15.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: requests for us to monitor. Thank you.

asr-001698-split-1
02:00:15.780 --> 02:00:24.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, actually, mas iyon ang tanong ko. Yung gusto nating malaman ng lahat ng publiko, malaking lump sum po ito,

asr-001699
02:00:24.900 --> 02:00:31.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And in fact, nakita ko, tinignan ko yung budget, yung 57 billion total na LGSF for 2026,

asr-001700
02:00:32.200 --> 02:00:39.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: actually, nadagdagan pa ng more than 10 billion, may continuing appropriations, yung hindi pa nagamit.

asr-001701
02:00:39.580 --> 02:00:42.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, total 68 billion. Is that correct? Please confirm.

asr-001701-split-1
02:00:43.120 --> 02:00:43.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001701-split-2
02:00:44.160 --> 02:00:48.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung 57 actually for 2026 naging 68

asr-001702
02:00:48.280 --> 02:00:54.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: billion. Tapos, may proposal ulit for 57 billion

asr-001703
02:00:54.660 --> 02:01:15.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for next year. So, ang gusto po nating malaman, of course, in the interest of transparency, paano po nagamit ito? Kumusta na po ang utilization? At magkano yung in-approve ninyo, DBM-DILG, sa bawat LGU?

asr-001704
02:01:16.540 --> 02:01:20.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the utilization rate will be determined at the end of the year

asr-001705
02:01:20.120 --> 02:01:24.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: since the program started in 2026. We will give a full report in

asr-001706
02:01:24.780 --> 02:01:29.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: 2027 after we have monitored all the distribution and how they were used.

asr-001707
02:01:29.020 --> 02:01:33.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, let me just note that in the guidelines,

asr-001708
02:01:33.540 --> 02:01:41.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sinasabi po rito, actually may transparency requirement and the LGUs, the recipient LGUs,

asr-001709
02:01:41.040 --> 02:01:53.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: are required to provide, submit quarterly reports on how they use the funds to DBM, DILG,

asr-001710
02:01:53.780 --> 02:01:58.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: as well as actually Congress and [unclear]. So dapat meron kayo.

asr-001710-split-1
02:01:58.240 --> 02:02:02.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir, there's a Subay Bayan portal that we have for them to submit.

asr-001710-split-2
02:02:02.060 --> 02:02:10.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo, kaya nga, therefore, baka puwedeng magbigay ng update on 2025. Meron na po kasi in 2025

asr-001711
02:02:10.760 --> 02:02:13.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: as well as 2026 po.

asr-001711-split-1
02:02:13.280 --> 02:02:15.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir, we will gladly submit it to your office.

asr-001711-split-2
02:02:16.380 --> 02:02:17.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kindly submit it

asr-001712
02:02:17.380 --> 02:02:18.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to the committee.

asr-001713
02:02:18.900 --> 02:02:22.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I will submit it within the day, sir.

asr-001713-split-1
02:02:22.040 --> 02:02:38.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, sir. Thank you po, so iyon po yung gusto nating makita. Gusto rin siyempre malaman ng lahat siguro, kahit yung ibang-ibang LGU, magkano ba, paano ba na, magkano ang natatanggap ng ibang-ibang LGU.

asr-001714
02:02:38.200 --> 02:02:39.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So that's one, yung monitoring.

asr-001715
02:02:39.980 --> 02:02:42.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, the other concern is yung implementation.

asr-001717
02:02:44.620 --> 02:02:49.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung implementation, tama po ba, nasa level na ng LGU?

asr-001718
02:02:49.900 --> 02:02:51.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir. 100%, sir.

asr-001719
02:02:51.740 --> 02:03:01.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: How do we ensure na talagang na-implement nang tama at walang problema at anomalya?

asr-001720
02:03:01.260 --> 02:03:03.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang malaking pondo rin po ito.

asr-001721
02:03:03.520 --> 02:03:08.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We're talking about a total of at least 37 billion pesos.

asr-001722
02:03:10.060 --> 02:03:14.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, the department has hired engineers to help us assess.

asr-001723
02:03:15.100 --> 02:03:18.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But mostly, sir, this is a function of the Commission on Audit

asr-001724
02:03:18.240 --> 02:03:21.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: to check whether or not they have complied with all.

asr-001725
02:03:21.900 --> 02:03:26.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We are talking about over 40,000 LGU recipients here.

asr-001726
02:03:26.100 --> 02:03:30.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And our department will need the help also of COA

asr-001727
02:03:30.100 --> 02:03:33.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in assessing the final outcome of their projects.

asr-001728
02:03:34.680 --> 02:03:37.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, isang concern po natin yan.

asr-001729
02:03:37.080 --> 02:03:39.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi actually nakita ko sa guidelines din

asr-001730
02:03:39.360 --> 02:03:46.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang isang requirement para ma-release yung pondo mula dito.

asr-001731
02:03:46.380 --> 02:03:51.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi rito, 4.17.2, Certificate of Reversion of Funds

asr-001732
02:03:51.980 --> 02:03:57.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in Case of Undisbursed Balances from the Completed Projects

asr-001733
02:03:57.180 --> 02:04:04.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: under the Fiscal Years 2016 to 2025, LGSF, Financial Assistance to LGU.

asr-001734
02:04:05.020 --> 02:04:15.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig po sabihin, mukhang may hinahabol pa kayong mga unused funds from 2016 to 2025.

asr-001735
02:04:15.040 --> 02:04:16.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001736
02:04:16.880 --> 02:04:19.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: [unclear] to 2025 was the...

asr-001737
02:04:19.440 --> 02:04:20.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir,

asr-001740
02:04:20.280 --> 02:04:25.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: it was under the purview of Congress and not of the DILG in its distribution.

asr-001741
02:04:25.860 --> 02:04:29.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So it's only in 2026 that we took full cognizance of this, sir.

asr-001742
02:04:29.660 --> 02:04:30.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001743
02:04:31.000 --> 02:04:33.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noted na 2026 sa ilalim ng DILG.

asr-001744
02:04:34.020 --> 02:04:40.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero ang punto, hindi naman po bago itong programa ng LGSF Financial Assistance

asr-001745
02:04:40.100 --> 02:04:41.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to local governments.

asr-001746
02:04:45.000 --> 02:04:50.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang sinasabi nga, mukhang may hinahabol pa all the way back from 2016

asr-001748
02:04:50.300 --> 02:04:52.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na nasa mga LGU.

asr-001749
02:04:52.900 --> 02:04:56.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So kaya nga po, talagang tatanungin din natin, nabanggit n'yo [unclear],

asr-001750
02:04:56.600 --> 02:04:59.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tatanungin din po natin.

asr-001751
02:04:59.660 --> 02:05:08.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero alam naman natin, LGU 'yan, medyo mahirap din na bawat isa ay makita natin.

asr-001752
02:05:10.720 --> 02:05:17.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So iyon po yung concern natin is with regard to transparency dito.

asr-001753
02:05:18.290 --> 02:05:18.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nga...

asr-001755
02:05:18.860 --> 02:05:27.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: may discretionary element, especially with regard to the infrastructure.

asr-001757
02:05:27.060 --> 02:05:34.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, I'd like to add that the accountability level of the local chief executives

asr-001758
02:05:34.580 --> 02:05:37.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is a very high bar to follow.

asr-001759
02:05:38.720 --> 02:05:42.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have our own bids and awards committee.

asr-001760
02:05:43.040 --> 02:05:44.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have our post-qualification.

asr-001761
02:05:44.960 --> 02:05:46.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We have our post-assessment.

asr-001762
02:05:46.440 --> 02:05:47.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There is a review.

asr-001763
02:05:47.460 --> 02:05:51.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, the process which LGUs go through,

asr-001764
02:05:51.600 --> 02:05:55.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in fulfilling their mandate of reporting the usage of the funds,

asr-001765
02:05:55.380 --> 02:05:58.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is a very high bar to hurdle, sir.

asr-001766
02:05:58.660 --> 02:06:01.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And the accountability of the local government officials are very high.

asr-001767
02:06:02.160 --> 02:06:05.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: If there are any discrepancies that are recognized,

asr-001768
02:06:05.880 --> 02:06:10.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then it should be reported and we will file the necessary charges if there are.

asr-001769
02:06:11.000 --> 02:06:11.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001770
02:06:11.340 --> 02:06:13.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you for that, Secretary.

asr-001771
02:06:17.300 --> 02:06:18.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maubos na po ang oras ko.

asr-001772
02:06:18.880 --> 02:06:23.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Actually, I have some concerns relating to

asr-001773
02:06:23.700 --> 02:06:24.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: BJMP.

asr-001774
02:06:24.940 --> 02:06:32.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In particular, yung may mga nakakausap po tayong mga detainees

asr-001775
02:06:32.360 --> 02:06:37.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na yung iba dapat eligible for release na,

asr-001776
02:06:37.880 --> 02:06:42.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero dahil sa mga problema sa records ninyo

asr-001777
02:06:44.780 --> 02:06:47.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: naaantala ang kanilang release.

asr-001778
02:06:48.520 --> 02:06:48.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So...

asr-001779
02:06:50.080 --> 02:06:52.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, if I may answer that.

asr-001781
02:06:52.780 --> 02:06:58.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is our position that the BJMP should be transferred

asr-001782
02:06:58.380 --> 02:07:02.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: under the Department of Justice, under the Bureau of Corrections.

asr-001784
02:07:03.080 --> 02:07:04.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Dalawa po ang carpeta.

asr-001785
02:07:04.620 --> 02:07:08.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: May carpeta po ang BJMP. May carpeta po ang BuCor.

asr-001786
02:07:08.800 --> 02:07:11.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I think it'd be prudent for the Congress to

asr-001787
02:07:11.980 --> 02:07:18.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: help us into combining BuCor and BJMP into one facility. Since they

asr-001788
02:07:18.580 --> 02:07:20.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: perform the same jobs,

asr-001789
02:07:21.500 --> 02:07:24.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: basically, they're just mirroring each other.

asr-001790
02:07:24.420 --> 02:07:28.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, we are asking Congress' help and the President's help in combining the two

asr-001791
02:07:28.640 --> 02:07:30.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: agencies so there will be a more efficient

asr-001792
02:07:30.240 --> 02:07:31.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: use of the resources

asr-001793
02:07:32.540 --> 02:07:36.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and also a fairer treatment to the persons deprived of liberties

asr-001794
02:07:36.540 --> 02:07:38.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: if they have to be released or not.

asr-001795
02:07:39.860 --> 02:07:42.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And can I just add, Secretary,

asr-001796
02:07:42.200 --> 02:07:45.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: isama na rin po yung provincial jails siguro.

asr-001797
02:07:45.100 --> 02:07:46.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, and the provincial jails too, sir.

asr-001798
02:07:46.968 --> 02:07:47.204
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-001799
02:07:47.204 --> 02:07:49.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sir, as of now, we have a municipal jail,

asr-001800
02:07:49.440 --> 02:07:52.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: provincial jail, BJMP, and BuCor.

asr-001802
02:07:52.500 --> 02:07:55.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: All four of them operate independently of each other.

asr-001803
02:07:56.240 --> 02:07:59.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So, what we have to do, sir, is have a common record,

asr-001804
02:07:59.780 --> 02:08:02.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: a common computerized system, data management,

asr-001805
02:08:02.420 --> 02:08:06.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so that all the PDLs will be treated accordingly,

asr-001806
02:08:07.080 --> 02:08:08.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: according to their sentence.

asr-001807
02:08:09.420 --> 02:08:09.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001808
02:08:10.920 --> 02:08:13.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noted po yung concern na [unclear].

asr-001809
02:08:15.380 --> 02:08:16.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama kayo.

asr-001810
02:08:16.340 --> 02:08:17.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi lang naman sa BJMP.

asr-001811
02:08:17.840 --> 02:08:20.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung hindi sa BuCor, din, issue yung carpeta.

asr-001812
02:08:20.700 --> 02:08:21.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's right.

asr-001813
02:08:21.640 --> 02:08:21.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At

asr-001814
02:08:21.940 --> 02:08:26.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: minsan yung mga ibang nakakausap natin

asr-001815
02:08:26.380 --> 02:08:28.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: walang available na kamag-anak

asr-001816
02:08:28.760 --> 02:08:32.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para magtrabaho doon sa hanap ng mga records.

asr-001817
02:08:32.080 --> 02:08:34.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Puwede na dapat silang ma-release.

asr-001818
02:08:34.808 --> 02:08:36.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: [unclear] po, sir,

asr-001819
02:08:36.120 --> 02:08:40.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: isa na lang yun eh, isa na lang database para sa lahat ng mga jail na yan.

asr-001820
02:08:40.120 --> 02:08:41.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Noted po.

asr-001821
02:08:41.400 --> 02:08:44.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And as I said, I have some specific concerns.

asr-001822
02:08:44.620 --> 02:08:48.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung maaari po ay kakausapin namin ang

asr-001823
02:08:48.840 --> 02:08:53.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay lang po ba, kakausapin natin ang BJMP po

asr-001824
02:08:53.180 --> 02:08:54.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: with regard to...

asr-001825
02:08:54.480 --> 02:08:55.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now sir, after the...

asr-001826
02:08:55.740 --> 02:08:56.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: We can do that.

asr-001827
02:08:56.940 --> 02:09:01.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I will not take up the committee's time.

asr-001829
02:09:01.060 --> 02:09:03.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you very much, sir.

asr-001830
02:09:03.140 --> 02:09:03.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-001832
02:09:03.680 --> 02:09:04.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Continue.

asr-001833
02:09:06.620 --> 02:09:10.520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next to interpellate, we have Congressman Pleyto.

asr-001834
02:09:12.790 --> 02:09:14.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kong Pleyto is here.

asr-001835
02:09:15.610 --> 02:09:16.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-001836
02:09:17.940 --> 02:09:21.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next is Congressman Richard Gomez.

asr-001837
02:09:27.360 --> 02:09:30.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Before Congressman Richard Gomez,

asr-001838
02:09:30.300 --> 02:09:31.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I would like to inform our colleagues

asr-001839
02:09:31.860 --> 02:09:35.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: that may patawag po si Presidente

asr-001840
02:09:36.260 --> 02:09:37.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kay Secretary Remulla.

asr-001841
02:09:38.280 --> 02:09:41.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, he needs to leave by 2 p.m.

asr-001842
02:09:41.080 --> 02:09:43.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But yung mga USEC naman po nandito.

asr-001843
02:09:44.200 --> 02:09:45.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, thank you.

asr-001844
02:09:45.540 --> 02:09:47.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Richard Kong Gomez.

asr-001845
02:09:48.720 --> 02:09:49.880
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001846
02:09:50.880 --> 02:09:51.540
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Mr. Secretary.

asr-001847
02:09:52.060 --> 02:09:52.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001848
02:09:52.760 --> 02:09:55.000
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Chief PNP, it's nice to see you here today.

asr-001849
02:09:55.280 --> 02:09:55.720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, sir.

asr-001850
02:09:56.000 --> 02:09:59.400
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: I know you had an adventurous flight yesterday.

asr-001851
02:09:59.700 --> 02:09:59.860
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes.

asr-001852
02:10:00.040 --> 02:10:00.760
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: In one piece, sir.

asr-001853
02:10:00.860 --> 02:10:02.160
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: It's nice to see you in one piece.

asr-001854
02:10:03.140 --> 02:10:04.260
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Magandang hapon, Mr. Chairman.

asr-001855
02:10:05.460 --> 02:10:07.620
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Just an overview, Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001856
02:10:07.620 --> 02:10:09.200
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: When I ran for mayor

asr-001857
02:10:09.200 --> 02:10:11.280
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: of Ormoc in 2015,

asr-001858
02:10:11.280 --> 02:10:13.580
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: for the 2016 elections,

asr-001859
02:10:14.020 --> 02:10:16.940
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: Ormoc used to be the drug capital of Region 8.

asr-001860
02:10:17.840 --> 02:10:19.120
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: And when I won in 2016,

asr-001861
02:10:19.360 --> 02:10:21.820
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: my promise to the people was to eradicate drugs

asr-001862
02:10:21.820 --> 02:10:24.200
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: in the city and take out

asr-001863
02:10:24.200 --> 02:10:27.440
Rep. Richard I. Gomez: those men in uniform

asr-001864
