asr-002835
02:43:44.200 --> 02:43:45.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung non-technical.

asr-002836
02:43:45.960 --> 02:43:47.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi mahirap i-remove,

asr-002837
02:43:47.500 --> 02:43:50.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: alisin kagad yung technical

asr-002838
02:43:50.100 --> 02:43:51.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi inherent yun, physics.

asr-002839
