Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi ang nakapag-issue,

asr-002844
02:44:01.760 --> 02:44:03.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ng memorandum para ma-implement

asr-002845
02:44:03.780 --> 02:44:05.540
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung tax exemption.

asr-002846
02:44:05.960 --> 02:44:06.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So,

asr-002847
02:44:07.560 --> 02:44:09.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kaya we are again expecting

asr-002848
02:44:09.480 --> 02:44:11.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: your assistance and enforcement.

asr-002849
02:44:12.000 --> 02:44:12.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: You can

asr-002850
02:44:12.920 --> 02:44:14.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: rely on it, sir.

asr-002851
02:44:15.160 --> 02:44:17.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, thank you once again,

asr-002852
02:44:17.640 --> 02:44:18.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mr. Secretary.

asr-002853
02:44:18.620 --> 02:44:19.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Then,

asr-002854
02:44:19.380 --> 02:44:24.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: pangatlo, Mr. Secretary,

asr-002855
02:44:24.160 --> 02:44:25.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mayroon tayong

asr-002856
02:44:25.500 --> 02:44:27.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mga awards sa mga LGO.

asr-002857
02:44:28.240 --> 02:44:29.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung Seal of

asr-002858
02:44:30.500 --> 02:44:31.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ano yan,

asr-002859
02:44:31.480 --> 02:44:33.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: good governance,

asr-002860
02:44:33.460 --> 02:44:36.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mayroong fiscal management.

asr-002861
02:44:36.990 --> 02:44:37.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tama po ba?

asr-002862
02:44:37.780 --> 02:44:38.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-002863
02:44:38.280 --> 02:44:41.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, can we include as criteria

asr-002864
02:44:42.000 --> 02:44:44.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung pagbabayad

asr-002865
02:44:44.360 --> 02:44:46.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ng mga local government

asr-002866
02:44:46.100 --> 02:44:47.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: officials at saka yung

asr-002867
02:44:47.520 --> 02:44:50.200
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: LGU mismo sa mga electric

asr-002868
02:44:50.200 --> 02:44:50.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: bill nila?

asr-002869
02:44:50.940 --> 02:44:56.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bago sila mabigyan ng award na fiscal management, parang mayroong ganon.

asr-002870
02:44:56.280 --> 02:45:01.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi mayroong kayong maraming nabigyan ng Seal of fiscal management,

asr-002871
02:45:01.680 --> 02:45:10.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero yung, with all due respect, yung mga local government officials, hindi nagbabayad.

asr-002872
02:45:10.920 --> 02:45:19.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos yung mga electric bill mismo ng mga munisipyo, mga etc., street lighting, hindi nagbabayad.

asr-002873
02:45:19.640 --> 02:45:29.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Paano nagiging example sila, nagiging huwaran sa fiscal management kung hindi man lang nila binabayaran yung mga utilities?

asr-002874
02:45:29.280 --> 02:45:32.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Can we expect that, Mr. Secretary?

asr-002875
02:45:32.720 --> 02:45:35.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir. We will include it in our next round of evaluation, sir.

asr-002876
02:45:36.200 --> 02:45:39.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Maraming maraming salamat talaga, Mr. Secretary.

asr-002877
02:45:39.500 --> 02:45:47.840
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at ang mga electric cooperative ay may utang na loob sa DILG sa pag-upo mo na na-issue, na-implement namin

asr-002878
02:45:47.840 --> 02:45:49.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: at least apat na lang na probinsya.

asr-002879
02:45:50.280 --> 02:45:52.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: That's all, Mr. Chair. Maraming salamat.

asr-002880
02:45:52.640 --> 02:45:53.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: That's a very good start.

asr-002881
02:45:53.760 --> 02:45:56.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Secretary. Thank you, Cong. Dagooc.

asr-002882
02:45:56.560 --> 02:46:00.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Next, to interpellate, we have Congresswoman Jam Baronda.

asr-002883
02:46:00.920 --> 02:46:01.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ma'am, you have the floor.

asr-002884
02:46:02.660 --> 02:46:03.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-002885
02:46:03.980 --> 02:46:10.360
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And of course, Secretary Jonvic Remulla and the men and women of DILG,

asr-002886
02:46:10.900 --> 02:46:15.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I would like first to recommend, to commend all of you for a job well done.

asr-002887
02:46:15.900 --> 02:46:19.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I hope that we have barely two years to go.

asr-002888
02:46:20.160 --> 02:46:21.180
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, ma'am.

asr-002889
02:46:22.060 --> 02:46:25.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sana we will continue to feel yung bagong Pilipinas.

asr-002890
02:46:25.680 --> 02:46:32.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And I would like to congratulate, of course, Secretary, for your unified 9-1-1 program.

asr-002891
02:46:32.800 --> 02:46:33.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Thank you, ma'am.

asr-002892
02:46:33.240 --> 02:46:35.900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I hope madagdagan na yung pondo ninyo.

asr-002893
02:46:36.360 --> 02:46:39.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And I would also like to commend you with your character.

asr-002894
02:46:39.440 --> 02:46:44.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: You maintain the values that your parents taught you,

asr-002895
02:46:44.340 --> 02:46:49.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: knowing you when you were like the governor of the province of Cavite.

asr-002897
02:46:49.220 --> 02:46:56.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: With you leading the agency, not only the DILG, including BFP, also our PNP,

asr-002898
02:46:56.940 --> 02:46:59.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I know we are in good hands.

asr-002899
02:46:59.120 --> 02:47:03.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But my problem today lies not only with the DILG.

asr-002900
02:47:03.180 --> 02:47:06.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's with the local government.

asr-002901
02:47:06.100 --> 02:47:10.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: It's also with the SK officials and the barangay officials.

asr-002902
02:47:10.780 --> 02:47:17.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I am very lucky to have been given the chance to serve the Barangay Council of Barangay Haviliana Haro.

asr-002903
02:47:17.860 --> 02:47:19.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And as the SK president,

asr-002905
02:47:21.740 --> 02:47:26.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And I remember until now, during my days as SK president,

asr-002906
02:47:27.260 --> 02:47:32.460
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we were given the opportunity by the National Commission to be empowered by the National Commission.

asr-002907
02:47:33.020 --> 02:47:39.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Remember, your task is to provide us with enough knowledge, guidance,

asr-002908
02:47:39.760 --> 02:47:42.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to become the better person of ourselves.

asr-002909
02:47:43.100 --> 02:47:46.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: During 1996, when I was the SK president of Iloilo City,

asr-002910
02:47:47.180 --> 02:47:49.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: puno po kami ng

asr-002911
02:47:49.320 --> 02:47:50.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Lahat ng programs.

asr-002912
02:47:51.740 --> 02:47:56.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We do have the Scholar Training Boss 1, 2, 3.

asr-002913
02:47:56.840 --> 02:47:57.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ano ito?

asr-002914
02:47:57.780 --> 02:48:04.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Una, kailangan malaman po muna natin kung anong reason bakit nandito kami.

asr-002915
02:48:04.460 --> 02:48:05.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ano yung reason?

asr-002916
02:48:05.480 --> 02:48:14.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: For our SK to develop the social, physical, emotional, moral, and spiritual well-being of our youth.

asr-002917
02:48:14.700 --> 02:48:15.840
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Second,

asr-002918
02:48:15.840 --> 02:48:19.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: for us to make sure,

asr-002919
02:48:19.180 --> 02:48:26.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: that all of the programs of the SKs are aligned with the needs of our young people

asr-002920
02:48:26.700 --> 02:48:33.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: from the barangay, to the federation, to the city, to the provincial, and the national.

asr-002921
02:48:33.140 --> 02:48:39.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Third, when we are already equipped with all the knowledge and everything that we need,

asr-002922
02:48:39.960 --> 02:48:44.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we need to be immersed in different cities, in different countries,

asr-002923
02:48:44.960 --> 02:48:49.980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: kung kaya, kung ano ang pinakamagandang best practices.

asr-002925
02:48:50.800 --> 02:48:54.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ginawa ko pa iyon during my time.

asr-002926
02:48:54.240 --> 02:49:00.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: That is why I was even awarded as the most outstanding SK of the Philippines,

asr-002927
02:49:00.940 --> 02:49:04.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: besting 44,000 SK chairmen.

asr-002928
02:49:04.580 --> 02:49:11.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And at the same time, I was awarded by NYC as the national youth leader of our country.

asr-002929
02:49:12.200 --> 02:49:15.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Now that SK is about to be postponed,

asr-002930
02:49:16.260 --> 02:49:19.760
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I feel sorry for those SKs,

asr-002931
02:49:19.760 --> 02:49:27.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: who worked hard and also for those SKs na hindi talaga nagtrabaw, Secretary.

asr-002932
02:49:28.220 --> 02:49:29.660
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang tanong ko, Secretary,

asr-002933
02:49:30.140 --> 02:49:35.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: in March 26, I wrote a letter address to your office,

asr-002934
02:49:35.100 --> 02:49:38.060
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: kasi madaming mga barangay kapitan,

asr-002935
02:49:38.220 --> 02:49:42.160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: hindi lang sa Iloilo or sa SK, but sa buong Pilipinas,

asr-002936
02:49:42.300 --> 02:49:45.700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: walang annual development plan.

asr-002937
02:49:46.630 --> 02:49:49.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So ngayon, they are working based,

asr-002938
02:49:49.400 --> 02:49:51.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: on their enacted budget.

asr-002939
02:49:51.300 --> 02:49:55.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kawawa ang mga kabataan.

asr-002940
02:49:55.100 --> 02:49:57.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kawawa ang mga Pilipino.

asr-002941
02:49:57.700 --> 02:49:58.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Bakit?

asr-002942
02:49:58.320 --> 02:50:01.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We deserve a better program for our young people.

asr-002943
02:50:01.520 --> 02:50:06.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We deserve a program that is responsive to the needs of our country.

asr-002944
02:50:06.960 --> 02:50:10.780
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: So ang politika hindi po ito dahil leader ka.

asr-002945
02:50:10.880 --> 02:50:14.820
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang politika, we should serve our city,

asr-002946
02:50:15.060 --> 02:50:18.300
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we should serve our barangay and our country.

asr-002947
02:50:18.540 --> 02:50:19.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang korupsyon,

asr-002948
02:50:19.640 --> 02:50:21.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: hindi nag-umpisa sa taas,

asr-002949
02:50:21.440 --> 02:50:23.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: kailangan umpisahan natin sa baba.

asr-002950
02:50:23.820 --> 02:50:25.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Na pag-strengthen

asr-002951
02:50:25.880 --> 02:50:28.360
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: and pag-make sure that we are guided.

asr-002952
02:50:28.360 --> 02:50:29.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: When you are guided,

asr-002953
02:50:30.120 --> 02:50:34.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: no, wala kang reason for you not to be better.

asr-002954
02:50:34.880 --> 02:50:35.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang tanong ko, Secretary,

asr-002955
02:50:36.520 --> 02:50:38.260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Iloilo City alone,

asr-002956
02:50:38.460 --> 02:50:39.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: in 2026,

asr-002957
02:50:40.340 --> 02:50:41.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Diyos ko Lord,

asr-002958
02:50:42.540 --> 02:50:43.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Marso,

asr-002959
02:50:43.120 --> 02:50:46.120
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ilan pa lang ang nakasubmit ng annual development plan?

asr-002960
02:50:46.300 --> 02:50:47.860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Even sa barangay.

asr-002961
02:50:48.020 --> 02:50:49.800
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yung iba, December pa lang,

asr-002962
02:50:49.920 --> 02:50:51.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: walang annual development plan.

asr-002963
02:50:51.720 --> 02:50:53.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Meaning, we are paying

asr-002964
02:50:53.960 --> 02:50:56.520
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: their salaries

asr-002965
02:50:56.520 --> 02:50:58.320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: na walang ginagawa.

asr-002966
02:50:58.860 --> 02:50:59.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Worst,

asr-002967
02:50:59.700 --> 02:51:02.000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: now that this government

asr-002968
02:51:02.000 --> 02:51:03.440
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: has many programs

asr-002969
02:51:03.440 --> 02:51:06.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: to empower our people,

asr-002970
02:51:06.500 --> 02:51:07.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: but until now,

asr-002971
02:51:08.140 --> 02:51:10.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: hindi natin sa tingin ko nagawa ng tama.

asr-002972
02:51:11.120 --> 02:51:11.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Una,

asr-002973
02:51:11.780 --> 02:51:14.240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we are and I am for

asr-002974
02:51:14.240 --> 02:51:17.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: a cliff program for our people.

asr-002975
02:51:17.460 --> 02:51:19.400
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But ang problema, ano bang sektor?

asr-002976
02:51:19.400 --> 02:51:20.920
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Like for example,

asr-002977
02:51:21.100 --> 02:51:23.200
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ngayon may programa po si PSA,

asr-002978
02:51:23.220 --> 02:51:24.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: si DSWD.

asr-002979
02:51:25.060 --> 02:51:27.480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: And ano yung reason and purpose nila

asr-002980
02:51:27.480 --> 02:51:29.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: sa pagpili ng mga beneficiary na active?

asr-002981
02:51:29.800 --> 02:51:31.020
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Based doon sa

asr-002982
02:51:31.020 --> 02:51:32.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: CBMS.

asr-002983
02:51:33.040 --> 02:51:34.540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ano ang CBMS?

asr-002984
02:51:35.080 --> 02:51:38.220
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Community Based Monitoring System.

asr-002985
02:51:38.480 --> 02:51:39.600
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang problema,

asr-002986
02:51:39.600 --> 02:51:41.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: in Iloilo City alone,

asr-002987
02:51:41.940 --> 02:51:43.720
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: nung tinanong si PSA,

asr-002988
02:51:43.720 --> 02:51:45.940
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ilan ang beneficiary natin

asr-002989
02:51:45.940 --> 02:51:47.100
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ng CBMS?

asr-002990
02:51:47.100 --> 02:51:50.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Na bibigyan ng 2,000 a month.

asr-002991
02:51:50.720 --> 02:51:51.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Sabi nila,

asr-002992
02:51:51.680 --> 02:51:52.960
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 623.

asr-002993
02:51:53.240 --> 02:51:55.580
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 2,000 a month hanggang December.

asr-002994
02:51:55.960 --> 02:51:58.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang tanong ko sa DSWD,

asr-002995
02:51:58.580 --> 02:52:00.340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ilan ang nabigyan nyo

asr-002996
02:52:00.340 --> 02:52:01.420
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: nung first tranche?

asr-002997
02:52:01.540 --> 02:52:02.680
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ang sagot sa akin,

asr-002998
02:52:02.820 --> 02:52:04.620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 327.

asr-002999
02:52:04.880 --> 02:52:07.500
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ay bakit naman po 327 lang?

asr-003000
02:52:07.500 --> 02:52:10.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Kasi po, sa 600 plus na lista,

asr-003001
02:52:10.400 --> 02:52:11.740
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: hindi po qualified

asr-003002
02:52:11.740 --> 02:52:13.380
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: ang majority.

asr-003003
02:52:13.800 --> 02:52:15.880
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Almost half, Mr. Secretary.

asr-003004
02:52:16.440 --> 02:52:17.280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Ngayon,

asr-003005
02:52:17.280 --> 02:52:20.180
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: we are not against the support of the government.

asr-003006
02:52:20.440 --> 02:52:22.640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: We just wanted to make sure

asr-003007
02:52:22.640 --> 02:52:24.140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: na ang bibigyan

