Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Ang dami na po.

asr-003842
03:27:15.560 --> 03:27:25.600
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: So I was just wondering whether the PNP or the DILG or the other attached agencies, meron na po ba tayong nakita, naimbestigahan na meron po ganong klaseng recruitment?

asr-003843
03:27:25.600 --> 03:27:27.420
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: sa ating mga kabataan?

asr-003844
03:27:27.900 --> 03:27:30.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There are three parts to this, ma'am.

asr-003845
03:27:30.100 --> 03:27:38.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: One is the, there are parts of the crimes which we cannot discuss because it will encourage copycat crimes.

asr-003846
03:27:40.560 --> 03:27:48.340
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So we cannot reveal everything but if there is an executive session, I can reveal the details of the crime.

asr-003847
03:27:48.460 --> 03:27:57.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So what we try to discourage are copycat crimes that they get, that the perpetrators become idolized by those.

asr-003848
03:27:58.000 --> 03:28:15.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number two, sir ma'am, is the game, the first person shooter Roblox which has a conversation box beside it, which in the chat box which encourages the participants to commit actual violence.

asr-003849
03:28:15.040 --> 03:28:26.160
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's why I've been lobbying for it to be banned here in the Philippines because it has the common occurrence in Tacloban and Zamboanga is both players, both actors were,

asr-003850
03:28:26.160 --> 03:28:31.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and heavily influenced by the game Roblox.

asr-003851
03:28:31.360 --> 03:28:44.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The last part, ma'am, is we are trying our best to enforce it by creating police presence outside the classrooms, outside the school sites, and inside with the barangay tanods.

asr-003852
03:28:46.860 --> 03:28:48.620
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003853
03:28:48.780 --> 03:28:55.780
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Last question, with regards to the presence of the police in the school vicinity, hanggang kailan po natin to implement?

asr-003854
03:28:55.900 --> 03:28:57.120
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Is it a permanent thing?

asr-003855
03:28:57.360 --> 03:29:00.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It's a policy, ma'am. It's a policy already.

asr-003856
03:29:01.200 --> 03:29:11.960
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair. That's all. I think yung po sinasabi ni ni Secretary na if there's an executive session, we can. But hopefully, after budget na po, we should go ahead with the budget.

asr-003857
03:29:12.000 --> 03:29:14.000
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: Thank you, Mr. Chair. That's all. Thank you po.

asr-003858
03:29:14.080 --> 03:29:14.580
