DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that it will be AI-enabled already.

asr-004442
03:44:51.600 --> 03:44:54.360
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pwede po bang makahingi ang representasyon na ito

asr-004443
