Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na for procurement na lang.

asr-004446
03:44:59.100 --> 03:45:01.400
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We'll submit it to the committee, ma'am.

asr-004447
03:45:01.620 --> 03:45:03.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004448
03:45:04.280 --> 03:45:06.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And kasama din ito,

asr-004449
03:45:06.640 --> 03:45:09.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of course, nakita natin yung

asr-004450
03:45:09.220 --> 03:45:12.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mas malawak na presence

asr-004451
03:45:12.140 --> 03:45:13.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even yung operations

asr-004452
03:45:13.560 --> 03:45:15.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng kapulisan,

asr-004453
03:45:15.700 --> 03:45:17.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: lalo na't with the Safer Cities Initiative.

asr-004454
03:45:17.880 --> 03:45:21.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: It has logged over 700,000 apprehensions

asr-004455
03:45:21.720 --> 03:45:22.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in Metro Manila alone

asr-004456
03:45:22.820 --> 03:45:24.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: within the first few months.

asr-004457
03:45:24.960 --> 03:45:26.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang tanong ko po,

asr-004458
03:45:26.380 --> 03:45:28.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: given that loitering is actually

asr-004459
03:45:28.900 --> 03:45:30.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: explicitly decriminalized

asr-004460
03:45:30.620 --> 03:45:33.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: under RA 1015-8,

asr-004461
03:45:34.370 --> 03:45:36.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano po nare-reconcile ng DILG

asr-004462
03:45:36.340 --> 03:45:37.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and then ng mga kapulisan natin

asr-004463
03:45:37.900 --> 03:45:41.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung mga ganitong apprehensions

asr-004464
03:45:41.460 --> 03:45:43.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and ayaw nating tumungo sa arrests

asr-004465
03:45:43.620 --> 03:45:45.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: against the urban poor

asr-004466
03:45:46.560 --> 03:45:49.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nang hindi nalalabag ang statutory law

asr-004467
03:45:49.120 --> 03:45:50.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even yung constitutional rights nila?

asr-004468
03:45:51.320 --> 03:45:54.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am, we believe that we do not violate

asr-004469
03:45:54.080 --> 03:45:55.360
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: any constitutional rights

asr-004470
03:45:55.360 --> 03:45:57.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: by enforcing the Safer Cities Initiative.

asr-004471
03:45:58.800 --> 03:45:59.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Number one, ma'am,

asr-004472
03:46:00.040 --> 03:46:02.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: when you drink in the streets

asr-004473
03:46:03.080 --> 03:46:04.480
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: which is not allowed,

asr-004474
03:46:04.680 --> 03:46:07.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we automatically arrest them

asr-004475
03:46:07.100 --> 03:46:08.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: or we give them a warning

asr-004476
03:46:08.240 --> 03:46:08.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: then arrest them.

asr-004477
03:46:08.960 --> 03:46:11.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: When you loiter with a...

asr-004478
03:46:11.500 --> 03:46:13.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: A lot of times, ma'am,

asr-004479
03:46:13.600 --> 03:46:14.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: those who are caught loitering

asr-004480
03:46:14.880 --> 03:46:16.620
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: were under already the influence of alcohol

asr-004481
03:46:16.620 --> 03:46:17.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: going home

asr-004482
03:46:17.520 --> 03:46:18.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and that is also not allowed.

asr-004483
03:46:19.120 --> 03:46:20.880
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: A majority of those cases were...

asr-004484
03:46:21.000 --> 03:46:23.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Hardly did we arrest anyone

asr-004485
03:46:23.100 --> 03:46:24.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: just for standing up.

asr-004486
03:46:24.500 --> 03:46:26.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: There were cases na patambay-tambay lang

asr-004487
03:46:26.880 --> 03:46:27.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: na walang ginagawa.

asr-004488
03:46:27.800 --> 03:46:28.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Sinisita sila.

asr-004489
03:46:28.740 --> 03:46:30.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But most of those arrested

asr-004490
03:46:30.300 --> 03:46:32.680
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: were under the influence of alcohol

asr-004491
03:46:32.680 --> 03:46:34.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: or other intoxicants.

asr-004492
03:46:34.800 --> 03:46:35.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: That's why they were arrested.

asr-004493
03:46:35.720 --> 03:46:37.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Can I ask po, Mr. Chair,

asr-004494
03:46:38.220 --> 03:46:39.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ano na yung updated statistics?

asr-004495
03:46:40.380 --> 03:46:42.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 700,000 apprehensions

asr-004496
03:46:42.400 --> 03:46:43.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in the first few months?

asr-004497
03:46:43.540 --> 03:46:44.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ngayon po, ilan na po?

asr-004498
03:46:45.640 --> 03:46:47.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: We will also give to the committee later

asr-004499
03:46:47.780 --> 03:46:51.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but it is consistent with the monthly.

asr-004500
03:46:51.420 --> 03:46:52.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But mind you, ma'am,

asr-004501
03:46:52.440 --> 03:46:53.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the effects have been great.

asr-004502
03:46:54.580 --> 03:46:56.080
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Focus crimes have been down

asr-004503
03:46:56.080 --> 03:46:57.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in the cities alone

asr-004504
03:46:57.460 --> 03:46:59.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: by almost 30%.

asr-004505
03:47:02.160 --> 03:47:03.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Here, I have the numbers, ma'am.

asr-004506
03:47:07.680 --> 03:47:08.280
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am,

asr-004507
03:47:11.980 --> 03:47:12.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: so ma'am,

asr-004508
03:47:12.540 --> 03:47:16.440
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we don't have the exact numbers here

asr-004509
03:47:16.680 --> 03:47:17.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: but...

asr-004510
03:47:17.420 --> 03:47:19.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I will supply the committee later.

asr-004511
03:47:20.060 --> 03:47:21.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But safe to say, ma'am,

asr-004512
03:47:21.220 --> 03:47:23.120
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: rape has gone down by 60%.

asr-004513
03:47:23.120 --> 03:47:25.740
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Violent crimes have gone down by 50%.

asr-004514
03:47:25.740 --> 03:47:29.220
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Physical injuries have gone down by 30%.

asr-004515
03:47:29.220 --> 03:47:31.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: So the Safer Cities Initiative

asr-004516
03:47:31.460 --> 03:47:34.140
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: has worked on a statistical basis

asr-004517
03:47:34.140 --> 03:47:35.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and a real-life basis also.

asr-004518
03:47:36.640 --> 03:47:38.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung ating debate siguro

asr-004519
03:47:38.400 --> 03:47:39.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa ibang araw na lang

asr-004520
03:47:39.400 --> 03:47:42.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil I'm sure the Secretary

asr-004521
03:47:42.040 --> 03:47:43.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is aware of the difference in opinion.

asr-004522
03:47:44.000 --> 03:47:44.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But nonetheless,

asr-004523
03:47:44.580 --> 03:47:45.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang tanong ko na lang din po,

asr-004524
03:47:45.760 --> 03:47:48.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in the implementation of the initiative,

asr-004525
03:47:49.160 --> 03:47:50.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may dala po bang baril,

asr-004526
03:47:50.640 --> 03:47:52.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may body-worn cameras po ba

asr-004527
03:47:52.100 --> 03:47:53.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang ating mga kapulisan?

asr-004528
03:47:53.860 --> 03:47:55.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Laging may baril, ma'am,

asr-004529
03:47:55.160 --> 03:47:57.020
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: as part of expanded operating procedures.

asr-004530
03:47:57.300 --> 03:47:57.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But again, ma'am,

asr-004531
03:47:57.960 --> 03:47:59.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: we're deficient in the cameras

asr-004532
03:47:59.520 --> 03:48:00.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and we still have to buy some more.

asr-004533
03:48:02.900 --> 03:48:04.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yung last question ko na lang po,

asr-004534
03:48:05.460 --> 03:48:07.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and I have 30 seconds left,

asr-004535
03:48:07.680 --> 03:48:09.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is in relation to the school shootings.

asr-004536
03:48:10.340 --> 03:48:12.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So it's really tragic

asr-004537
03:48:12.120 --> 03:48:13.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung ano pong nangyayari.

asr-004538
03:48:13.600 --> 03:48:16.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And I have heard the Secretary

asr-004539
03:48:16.300 --> 03:48:19.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: believe that they're caused by video games

asr-004540
03:48:20.100 --> 03:48:22.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and this is how we'd like to approach it.

asr-004541
03:48:22.980 --> 03:48:25.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron pong real and scientific studies

asr-004542
03:48:25.580 --> 03:48:27.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that prove otherwise.

asr-004543
03:48:27.580 --> 03:48:30.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: A whole compound of factors

asr-004544
03:48:30.040 --> 03:48:31.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang pumapasok dito

asr-004545
03:48:31.980 --> 03:48:33.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: other than video games

asr-004546
03:48:33.600 --> 03:48:36.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na actually parang two decades na pong talking point.

asr-004547
03:48:36.520 --> 03:48:38.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So given that we've established

asr-004548
03:48:38.140 --> 03:48:41.240
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: how law enforcement is ubiquitous,

asr-004549
03:48:41.260 --> 03:48:42.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: laging may baril everywhere,

asr-004550
03:48:43.420 --> 03:48:47.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and may nakita po tayo na treatment sa kanya

asr-004551
03:48:47.500 --> 03:48:49.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: even sa

asr-004552
03:48:49.140 --> 03:48:50.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: SONA arrests lang,

asr-004553
03:48:50.260 --> 03:48:52.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: paano po ba nai-ensure ng department

asr-004554
03:48:52.540 --> 03:48:55.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that police at home

asr-004555
03:48:55.400 --> 03:48:57.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and those who are deployed in school zones

asr-004556
03:48:57.980 --> 03:48:59.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: treat children accordingly?

asr-004557
03:49:00.100 --> 03:49:02.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Hindi po nai-ensure na may culture of fear

asr-004558
03:49:02.840 --> 03:49:05.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na nai-impress sa mga kabataan.

asr-004559
03:49:05.880 --> 03:49:07.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you for that last question.

asr-004560
03:49:07.600 --> 03:49:08.540
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I can,

asr-004561
03:49:08.540 --> 03:49:11.060
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in the executive session,

asr-004562
03:49:11.060 --> 03:49:12.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I can give the full details

asr-004563
03:49:12.460 --> 03:49:15.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: of the backgrounds of both school shooters.

asr-004564
03:49:15.760 --> 03:49:17.380
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But safe to say,

asr-004565
03:49:17.380 --> 03:49:17.820
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: um,

asr-004566
03:49:18.900 --> 03:49:22.000
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: the video games played a large part

asr-004567
03:49:22.000 --> 03:49:25.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in how they went down the rabbit hole

asr-004568
03:49:25.240 --> 03:49:29.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and examining other means of

asr-004569
03:49:31.380 --> 03:49:33.700
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: retribution on their wrong part.

asr-004570
03:49:33.700 --> 03:49:35.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: But I cannot explain it here

asr-004571
03:49:36.920 --> 03:49:38.800
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: simply because it might be glorified

asr-004572
03:49:38.800 --> 03:49:40.640
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and people might be influenced by what I say.

asr-004573
03:49:42.060 --> 03:49:42.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-004574
03:49:43.100 --> 03:49:43.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair,

asr-004575
03:49:44.120 --> 03:49:45.900
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may I be allowed at least a manifestation

asr-004576
03:49:45.920 --> 03:49:47.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: in response lang po?

asr-004577
03:49:47.380 --> 03:49:48.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Please, go ahead.

asr-004578
03:49:48.360 --> 03:49:48.620
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay,

asr-004579
03:49:48.660 --> 03:49:49.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-004580
03:49:51.860 --> 03:49:52.340
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Well,

asr-004581
03:49:52.360 --> 03:49:53.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: matagal na rin po itong debate

asr-004582
03:49:53.900 --> 03:49:55.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero, syempre,

asr-004583
03:49:55.180 --> 03:49:57.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi naman po sa video games lang

asr-004584
03:49:57.460 --> 03:49:58.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung problema

asr-004585
03:49:59.100 --> 03:50:00.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pero generally all media,

asr-004586
03:50:00.280 --> 03:50:03.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: lalo na kung kino-consume ng kabataan

asr-004587
03:50:03.260 --> 03:50:04.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: which are at a vulnerable age

asr-004588
03:50:05.100 --> 03:50:06.520
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: or even kung paano

asr-004589
03:50:06.520 --> 03:50:08.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: nakakasalamuha

asr-004590
03:50:08.440 --> 03:50:09.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang kabuoang komunidad,

asr-004591
03:50:09.780 --> 03:50:11.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may epekto din po yun.

asr-004592
03:50:11.160 --> 03:50:11.660
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So,

asr-004593
03:50:11.760 --> 03:50:14.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we look forward to that executive session.

asr-004594
03:50:14.340 --> 03:50:14.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But nonetheless,

asr-004595
03:50:15.400 --> 03:50:17.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: maraming po itong compounded factors

asr-004596
03:50:17.400 --> 03:50:19.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and ang isang pino-point

asr-004597
03:50:19.160 --> 03:50:19.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: din po natin

asr-004598
03:50:19.880 --> 03:50:21.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is a culture of violence

asr-004599
03:50:21.260 --> 03:50:24.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na ever-present in our society

asr-004600
03:50:24.220 --> 03:50:25.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: even beyond video games.

asr-004601
03:50:25.940 --> 03:50:26.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And so, that's why

asr-004602
03:50:26.960 --> 03:50:28.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we also see bullying

asr-004603
03:50:28.120 --> 03:50:30.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and violent tendencies of children

asr-004604
03:50:30.080 --> 03:50:32.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: because they're born out of the culture,

asr-004605
03:50:32.360 --> 03:50:33.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: the experience,

asr-004606
03:50:33.360 --> 03:50:34.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and the social reality

asr-004607
03:50:34.400 --> 03:50:35.260
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: that they witness.

asr-004608
03:50:35.600 --> 03:50:36.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kasama po dito,

asr-004609
03:50:36.800 --> 03:50:38.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung Oplan Tokhang,

asr-004610
03:50:38.060 --> 03:50:39.480
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: even to the continuous harassment

asr-004611
03:50:39.480 --> 03:50:40.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of student leaders,

asr-004612
03:50:40.940 --> 03:50:43.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may mga ibang-ibang mga sources po

asr-004613
03:50:43.640 --> 03:50:44.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: netong culture of harassment.

asr-004614
03:50:45.380 --> 03:50:46.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, ang sa atin po,

asr-004615
03:50:46.660 --> 03:50:47.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair,

asr-004616
03:50:47.440 --> 03:50:49.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and, of course,

asr-004617
03:50:49.080 --> 03:50:49.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to the good committee,

asr-004618
03:50:50.300 --> 03:50:52.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ayaw natin maging agents

asr-004619
03:50:52.140 --> 03:50:53.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ng pag-forward

asr-004620
03:50:53.180 --> 03:50:54.460
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: netong culture of harassment.

asr-004621
03:50:54.800 --> 03:50:55.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That's all, Mr. Chair.

asr-004622
03:50:56.080 --> 03:50:56.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you very much.

asr-004623
03:50:56.260 --> 03:50:57.760
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Just to make a manifestation also,

asr-004624
03:50:58.060 --> 03:51:00.780
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Ma'am Tokhang is no longer a state policy.

asr-004625
03:51:01.040 --> 03:51:02.200
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It has not been so

asr-004626
03:51:02.200 --> 03:51:03.560
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: in the last four years.

asr-004627
03:51:04.120 --> 03:51:05.860
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The harassment of student leaders

asr-004628
03:51:05.860 --> 03:51:07.920
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: is also not a state policy.

asr-004629
03:51:07.920 --> 03:51:11.420
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I myself was speaking in De La Salle

asr-004630
03:51:11.420 --> 03:51:14.520
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: when I was confronted by student leaders

asr-004631
03:51:14.520 --> 03:51:16.460
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: and heckled and shouted at one.

asr-004632
03:51:16.460 --> 03:51:19.240
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And I took no action.

asr-004633
03:51:19.420 --> 03:51:20.600
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: The police took no action.

asr-004634
03:51:20.600 --> 03:51:22.260
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: And we did not red-tag him at all.

asr-004635
03:51:22.260 --> 03:51:23.580
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It is not state policy.

asr-004636
03:51:23.860 --> 03:51:25.960
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: It has not been so in the last four years.

asr-004637
03:51:25.960 --> 03:51:27.100
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Okay, Mr. Chair,

asr-004638
03:51:27.220 --> 03:51:28.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang huli na lang pong...

asr-004639
03:51:28.140 --> 03:51:28.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, thank you.

asr-004640
