Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang huli na lang pong rejoinder,

asr-004641
03:51:31.840 --> 03:51:32.380
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Chair,

asr-004642
03:51:32.440 --> 03:51:32.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: if maaari,

asr-004643
03:51:32.880 --> 03:51:34.980
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: if kung ano man po yung...

asr-004644
03:51:34.980 --> 03:51:36.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Baka wala katapusan itong ano niyo, ha?

asr-004645
03:51:34.980 --> 03:51:35.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Go ahead, ma'am.

asr-004646
03:51:36.540 --> 03:51:38.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kung kaya rin po yun

asr-004647
03:51:38.120 --> 03:51:39.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at the regional level

asr-004648
03:51:39.140 --> 03:51:40.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: down to the local level,

asr-004649
03:51:40.440 --> 03:51:41.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sana po makita yun.

asr-004650
03:51:41.800 --> 03:51:42.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Agree. Thank you ma'am.

asr-004651
03:51:42.300 --> 03:51:42.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you.

asr-004653
03:51:42.600 --> 03:51:43.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Agree.

asr-004654
03:51:43.720 --> 03:51:44.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Very good.

asr-004655
03:51:44.380 --> 03:51:45.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you,

asr-004656
03:51:45.180 --> 03:51:47.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congresswoman Renee Co.

asr-004657
