03:52:06.860 --> 03:52:07.580
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Alam niyo po,

asr-004669
03:52:07.660 --> 03:52:10.260
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: di na po ako magtatanong kay Sec. John Vic eh.

asr-004670
03:52:10.260 --> 03:52:12.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kasi natetext ko naman po yan

asr-004671
03:52:12.280 --> 03:52:13.100
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: at nakakausap ko.

asr-004672
03:52:13.180 --> 03:52:13.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay, thank you,

asr-004673
03:52:13.820 --> 03:52:14.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congressman Mark Santos.

asr-004674
