Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: I just want this committee.

asr-004677
03:52:20.220 --> 03:52:20.720
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: You know.

asr-004678
03:52:21.680 --> 03:52:23.840
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Baka hindi niyo po kilala si Sec. John Vic.

asr-004679
03:52:23.840 --> 03:52:24.840
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Opo

asr-004680
03:52:23.840 --> 03:52:25.980
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Yan po ay...

asr-004681
03:52:25.980 --> 03:52:29.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Descendant po yan ng mga bayani

asr-004682
