Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Das Piñas Baco Orlan po yun.

asr-004688
03:52:42.280 --> 03:52:44.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Hindi lang po si Sec. John Vic.

asr-004689
03:52:44.280 --> 03:52:48.320
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Siguro kaya nandito po ako ngayong hapon

asr-004690
03:52:48.320 --> 03:52:49.300
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: as a congressman.

asr-004691
03:52:49.300 --> 03:52:52.620
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Yung magkapatid na Remulla po ang inspirasyon ko.

asr-004693
03:52:53.860 --> 03:52:54.460
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kaya...

asr-004695
03:52:55.280 --> 03:52:55.880
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Salamat. Salamat.

asr-004697
03:52:56.720 --> 03:52:57.920
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Well, anyway.

asr-004698
03:52:57.920 --> 03:52:59.460
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Sasagarin ko na, Sec.

asr-004699
03:52:59.460 --> 03:53:02.140
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Eh, yung katapangan niyong magkapatid eh.

asr-004700
03:53:02.200 --> 03:53:03.860
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Parang nahawa na din ako eh.

asr-004701
03:53:04.320 --> 03:53:05.340
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Eh, kasi ngayon,

asr-004702
03:53:05.340 --> 03:53:07.540
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: tinanggap ko ang committee chairmanship

asr-004703
03:53:07.540 --> 03:53:08.660
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: ng Dangerous Drugs.

asr-004704
03:53:08.780 --> 03:53:13.780
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At kahit may alinlangan yung aking may bahay,

asr-004705
