Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: eh, talagang sabi ko,

asr-004706
03:53:16.240 --> 03:53:18.520
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: si OMB Boying,

asr-004707
03:53:18.520 --> 03:53:19.740
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: at saka si John Vic,

asr-004708
03:53:19.860 --> 03:53:21.700
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: di nga natatakot eh. Diba?

asr-004709
03:53:21.700 --> 03:53:22.440
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: But anyway,

asr-004710
03:53:22.600 --> 03:53:24.280
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: going back sa drugs po,

asr-004711
03:53:24.380 --> 03:53:27.620
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: yung sinabi po ni Representative Rennie

asr-004712
03:53:27.620 --> 03:53:29.800
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: regarding sa mga social media,

asr-004713
03:53:30.920 --> 03:53:32.620
