asr-004714
03:53:32.700 --> 03:53:34.460
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Bills, actually, sa Congress.

asr-004715
03:53:34.720 --> 03:53:36.760
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Where, ah, i-restrict na po

asr-004716
03:53:36.760 --> 03:53:38.780
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: yung access sa social media.

asr-004717
03:53:39.040 --> 03:53:39.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I totally agree, sir.

asr-004718
03:53:40.140 --> 03:53:40.400
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Yes.

asr-004719
03:53:41.220 --> 03:53:43.060
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Actually, hindi lang po cyberbullying,

asr-004720
03:53:43.140 --> 03:53:44.260
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: harmful content,

asr-004721
03:53:44.480 --> 03:53:46.220
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: and digital addiction.

asr-004722
03:53:47.000 --> 03:53:48.840
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Kasama na din po dyan ngayon ng droga.

asr-004723
03:53:49.120 --> 03:53:49.660
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-004724
03:53:49.660 --> 03:53:52.120
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Diyan po nire-recruit yung mga bata, kabataan.

asr-004725
03:53:53.160 --> 03:53:55.320
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: At, ah, gusto ko lang po malaman, Sec,

asr-004726
03:53:55.720 --> 03:53:57.420
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: kung ano ba ang talagang, ah,

asr-004727
03:53:57.420 --> 03:53:59.820
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: ah, for the information of, ah,

asr-004728
03:53:59.820 --> 03:54:01.980
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: the committee also on dangerous drugs.

asr-004729
03:54:02.180 --> 03:54:04.820
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Sana po ay, ah, supportahan niyo po

asr-004730
03:54:04.820 --> 03:54:08.360
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: kung ano po ang magiging support doon sa social media ban.

asr-004731
03:54:08.980 --> 03:54:10.380
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Hindi lang po sa UK ito at saka sa...

asr-004732
03:54:10.380 --> 03:54:11.520
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Nasa Australia na din po.

asr-004733
03:54:11.540 --> 03:54:12.300
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Australia also, sir.

asr-004734
03:54:12.300 --> 03:54:13.320
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: Buong mundo na rin po ito, Sec.

asr-004735
03:54:13.320 --> 03:54:15.900
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I am in total agreement with you, sir.

asr-004736
03:54:16.700 --> 03:54:19.840
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: I am in total agreement that the ban,

asr-004737
