asr-004738
03:54:22.940 --> 03:54:25.040
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: that they be banned or restricted, ah,

asr-004739
03:54:25.040 --> 03:54:26.980
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: hours of restriction of use.

asr-004740
03:54:26.980 --> 03:54:28.360
Rep. Mark Anthony G. Santos: 14 years and below, Sec?

asr-004741
03:54:28.420 --> 03:54:28.720
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-004742
