Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Mabuti na lang.

asr-005432
04:23:32.200 --> 04:23:35.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Kasi DBM is known in Mindanao.

asr-005433
04:23:35.280 --> 04:23:37.520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Here is known as Department of Budget and Management.

asr-005434
04:23:37.980 --> 04:23:39.140
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: In Mindanao, it's known as.

asr-005435
04:23:40.000 --> 04:23:42.280
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Jutay Bahe ng Mindanao. Please proceed.

asr-005436
04:23:46.040 --> 04:23:55.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, sir. Thank you very much, Your Honor, Mr. Chairman, and the rest of the Honorable Congressmen who are here.

asr-005437
