PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Of course, if we would like to invest in peace and order and public safety,

asr-005438
04:24:00.640 --> 04:24:10.280
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: kailangan natin bigyan ang ating mga safety officers at ating mga peace officers of the necessary equipments,

asr-005439
04:24:10.440 --> 04:24:17.160
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: of the necessary training that is for capability.

asr-005440
04:24:17.560 --> 04:24:28.140
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: At kung one by one, bibigyan na natin ng pagkakataon, of course, the needed capital outlay that we had asked.

asr-005441
04:24:29.680 --> 04:24:35.760
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: The approved capital outlay that we had given, at par with that,

asr-005442
04:24:35.760 --> 04:24:40.000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: is we had lined up a 1.7 billion.

asr-005443
04:24:40.000 --> 04:24:43.880
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Worth of outlays, capital outlays.

asr-005444
