PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: hindi lang po motor vehicles ang kailangan natin.

asr-005446
04:24:55.020 --> 04:25:01.500
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We need the construction of police stations and buildings for police offices.

asr-005447
04:25:03.060 --> 04:25:09.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We need the capability enhancement for firearms as well as mobility.

asr-005448
04:25:09.640 --> 04:25:10.360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: At lalong-lalong,

asr-005449
