PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ang sinasabi nating body-worn camera and the like.

asr-005450
04:25:17.220 --> 04:25:21.400
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We have lined up about 1.7 billion, Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-005451
