Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I think he's asking about yung mga additional chief PNP, General Natates.

asr-005452
04:25:29.020 --> 04:25:31.140
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Additional request.

asr-005453
04:25:31.140 --> 04:25:33.280
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Additional request for the budget.

asr-005455
04:25:39.020 --> 04:25:40.720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-005456
04:25:40.720 --> 04:25:44.780
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: The additional request is in the amount of 1.7 billion.

asr-005457
04:25:44.780 --> 04:25:44.920
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 2 point

asr-005458
04:25:45.700 --> 04:25:46.200
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 2 billion.

asr-005459
04:25:49.920 --> 04:25:50.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-005460
04:25:51.120 --> 04:25:52.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kindly give us the details?

asr-005454
04:25:54.880 --> 04:25:55.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It's 2 billion.

asr-005461
04:25:55.860 --> 04:25:57.380
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 25 million.

asr-005462
04:25:58.600 --> 04:25:59.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Napakaliit.

asr-005463
04:25:59.180 --> 04:26:01.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Do you confirm that, Chief Natates?

asr-005464
04:26:02.800 --> 04:26:04.500
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: That's correct, Your Honor, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005465
04:26:04.580 --> 04:26:04.980
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-005466
04:26:06.900 --> 04:26:11.700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Madam Chair, so, Mr. Chairman, I have here the copy of the request to the speaker.

asr-005467
04:26:11.700 --> 04:26:20.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, I would therefore support the request for additional 2 billion to the Philippine National...

asr-005468
04:26:20.080 --> 04:26:28.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: ...Police to continue its drive against criminality, providing peace and order to the entire country, the beloved Philippines.

asr-005469
04:26:30.460 --> 04:26:34.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And now, next, because of my time, I will go to the...

asr-005470
04:26:35.040 --> 04:26:35.940
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yes, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005471
