Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We'd like to thank, of course, our Chief Efrain Emenyo.

asr-005474
04:26:48.680 --> 04:26:51.040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much for your support.

asr-005476
04:26:51.040 --> 04:26:58.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The BJMP are always serving our persons with this, the persons deprived of liberty.

asr-005477
04:26:58.440 --> 04:27:05.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Last year, I asked you for, I asked the BJMP for one prisoner's ban.

asr-005478
