BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: About 800 million.

asr-005483
04:27:19.280 --> 04:27:21.540
BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: Mr. Chairman, Your Honors.

asr-005484
