BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: The number one problem of the BJMP now is about congestion.

asr-005485
04:27:28.020 --> 04:27:39.220
BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: So, we intend to upgrade our present condition, especially in our jail facilities who are very congested.

asr-005486
