BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: That's why we are proposing an additional, because there is a lot of projects that was not included in our NEP.

asr-005487
04:27:51.100 --> 04:27:52.760
BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: That's why we are proposing...

asr-005488
04:27:52.760 --> 04:27:58.060
BJMP Chief Jail Director Efren A. Nemeño: We are proposing for an additional project in the amount of 229,157,000.

asr-005489
04:28:02.960 --> 04:28:03.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: That is for what?

asr-005490
04:28:04.080 --> 04:28:07.060
