BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: search and rescue truck.

asr-005554
04:31:08.140 --> 04:31:13.160
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: The intention of this one is to capacitate all provincial fire offices to have a rescue

