asr-005557
04:31:16.420 --> 04:31:17.780
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Another one, Mr. Chair.

asr-005558
04:31:17.980 --> 04:31:18.820
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Make it two again.

asr-005559
04:31:18.960 --> 04:31:19.320
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

