asr-005567
04:31:50.900 --> 04:31:54.480
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: for the BFP in a shorter period of time.

asr-005568
04:31:55.820 --> 04:31:58.020
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: If we give an additional 2,000 on top of the 2,000 yearly, we will be able to do the money

