asr-005571
04:32:12.880 --> 04:32:13.500
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: for legislation.

asr-005572
04:32:15.280 --> 04:32:16.800
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: 3.4, 27 million, right?

asr-005573
04:32:16.840 --> 04:32:17.480
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-005574
