Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: In the proper time, Mr. Chairman, I will move for the approval of the budget of the DLG

asr-005578
04:32:34.480 --> 04:32:39.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: and the attached agencies with all the requested increase, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005579
