DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: with that, Mr. Chair, because the warm bodies or the personnel complement of the Ministry

asr-005624
04:36:22.040 --> 04:36:27.260
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of Interior and local government in Sulu is almost the same as the structure of the

asr-005625
04:36:27.260 --> 04:36:30.020
