Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: Nakasama na ba yung personal services nila sa budget ngayon?

asr-005628
04:36:45.980 --> 04:36:52.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: For 2027, Mr. Chair, as far as LG, the local government sector, is concerned, their salaries

asr-005629
