asr-005630
04:36:54.980 --> 04:36:56.420
Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: Maraming salamat,

asr-005631
04:36:56.480 --> 04:36:57.700
Rep. Munir N. Arbison Jr.: maraming salamat, Mr. Chairman.

