Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: May iksi lang yung tanong ko, actually.

asr-005638
04:37:27.660 --> 04:37:32.740
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Right now, nag-meeting kami nung we had the initial meeting with the Department of Budget and Management when

asr-005639
04:37:32.740 --> 04:37:34.400
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: the budget was presented.

asr-005640
04:37:35.160 --> 04:37:36.700
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So we have a recurring issue.

asr-005641
