Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Not only in our city but in other cities as well.

asr-005642
04:37:40.340 --> 04:37:43.840
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: At tinuturo kami sa inyo to find a resolution.

asr-005643
