Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Because obviously, when many of these programs are stranded at hindi sa nadi-dispense

asr-005650
04:38:20.620 --> 04:38:26.520
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: o na-carry out, yung programming ng gobyerno hindi nangyayari.

asr-005651
04:38:26.600 --> 04:38:29.120
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: At yung budget na yun ay nasasayang.

asr-005652
04:38:29.280 --> 04:38:36.100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, we're talking about schools, we're talking about facilities, health facilities, but primarily

asr-005653
04:38:36.100 --> 04:38:36.520
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: schools

asr-005654
04:38:36.520 --> 04:38:37.080
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: talaga

asr-005655
04:38:37.080 --> 04:38:38.500
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: yung hindi namin naipapatayo.

asr-005656
04:38:38.500 --> 04:38:38.640
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: ...

asr-005657
04:38:38.640 --> 04:38:40.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ano bang maitutulong sa amin dyan?

asr-005658
