asr-005659
04:38:47.280 --> 04:38:54.620
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Sir, as far as requirements for example for the issuance of building permits is concerned,

asr-005660
04:38:54.720 --> 04:38:56.320
