Rep. Roberto Nazal: spent only 1.684 billion, while the accumulated earmark was already

asr-005998
04:55:54.220 --> 04:55:56.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 11.28 billion by year.

asr-005999
04:55:56.340 --> 04:55:58.300
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-006000
04:55:59.560 --> 04:56:04.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tapos at that time, Coop found 107 municipalities without activated

asr-006001
04:56:04.460 --> 04:56:11.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: fire stations. 64 had neither a fire station or a fire truck

asr-006002
04:56:11.360 --> 04:56:17.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and BFP had shortages of 20,854 fire coats, 22,000 gloves,

asr-006003
04:56:18.240 --> 04:56:19.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: 36,000

asr-006004
04:56:20.960 --> 04:56:21.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: hoods.

asr-006005
04:56:22.060 --> 04:56:22.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tama po yun?

asr-006006
04:56:22.960 --> 04:56:24.500
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-006007
04:56:24.740 --> 04:56:29.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So ang nangyayari po is kahit nag-re-request po kayo dahil alam na alam nyo na kulang

asr-006008
04:56:29.660 --> 04:56:32.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: at pondo nyo po ito, hindi po nire-release ng DBM?

asr-006009
04:56:33.060 --> 04:56:35.680
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: DBM provided only 1 billion in the form of...

asr-006010
04:56:35.680 --> 04:56:37.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit daw po? Ano po ang sagot nila?

asr-006011
04:56:38.840 --> 04:56:44.000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: There is a proposal now, Mr. Chair, Your Honor, for the full utilization of the

asr-006012
04:56:44.000 --> 04:56:49.360
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: fire code fees collections to address these particular issues. And hopefully, Congress will support

asr-006013
04:56:49.360 --> 04:56:55.140
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: this move for the full utilization of the fire code fees collections in a certain period of time.

asr-006014
04:56:55.240 --> 04:57:00.900
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So we'll be able to acquire all those necessary things under the modernization program, Your Honor.

asr-006015
04:57:00.900 --> 04:57:07.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Mr. Chair, I would just like to emphasize na pondo po nila yan, earmark po natin, tayo po naglagay,

asr-006016
04:57:07.000 --> 04:57:13.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: may batas po na na-mandated na para sa kanila po yan pero hindi po sila magkaroon ng access

asr-006017
04:57:13.520 --> 04:57:19.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: dun sa pondo nila. And up to now, dahil po dyan, hindi po na-provide yung dapat na fire

asr-006018
04:57:19.340 --> 04:57:19.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: truck

asr-006019
04:57:19.620 --> 04:57:22.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: at gamit para sa mga municipalities na nangangailangan.

asr-006020
04:57:23.220 --> 04:57:23.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Totally agree.

asr-006021
04:57:25.720 --> 04:57:26.520
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, so...

asr-006022
04:57:26.520 --> 04:57:27.440
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-006023
04:57:27.480 --> 04:57:27.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Can we wind up?

asr-006024
04:57:28.060 --> 04:57:35.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Just a last question. Quick follow-up lang po. May nanalo na ba finally sa bidding for the 500-gallon fire trucks?

asr-006025
04:57:36.160 --> 04:57:39.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How many bidders participated and sino po ang nanalo?

asr-006026
04:57:39.520 --> 04:57:46.300
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: For now, Mr. Chair, wala ho kaming bidding. The good secretary wanted to have a G2G transactions

asr-006027
04:57:46.300 --> 04:57:49.600
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: with our counterpart in the region.

asr-006028
04:57:49.880 --> 04:57:50.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ah, so G2G na po?

asr-006029
04:57:51.060 --> 04:57:54.820
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yun po ang directions ng procurement for this year, Mr. Chair.

asr-006030
04:57:54.900 --> 04:58:00.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So wala na po yung dating controversial authorization or certification requirement from Isuzu Japan?

asr-006031
04:58:00.900 --> 04:58:08.460
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Mr. Chair, because we found out that if we go to G2G, it will be lesser cost. We can acquire more to address the inadequacy.

asr-006032
04:58:08.800 --> 04:58:13.180
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And it will be, as said, malinis po na transaction.

asr-006033
04:58:13.600 --> 04:58:17.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ah, okay. So, mas maganda na po, G2G na. Hindi na pwedeng lutuin.

asr-006034
04:58:17.440 --> 04:58:18.560
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-006035
04:58:19.060 --> 04:58:20.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that, Mr. Chair.

asr-006036
04:58:21.200 --> 04:58:23.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Congressman Robert Nazal.

asr-006037
04:58:23.300 --> 04:58:29.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And for the last, ah, for the first round, last interpellator for the first round from the majority,

asr-006038
04:58:29.160 --> 04:58:32.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Congressman Attorney Tim Cayton, you're recognized.

asr-006039
04:58:32.600 --> 04:58:35.980
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much, ah, Mr. Chair.

asr-006040
04:58:37.040 --> 04:58:41.980
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Magandang araw po sa atin lahat to the DILG family headed by the good secretary,

asr-006041
04:58:42.260 --> 04:58:48.120
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Secretary John Vic Remulla. Lahat po na nandito, PNP, BFP,

asr-006042
04:58:48.120 --> 04:58:53.900
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: at ah, ah, lahat po ng guest members of the committee, isang napakagandang araw po sa atin lahat.

asr-006043
04:58:54.520 --> 04:58:56.340
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, first is to the DILG.

asr-006044
04:58:56.400 --> 04:59:01.640
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Alam mo nyo yung kung sa Nueva Vizcaya, I was once a mayor, municipal mayor.

asr-006045
04:59:02.500 --> 04:59:11.980
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, I've been in constant, ah, communication and recognition of the importance ng, ah, ah, part na DILG.

asr-006046
04:59:12.840 --> 04:59:15.520
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, you have your local operations officers.

asr-006047
04:59:16.160 --> 04:59:17.500
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: The problem is...

asr-006048
04:59:17.740 --> 04:59:23.480
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, the way I see it, nakukulangan ho yung manpower nila. Wala ho silang staff.

asr-006049
04:59:24.900 --> 04:59:31.480
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, maybe you could consider that, ah, ah, yan ho yung issue na yan na dapat ho meron.

asr-006050
04:59:31.520 --> 04:59:40.380
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Para hindi na ho sila, ah, yung sa LGU binibigyan ng mga staff, ah, charged to the LGU fund.

asr-006051
04:59:40.540 --> 04:59:43.480
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, sana ho directly from, ah, the DILG na.

asr-006052
04:59:43.480 --> 04:59:44.680
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Aside from the...

asr-006053
04:59:44.680 --> 04:59:53.300
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: operations officer, meron ho silang kasamang additional staff kasi they've been doing all the works in one municipality.

asr-006054
04:59:53.300 --> 05:00:03.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Isa lang ho ang implementing arm ng LGU, the operations officer. Hindi ho niya kakayanin lahat so suggestion ho namin may additional staff, usara sila.

asr-006055
05:00:05.820 --> 05:00:14.200
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Thank you very much for recognizing the volume, the importance, and the plight of our field officers assigned to the different local government units.

asr-006056
05:00:14.580 --> 05:00:42.820
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Actually, Mr. Chair, we are now crafting our proposed plan for the government optimization plan and we have received almost from all regions that recommendation for us to augment the workforce of our field offices in view of the continuing increase in the work that we do to support our local governments.

asr-006057
05:00:42.820 --> 05:00:43.640
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Okay.

asr-006058
05:00:43.780 --> 05:00:48.800
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Thank you, sir. Hopefully, that will be included in our program.

asr-006059
05:00:49.100 --> 05:01:07.220
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Also, I also commend the PNP sa PNP kay Sir Nartates, including the regional director, Sir Rodriguez.

asr-006060
05:01:07.220 --> 05:01:08.220
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yes.

asr-006061
05:01:11.960 --> 05:01:25.340
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, dahil ho yung issue ng peace and order sa Nueva Vizcaya. Especially, there's ongoing mining operation and a lot of people barricading the area.

asr-006062
05:01:25.620 --> 05:01:41.960
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And cases filed. Marami nang kaso na na-file at dahil sa presence ng PNP doon, including the provincial director. I commend the provincial director for the excellent performance.

asr-006063
05:01:41.960 --> 05:01:44.580
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: P.D. Paul Bometivo.

asr-006083
05:01:45.450 --> 05:01:47.000
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Sana ho may ituloy-tuloy ito.

asr-006084
05:01:47.460 --> 05:01:53.600
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ma-monitor yung issue ng mining sa Kasibu, Nueva Vizcaya.

asr-006085
05:01:53.900 --> 05:02:03.640
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Dahil ho, the issue on environmental protection, nagiging issue na ho ito ng peace and order.

asr-006086
05:02:03.960 --> 05:02:13.200
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: So, kung pwede ho mga, meron ho ng interagency linkaging PNP at the same time ito ho sa PNR.

asr-006087
05:02:13.360 --> 05:02:14.960
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yun ho lang ang request ko.

asr-006088
05:02:15.120 --> 05:02:19.660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And to the BFP, yes, BFP.

asr-006089
05:02:21.020 --> 05:02:24.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: General Kwan Tiu, please take your seat.

asr-006090
05:02:24.500 --> 05:02:27.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kung Robert, may tanong lang po dito, sorry.

asr-006091
05:02:27.400 --> 05:02:28.520
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yes, to the BFP, Sir.

asr-006092
05:02:28.700 --> 05:02:31.960
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Sir Wilberto

asr-006093
05:02:33.400 --> 05:02:35.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu.

asr-006094
05:02:35.760 --> 05:02:36.460
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Sir. Good afternoon.

asr-006095
05:02:36.960 --> 05:02:39.160
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yes. Salamat din ho for this year.

asr-006096
05:02:39.260 --> 05:02:45.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Meron ho allocated one firetruck for one of our municipality in Nueva Vizcaya.

asr-006097
05:02:45.760 --> 05:02:54.780
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And, siyempre ho, still, we are in dire need of firetruck and fire stations for J.D. Alfonso Castaneda.

asr-006098
05:02:54.780 --> 05:02:59.240
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And also for the provincial government, kailangan po nila ng additional firetruck.

asr-006099
05:02:59.240 --> 05:03:01.040
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Sana ho, this will be included.

asr-006100
05:03:01.040 --> 05:03:04.040
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yung budget for fiscal year 2027.

asr-006101
05:03:04.460 --> 05:03:11.660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Anyway, we will just submit yung support documents for that matter.

asr-006102
05:03:11.880 --> 05:03:14.860
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Also, may I request, I was just hearing about this one.

asr-006103
05:03:15.580 --> 05:03:21.980
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: About the sale of items of recruitments.

asr-006104
05:03:23.700 --> 05:03:26.140
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: This is a hearsay. I was hearing about it.

asr-006105
05:03:26.200 --> 05:03:28.720
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: May we know if this matter has reached your office?

asr-006106
05:03:28.720 --> 05:03:30.940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Sir. Just recently, Sir.

asr-006107
05:03:31.060 --> 05:03:35.400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Nagkaroon po ng entrapment operation na ginawa po sa Region 3.

asr-006108
05:03:35.480 --> 05:03:39.940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: One of our personnel engaging to anomalies and corruptions.

asr-006109
05:03:41.180 --> 05:03:47.400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Nagbebenta po siya ng slots para sigurado na makapasok yung isang applicants.

asr-006110
05:03:47.400 --> 05:03:56.200
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And we are very fortunate, the courage of the applicant to tell this matter to the BFP.

asr-006111
05:03:56.920 --> 05:04:00.580
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Kaya ho, nahuli at na-entrap po through the help of the CIDG Region 3.

asr-006112
05:04:01.420 --> 05:04:04.580
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: The good Secretary's instructions is very clear.

asr-006113
05:04:05.080 --> 05:04:07.980
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Eradicate all forms of corruption and anomalies.

asr-006114
05:04:08.140 --> 05:04:16.100
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Not only under the recruitment but as well as under the procurement of fire trucks and other equipments by the BFP.

asr-006115
05:04:16.840 --> 05:04:21.740
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ito ho yung ginagawa ng BFP ngayon, Sir. Nililinis po natin ang ating hanay.

asr-006116
05:04:21.740 --> 05:04:29.520
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: The Oplan Santindig is working the mechanism to ensure that anomalies and corruptions are being undertaken and addressed immediately.

asr-006117
05:04:30.340 --> 05:04:30.700
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Hopefully.

asr-006118
05:04:30.940 --> 05:04:36.180
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Mangyari pong malinis natin through a new form of recruitment.

asr-006119
05:04:36.180 --> 05:04:42.440
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: We have e-hiring. It's an online. At the doorstep of the applicants, they can immediately apply to the Fire Bureau

asr-006120
05:04:42.440 --> 05:04:46.060
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: without spending much of their money by going to the regional offices.

asr-006121
05:04:46.760 --> 05:04:50.720
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Tapos ang examination is being done online also through their cell phone.

asr-006122
05:04:50.780 --> 05:04:51.980
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: They can immediately get the results.

asr-006123
05:04:53.600 --> 05:05:00.700
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: With this kind of e-hiring mechanism, we can assure that at the very start of recruitment, medyo malinis po natin.

asr-006124
05:05:00.940 --> 05:05:04.620
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Just very unfortunate that doon sa last stage na po, doon po pumasok.

asr-006125
05:05:04.620 --> 05:05:09.360
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: At alam nyo po yung anomalies, pag mayroon tayong in-in-place na safety net,

asr-006126
05:05:09.480 --> 05:05:18.060
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: nagkakaroon din ng evolution of mechanism kung paano din po nila malusutan yung ganitong klaseng mekanismo na ginagawa natin.

asr-006127
05:05:18.120 --> 05:05:25.320
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: But luckily, ito nga po, ang mga aplikante po natin ay nagising na alam na po nila na talagang ang direction po ng ating good secretary

asr-006128
05:05:25.320 --> 05:05:29.080
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: is really to cleanse the agency of any anomalies.

asr-006129
05:05:29.220 --> 05:05:30.200
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And we are very happy.

asr-006130
05:05:30.200 --> 05:05:38.420
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: With what transpired during the entrapment operation, hopefully in the future or in the next succeeding recruitment,

asr-006131
05:05:38.420 --> 05:05:42.680
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: can be addressed these anomalies, Mr. Chair and Your Honor.

asr-006132
05:05:42.860 --> 05:05:44.600
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much, Chief.

asr-006133
05:05:44.840 --> 05:05:48.480
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: It's good that the matter already reached your office, Navarra.

asr-006134
05:05:48.620 --> 05:05:53.000
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And the matter will not go nationwide.

asr-006135
05:05:53.000 --> 05:06:00.820
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And hopefully, the applicants will be hired on the basis of their qualifications.

asr-006136
05:06:00.820 --> 05:06:02.460
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And merits of the applicants.

asr-006137
05:06:02.460 --> 05:06:10.400
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: At sana po, siyempre, doon sa aming probinsya, we truly needed additional items for BFP, including the BFP.

asr-006138
05:06:10.865 --> 05:06:11.780
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, Mr. Chair.

asr-006139
05:06:11.940 --> 05:06:16.180
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Rest assured that our recruitment will be based on merit and fitness.

asr-006140
05:06:16.420 --> 05:06:18.300
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: It will be fair and transparent.

asr-006141
05:06:18.300 --> 05:06:23.940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And hopefully, every year we are given 2,000 recruits by DBM.

asr-006142
05:06:23.940 --> 05:06:30.760
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: But the present strength of the BFP right now is very far from the ideal money requirement.

asr-006143
05:06:30.760 --> 05:06:34.400
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Of 78,000 for the entire across the country.

asr-006144
05:06:35.280 --> 05:06:37.440
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ang authorized strength po namin is only 43.

asr-006145
05:06:37.600 --> 05:06:42.960
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So if we have 2,000 per year, it will take us 20 years to complete the money requirements.

asr-006146
05:06:42.960 --> 05:06:45.420
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And hopefully, an additional 2,000 per year.

asr-006147
05:06:46.900 --> 05:06:51.720
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Siguro po namin na transparent, fair, and based on merit and fitness po yung maging recruit na tayo.

asr-006148
05:06:51.720 --> 05:06:53.080
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-006149
05:06:53.080 --> 05:06:53.580
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes.

asr-006150
05:06:53.160 --> 05:06:54.020
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you.

asr-006151
05:06:54.020 --> 05:06:55.860
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Kasi sayang din ho yung mga equipment natin.

asr-006152
05:06:56.020 --> 05:06:59.220
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Fire trucks, fire stations kung wala ho tayong additional manpower.

asr-006153
05:06:59.640 --> 05:07:01.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: So yun yung constraints sa grassroots.

asr-006154
05:07:01.760 --> 05:07:03.840
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: So once again, anyway, napakabot na ho namin.

asr-006155
05:07:03.940 --> 05:07:08.020
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Maraming salamat po, Chief and to our Chair.

asr-006156
05:07:24.740 --> 05:07:29.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Representative Tim Cayton and the DILG family.

asr-006157
05:07:29.180 --> 05:07:30.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Now, we proceed to our second round.

asr-006158
05:07:32.240 --> 05:07:34.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Acknowledge Representative Dadah Kiram.

asr-006159
05:07:36.480 --> 05:07:38.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair.

asr-006160
05:07:39.600 --> 05:07:44.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May katanungan lamang po ako muna sa NYC, sa National Youth Commission.

asr-006161
05:07:44.580 --> 05:07:45.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nariyan pa po ba?

asr-006162
05:07:48.520 --> 05:07:49.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pagpaumanhin po.

asr-006163
05:07:53.180 --> 05:07:56.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, kung maaari po, wala pa po akong tinatanong.

asr-006164
05:07:56.900 --> 05:07:58.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung oras ko po, tumatakbo na.

asr-006165
05:07:59.960 --> 05:08:01.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay, papaulit po na.

asr-006166
05:08:02.180 --> 05:08:06.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sabi niyo po, Mr. Chair, magiging magaan kayo ngayon sa oras.

asr-006167
05:08:07.440 --> 05:08:16.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito pong mga katanungan ay nanggaling din po sa ating mga Akbayan Youth members po natin.

asr-006168
05:08:17.340 --> 05:08:19.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Based on the research of our office,

asr-006169
05:08:19.720 --> 05:08:28.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: from the PSA, 17.4% of Filipinos aged between 5 to 24 years old are currently not in school.

asr-006170
05:08:28.380 --> 05:08:35.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: That figure is alarming considering that public education is already free for all school-age children,

asr-006171
05:08:36.000 --> 05:08:43.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: while tertiary education is also free due to the University Access to Quality Tertiary Education Act.

asr-006172
05:08:44.220 --> 05:08:48.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: What programs, if any, are included in the 2027 NEP

asr-006173
05:08:48.840 --> 05:08:52.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: to address the various situations of our out-of-school youth?

asr-006174
05:08:52.520 --> 05:08:53.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung meron man.

asr-006175
05:08:54.860 --> 05:08:58.200
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Madam Chair, actually, most of the events that we presented,

asr-006176
05:08:58.540 --> 05:09:00.180
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: all the out-of-school youth are invited.

asr-006177
05:09:00.520 --> 05:09:04.780
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: In fact, we are pushing for the legislation of the Magna Carta for Out-of-School Youth.

asr-006178
05:09:04.960 --> 05:09:07.340
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We're a very big supporter of that.

asr-006179
05:09:07.800 --> 05:09:11.260
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We do have, let's say, for instance, the pride parades that we did.

asr-006180
05:09:11.580 --> 05:09:13.580
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We worked with out-of-school youth as well.

asr-006181
05:09:14.260 --> 05:09:17.640
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We always invite Akbayan youth also for our West Philippine Sea activities.

asr-006182
05:09:17.980 --> 05:09:21.100
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So, marami ma'am naman, hindi naman po kami restrictive sa events.

asr-006183
05:09:21.100 --> 05:09:25.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Definitely, nag-a-agree po ako dyan dahil active na active po ang ating NYC.

asr-006184
05:09:26.780 --> 05:09:32.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Isa pang katanungan, are there any planned coordinations with other government agencies

asr-006185
05:09:32.320 --> 05:09:39.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: to ensure that our young learners will either be afforded or an opportunity to resume schooling

asr-006186
05:09:39.080 --> 05:09:45.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: for those of working age to be gainfully employed absent exploitation or discrimination?

asr-006187
05:09:47.980 --> 05:09:52.040
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We are currently under the National Advisory Council.

asr-006188
05:09:52.160 --> 05:09:53.440
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We are the secretariat.

asr-006189
05:09:53.820 --> 05:09:57.920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We are with DepEd being the chair.

asr-006190
05:09:58.140 --> 05:10:01.760
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And we've raised these concerns in the National Advisory Council.

asr-006191
05:10:01.860 --> 05:10:03.080
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: We hold this every quarter.

asr-006192
05:10:03.420 --> 05:10:08.460
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: And on the part of NYC, since we are limited sa advocacy and policy

asr-006193
05:10:08.460 --> 05:10:11.520
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: outside of supporting the Magna Carta for Out-of-School Youth,

asr-006194
05:10:11.720 --> 05:10:16.620
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: we do have, it's like micro events like Kamustahan.

asr-006195
05:10:17.160 --> 05:10:20.560
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: not necessarily in line with the educational standards.

asr-006196
05:10:20.560 --> 05:10:29.520
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: But we do come up with programs that entail the economic standing of the youth

asr-006197
05:10:29.520 --> 05:10:31.220
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: given na wala po silang school.

asr-006198
05:10:31.220 --> 05:10:32.920
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So, we have youth entrepreneurship program.

asr-006199
05:10:33.140 --> 05:10:36.360
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Meron po kaming 2.5 million allocated for 2027.

asr-006200
05:10:37.000 --> 05:10:39.620
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: It's a bit small pero we can make do with it.

asr-006201
05:10:39.620 --> 05:10:43.440
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: At the same time, we're partnering with DOT and DTI.

asr-006202
05:10:43.440 --> 05:10:48.020
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So, for the Philippine National Creative Youth Summit for next year.

asr-006203
05:10:48.020 --> 05:10:51.540
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: Ang goal po namin is mata po yung mga youth natin,

asr-006204
05:10:51.540 --> 05:10:53.580
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: lalo na yung out-of-school youth for arts and crafts.

asr-006205
05:10:53.580 --> 05:10:57.680
NYC Chairperson and CEO Joseph Francisco R. Ortega: So, things where they can earn without having to finish school for now.

asr-006206
05:10:57.680 --> 05:11:03.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And balita ko nga ang DTI may programa sila para sa ating mga youth.

asr-006207
05:11:03.320 --> 05:11:06.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung age 18 to 30 years old.

asr-006208
05:11:06.740 --> 05:11:08.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, ma'am. We have the Young Farmers Challenge,

asr-006209
05:11:08.860 --> 05:11:11.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: if I'm not mistaken, with the Department of Agriculture.

asr-006210
05:11:11.700 --> 05:11:13.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

asr-006211
05:11:13.400 --> 05:11:18.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako naman po ako sa isa sa mga nakakaligtaan.

asr-006212
05:11:18.240 --> 05:11:23.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa ating National Commission on Muslim Filipinos.

asr-006213
05:11:24.400 --> 05:11:28.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Napansin ko po mula kanina, wala po halos nagtatanong sa kanila.

asr-006214
05:11:28.660 --> 05:11:33.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya, tinake ko po talaga tong opportunity for a second round para maitanong naman sila.

asr-006215
05:11:34.200 --> 05:11:39.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Unang-una, gusto ko po, Mr. Chair, i-congratulate si Secretary Sabudin

asr-006216
05:11:39.220 --> 05:11:43.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: for his re-appointment as Secretary of the NCMF.

asr-006217
05:11:43.080 --> 05:11:43.880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Palakpakan naman po natin siya.

asr-006218
05:11:43.880 --> 05:11:44.880
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Thank you, thank you.

asr-006219
05:11:46.120 --> 05:11:47.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Naging matagumpay rin po.

asr-006220
05:11:47.800 --> 05:11:49.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang Hajj Operation for 2016.

asr-006221
05:11:49.900 --> 05:11:57.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And I believe so, itutuloy po ito ni Secretary Sabudin ngayong 2027 hanggang matapos ang kanyang termino.

asr-006222
05:11:58.660 --> 05:12:05.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that, napansin ko po, napakalaki ng nabawas na pondo sa inyo.

asr-006223
05:12:05.400 --> 05:12:10.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Malaking bahagi po ng budget ng NCMF ang nakalaan para sa Hajj Operation.

asr-006224
05:12:10.840 --> 05:12:16.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngunit, may mga ulat na kulang sa suporta sa mga medical needs ng mga pilgrims.

asr-006225
05:12:16.140 --> 05:12:20.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Lalong-lalo pa, 30 days silang nasa pilgrim.

asr-006226
05:12:21.180 --> 05:12:27.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tapos, nabalitaan ko, binibigyan lang daw ng isang pirasong biogesic kung kinakailangan.

asr-006227
05:12:27.780 --> 05:12:31.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Babalik na lang kung kailan kailangan ulit.

asr-006228
05:12:31.400 --> 05:12:43.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that, in this record, magkano ang eksaktong bahagi ng Hajj Operations Budget na nakalaan para sa medical needs ng pilgrims ngayong 2027 po?

asr-006229
05:12:44.000 --> 05:12:45.720
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-006230
05:12:45.980 --> 05:12:54.140
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: On our NEP for 2027, it was allocated only P616,000 for medical expenses.

asr-006231
05:12:54.520 --> 05:13:04.280
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Which is equivalent to P95 only per capita or per pilgrim on our projected 6,000 pilgrims for this 2027.

asr-006232
05:13:05.320 --> 05:13:11.240
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: So, yeah, Madam Chair, that's why we need to increase this budget.

asr-006233
05:13:11.420 --> 05:13:14.300
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Although the NCMF proposes P6.1 million.

asr-006234
05:13:14.300 --> 05:13:18.480
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: To support the medical expenses of the pilgrims.

asr-006235
05:13:18.740 --> 05:13:22.700
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: So, but it is already included in our Tier 2.

asr-006236
05:13:23.040 --> 05:13:36.520
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Hopefully, we can submit, if you may consider us, we're going to submit our enumerated list for our proposed Tier 2 budget in connection to our NEP.

asr-006237
05:13:37.300 --> 05:13:42.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mr. Chair, nakakalungkot no 95 pesos para sa 30 days.

asr-006238
05:13:43.280 --> 05:13:51.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sakaling senior citizen na, mahina na ang tuhod, 95 pesos para sa gamot.

asr-006239
05:13:52.220 --> 05:13:53.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Napakakulang po ng budget nito, Mr. Chair.

asr-006240
05:13:53.920 --> 05:13:59.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kailangan pong tugunan nito, Mr. Chair, kasi nasa ibang bansa sila.

asr-006241
05:13:59.580 --> 05:14:03.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At trabaho po ng ating gobyerno, naalagaan din po sila.

asr-006242
05:14:03.860 --> 05:14:08.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po dahil sa reliyon lang yung ginagawa nilang practice na ito.

asr-006243
05:14:09.060 --> 05:14:11.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Eh, trabaho po, mandato po ng NCMF yun.

asr-006244
05:14:11.480 --> 05:14:20.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po nila masasecure ang buhay ng ating mga pilgrim kung wala po silang pondo or sapat na pondo para isecure yung buhay nila, no?

asr-006245
05:14:21.300 --> 05:14:35.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that, Mr. Chair, if I may be allowed, gusto ko lamang pong itake yung opportunity na pakinggan naman po ang ating good secretary na ano pa po ang nabawas sa inyo, Mr. Secretary?

asr-006246
