National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Actually, yung

asr-006247
05:14:37.940 --> 05:14:39.040
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: IASP namin.

asr-006248
05:14:39.400 --> 05:14:42.540
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: But we request, Madam Chair,

asr-006249
05:14:42.760 --> 05:14:51.500
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: If not all these are approved, at least we have our three top-priority programs to be considered by the House.

asr-006250
05:14:51.500 --> 05:15:00.640
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: The first one is the Madaris, a traditional education for madrasa, which is P87.5 million, a continuing project.

asr-006251
05:15:01.840 --> 05:15:09.720
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: And the second is the Halal, Philippine Halal Industry Growth and Muslim Community Economic Empowerment Program,

asr-006252
05:15:10.000 --> 05:15:13.380
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: which is amounting to P89.494 million.

asr-006253
05:15:13.620 --> 05:15:18.480
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: And of course, our Hajj Operation Modernization Program.

asr-006254
05:15:19.780 --> 05:15:26.900
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Kasama na po doon yung P6.1 million, pero ang total po doon is P24,537,000.

asr-006255
05:15:28.200 --> 05:15:35.060
National Commission on Muslim Filipinos Secretary Sabuddin N. Abdurahim: Yun lang po. Sana, kung hindi mag-consider lahat ng request namin, at least yung top-priority programs po.

asr-006256
05:15:35.260 --> 05:15:37.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, can I interject lang

asr-006257
