06:28:15.460 --> 06:28:17.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: management or disaster

asr-007289
06:28:17.720 --> 06:28:19.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: preparedness. Hindi na po tayo

asr-007290
06:28:19.680 --> 06:28:21.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: dapat i-manage eh, dapat i-prepare.

asr-007291
06:28:21.960 --> 06:28:22.740
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Mr. Chair,

asr-007292
06:28:22.860 --> 06:28:24.580
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Your Honor,

asr-007293
06:28:25.040 --> 06:28:27.740
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: the DILG is the Vice Chair for Preparedness

asr-007294
06:28:27.740 --> 06:28:29.480
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: under the National Disaster

asr-007295
06:28:29.780 --> 06:28:30.840
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Reduction Management Council.

asr-007296
06:28:31.180 --> 06:28:33.220
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And on this note, we are working with other

asr-007297
06:28:33.220 --> 06:28:35.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: national government agencies, particularly

asr-007298
06:28:35.080 --> 06:28:37.360
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: the science agencies, to provide

asr-007299
06:28:37.360 --> 06:28:39.760
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: timely information and updates

asr-007300
06:28:39.760 --> 06:28:41.580
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: to our local governments, particularly on

asr-007301
06:28:41.580 --> 06:28:43.660
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: the high-risk areas that they have in the

asr-007302
06:28:43.660 --> 06:28:45.700
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: LGU. Those areas

asr-007303
06:28:45.700 --> 06:28:46.940
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: which are flood-prone,

asr-007304
06:28:47.080 --> 06:28:49.520
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: susceptible or vulnerable to landfills,

asr-007305
06:28:49.520 --> 06:28:51.340
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: landslides, so that our barangays

asr-007306
06:28:51.340 --> 06:28:53.660
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: particularly can already identify

asr-007307
06:28:53.660 --> 06:28:55.140
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: beforehand or prepare beforehand

asr-007308
06:28:55.140 --> 06:28:57.360
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: their constituents. So,

asr-007309
06:28:57.360 --> 06:28:59.600
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: in furtherance of the mandate

asr-007310
06:28:59.600 --> 06:29:01.500
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of the DILG, we came up with our operation

asr-007311
06:29:01.500 --> 06:29:03.640
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: list of protocols. And this operation list

asr-007312
06:29:03.640 --> 06:29:05.320
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of protocols have been implemented

asr-007313
06:29:05.320 --> 06:29:06.820
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: since 2016, 2017.

asr-007314
06:29:06.820 --> 06:29:09.440
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And we have trained local government

asr-007315
06:29:09.440 --> 06:29:11.620
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: units on how to properly

asr-007316
06:29:11.620 --> 06:29:13.620
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: respond to and mitigate the effects

asr-007317
06:29:13.620 --> 06:29:14.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of disasters.

asr-007318
06:29:15.040 --> 06:29:17.400
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: We have operation list of protocol for

asr-007319
06:29:17.400 --> 06:29:19.140
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: typhoons.

asr-007320
06:29:20.180 --> 06:29:21.240
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Operation list of protocol for volcanic

asr-007321
06:29:21.240 --> 06:29:23.920
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: eruptions, for tsunamis, landslides,

asr-007322
06:29:24.040 --> 06:29:26.160
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: and even El Nino.

asr-007323
06:29:26.340 --> 06:29:28.600
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So, that's one of the strategy

asr-007324
06:29:28.600 --> 06:29:29.920
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: that we are doing in the DILG.

asr-007325
06:29:30.420 --> 06:29:32.860
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But more than that, we are

asr-007326
06:29:32.860 --> 06:29:34.620
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: in constant contact, for example, with

asr-007327
06:29:34.620 --> 06:29:36.740
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Pag-Asa in order to provide our local governments

asr-007328
06:29:36.740 --> 06:29:38.760
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: with the latest update, particularly

asr-007329
06:29:38.760 --> 06:29:39.240
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: when

asr-007330
06:29:39.240 --> 06:29:43.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: there are typhoons and local weather disturbance in their area.

asr-007331
06:29:43.120 --> 06:29:48.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Even during the disaster, nandun yung DILG officer sa munisipyo?

asr-007332
06:29:48.780 --> 06:29:54.840
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Yes, Mr. Chair, because we are also actually monitoring the preparedness measures of the LGUs

asr-007333
06:29:54.840 --> 06:29:58.460
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: every time there's, for example, typhoons coming in our area.

asr-007334
06:30:00.100 --> 06:30:02.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mabuti po. Thank you so much for that information.

asr-007335
06:30:02.540 --> 06:30:05.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And mabuti po nabanggit niyo yung pag-asa.

asr-007336
06:30:06.420 --> 06:30:10.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We all know that mayors are the ones who declare po na walang pasok.

asr-007337
06:30:11.000 --> 06:30:14.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, napakagulo po ng sitwasyon.

asr-007338
06:30:14.240 --> 06:30:20.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Is there some way that we could put a deadline or something?

asr-007339
06:30:20.540 --> 06:30:22.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Parang guidelines po ng DILG.

asr-007340
06:30:22.600 --> 06:30:25.820
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po, alas-tris na po ng hapon, biglang wala na po.

asr-007341
06:30:25.940 --> 06:30:27.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tapos kung ano-ano pa.

asr-007342
06:30:27.740 --> 06:30:30.940
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sari-sariling LGU po ang nagde-declare.

asr-007343
06:30:31.040 --> 06:30:34.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, kuminsan ho, magkakatabi, iba-iba po yung hatol.

asr-007344
06:30:34.800 --> 06:30:38.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Is there some way that the DILG can coordinate with this?

asr-007345
06:30:38.060 --> 06:30:43.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Because this is very confusing to parents, to businesses, at sa lahat-lahat na.

asr-007346
06:30:43.500 --> 06:30:45.540
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tapos nakikita niyo po ito sa Facebook.

asr-007347
06:30:45.860 --> 06:30:53.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ang aangas po ng mga bata, demanding na wala na pong school sa kanila pong chief executives.

asr-007348
06:30:53.820 --> 06:30:56.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Is there some way that DILG can work on this?

asr-007349
06:30:56.600 --> 06:30:57.860
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Or talagang sari-sariling lang ba not?

asr-007350
06:30:59.000 --> 06:31:04.360
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Mr. Chair, there is now an ongoing effort to revisit.

asr-007351
06:31:04.700 --> 06:31:10.300
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Executive order, particularly on the declaration of suspension of classes.

asr-007352
06:31:10.560 --> 06:31:14.160
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But the policy that is now being used is still the same.

asr-007353
06:31:16.260 --> 06:31:21.360
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: We leave it to the local chief executives to declare localized suspension of classes

asr-007354
06:31:21.360 --> 06:31:27.260
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: if it's really necessary, taking into consideration the forecast given by the PAGASA.

asr-007355
06:31:29.180 --> 06:31:33.760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Late po ba talagang mag-forecast ng PAGASA para sa ating mga mayors?

asr-007356
06:31:34.880 --> 06:31:37.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And diba forecasting is a science?

asr-007357
06:31:38.500 --> 06:31:39.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Hindi naman ho hinuhulaan yan.

asr-007358
06:31:40.540 --> 06:31:46.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Well, there are, if I may, there are other apps na not only PAGASA na pwede.

asr-007359
06:31:47.020 --> 06:31:49.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May Windy, may iba-iba.

asr-007360
06:31:49.340 --> 06:31:52.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So minsan yun na po yung ginagamit rin ng mga ibang LGUs.

asr-007361
06:31:53.380 --> 06:31:56.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So yeah, yung ginagamit po natin.

asr-007362
06:31:56.160 --> 06:31:58.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But syempre, officially PAGASA pa rin.

asr-007363
06:31:59.960 --> 06:32:04.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Hindi ho pa pwedeng we work out something na may deadline naman po?

asr-007364
06:32:06.380 --> 06:32:09.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Hindi naman siguro dapat alauna ng hapon.

asr-007365
06:32:10.020 --> 06:32:14.600
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Ideally, the basis for the suspension of classes should be 11pm forecast of PAGASA

asr-007366
06:32:15.640 --> 06:32:21.980
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: so that the following day, parents and students will no longer have to go to school

asr-007367
06:32:21.980 --> 06:32:24.380
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: before the suspension is declared.

asr-007368
06:32:25.680 --> 06:32:30.660
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: I do believe that PAGASA is also doing its best to provide most accurate information

asr-007369
06:32:30.660 --> 06:32:33.540
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: to all local governments and to all our citizens.

asr-007370
06:32:33.960 --> 06:32:35.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes, thank you.

asr-007371
06:32:38.580 --> 06:32:43.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sa mga climate change threatened and forever flooded municipalities,

asr-007372
06:32:44.140 --> 06:32:50.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: first of all, I would like to commend the PNP sa kanila pong tulong sa amin sa 4th District of Pampanga.

asr-007373
06:32:50.400 --> 06:32:55.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Napakasipag po nila and they were with us last year and this year.

asr-007374
06:32:55.580 --> 06:33:00.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And sila po nagbibigay ng libring sakay so gusto ko po silang pasalamatan.

asr-007375
06:33:00.740 --> 06:33:06.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Now, the second question sa amin, I would also like to thank the BFP.

asr-007376
06:33:06.620 --> 06:33:07.620
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Meron din po silang Rinescu.

asr-007377
06:33:11.120 --> 06:33:18.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, my question is, pwede po ba natin silang i-capacitate at i-train?

asr-007378
06:33:19.060 --> 06:33:23.140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At saka nagahanap po talaga sila ng mga gamit for water rescue.

asr-007379
06:33:23.380 --> 06:33:31.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Can we identify po specific flooded areas like the entire Pampanga or maybe the 4th District of Pampanga?

asr-007380
06:33:31.320 --> 06:33:33.560
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi wala man po kami mga boats eh.

asr-007381
06:33:34.680 --> 06:33:36.380
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Konting-konti lang po talaga.

asr-007382
06:33:36.380 --> 06:33:38.300
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I think that we should...

asr-007383
06:33:38.300 --> 06:33:41.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Identify areas that need to be rescued po.

asr-007384
06:33:41.940 --> 06:33:43.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pwede po ba yun?

asr-007385
06:33:43.340 --> 06:33:49.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And can you share with us what you are doing po for water rescue, lalo na po sa flooded areas?

asr-007386
06:33:50.220 --> 06:33:51.540
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ma'am, good afternoon po.

asr-007387
06:33:52.820 --> 06:33:58.800
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yung Bureau for Protection plays a very vital role pagdating po sa HIDR, especially on flooding.

asr-007388
06:33:58.880 --> 06:34:02.200
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yung nakikita niyo po na nakatancherate are all BFP.

asr-007389
06:34:02.640 --> 06:34:07.900
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ang ginagawa po ng BFP ngayon, ma'am, continuous po yung capacity building po ng mga local disaster restaurants.

asr-007390
06:34:08.260 --> 06:34:11.100
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: At yung management office ng mga LGUs nila.

asr-007391
06:34:12.680 --> 06:34:17.760
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Isa po yan, ma'am, sa nakasama po sa listahan na mga bibiliin po ng BFP.

asr-007392
06:34:17.760 --> 06:34:22.660
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Pagdating po sa HIDR, kasama na po yung mga watercraft natin na magagamit automatically.

asr-007393
06:34:22.980 --> 06:34:24.480
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: That includes also the life vest.

asr-007394
06:34:24.940 --> 06:34:30.420
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: So hopefully po, madagdagan lang po yung pondo ng BFP para po mabiliin natin yung ating kailangan po.

asr-007395
06:34:31.340 --> 06:34:33.580
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Rest assured, susuportahan ko po yan.

asr-007396
06:34:33.800 --> 06:34:37.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And is it possible po that we would give the boats?

asr-007397
06:34:38.440 --> 06:34:42.660
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Mga gamit po sa mga places na talagang alam po natin na binabaha?

asr-007398
06:34:43.280 --> 06:34:48.980
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Ma'am, meron na po kaming identified mga localities na constantly po, maliit lang na ulan, binabaha kagad.

asr-007399
06:34:50.440 --> 06:34:53.120
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Like yung mga nandun po sa Project NOAA, for example?

asr-007400
06:34:53.720 --> 06:34:54.220
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Yes, ma'am.

asr-007401
06:34:54.880 --> 06:34:58.860
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Pagka po, nadagdagan lang po yung pondo at mabibili po yung mga gamit namin,

asr-007402
06:34:58.900 --> 06:35:04.520
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: that will be distributed geographically kung ano po yung needs ng mga local fire stations natin.

asr-007403
06:35:05.540 --> 06:35:08.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po sa amin, umaagos talaga yung tubig.

asr-007404
06:35:08.000 --> 06:35:10.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And somebody drowned actually in front of me.

asr-007405
06:35:10.920 --> 06:35:13.140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At talagang kulang po yung gamit nila.

asr-007406
06:35:13.260 --> 06:35:16.480
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, if you could support us po, we would be very grateful.

asr-007407
06:35:17.340 --> 06:35:23.800
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Rest assured, ma'am, that we will do our best to help in the capacity building po ng mga local disaster reduction management office po natin,

asr-007408
06:35:23.820 --> 06:35:25.240
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: yung mga parang gay disaster po.

asr-007409
06:35:25.300 --> 06:35:27.540
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Constant naman po yung mga trainings namin sa kanila.

asr-007410
06:35:27.540 --> 06:35:32.520
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: And hopefully in the future, ma-acquire po namin yung mga necessary equipments

asr-007411
06:35:32.520 --> 06:35:38.000
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: and that will be placed doon po sa mga localities na talaga po tinatamaan po, baha or whatever.

asr-007412
06:35:39.200 --> 06:35:40.940
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Kahit o hydromet hazards na meron po sila.

asr-007413
06:35:40.940 --> 06:35:43.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sige po. And we look forward to that.

asr-007414
06:35:43.360 --> 06:35:46.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sana po our PNPG would look into that also.

asr-007415
06:35:46.000 --> 06:35:46.280
BFP Officer-in-Charge Fire Chief Superintendent Wilberto Rico Neil A. Kwan Tiu: Thank you.

asr-007416
06:35:46.360 --> 06:35:53.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, after climate change po, my next question is regarding po yung

asr-007417
06:35:53.080 --> 06:35:59.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: alam na po natin na talagang laganap na po ang mga threats sa bawat school po.

asr-007418
06:35:59.720 --> 06:36:06.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At araw-araw daw yung mga PNP nandun na po sa bawat school checking up on threats.

asr-007419
06:36:06.740 --> 06:36:08.060
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, my question is,

asr-007420
06:36:08.220 --> 06:36:14.140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Paano po, parang nagkaroon po ng access sa mga barel ang mga bata?

asr-007421
06:36:14.940 --> 06:36:20.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I believe these are registered firearms given to licensed personnel.

asr-007422
06:36:21.240 --> 06:36:27.780
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Like yung isa po, yung tita niya was a nurse, a lawyer, and a policeman, a policewoman.

asr-007423
06:36:28.080 --> 06:36:30.000
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And the other one po, yung daddy niya po, customs.

asr-007424
06:36:30.440 --> 06:36:32.020
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: How are you training po?

asr-007425
06:36:32.700 --> 06:36:36.260
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Parang hindi po unregistered eh. Registered pa po yung mga firearms.

asr-007426
06:36:36.640 --> 06:36:37.900
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Tama po ba ako doon?

asr-007427
06:36:38.640 --> 06:36:40.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you for the last question.

asr-007428
06:36:46.300 --> 06:36:47.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kindly answer.

asr-007429
06:36:47.520 --> 06:36:49.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-007430
06:36:50.640 --> 06:37:05.280
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Those recovered firearms that were used in June 16 as well as in Zamboanga are all registered firearms except for the other one.

asr-007431
06:37:05.280 --> 06:37:12.540
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, the Philippine National Police, of course, in coordination with other law enforcement units,

asr-007432
06:37:12.540 --> 06:37:13.900
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and as well,

asr-007433
06:37:13.900 --> 06:37:17.980
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: as a unit responsible for regulating these firearms.

asr-007434
06:37:18.180 --> 06:37:20.640
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Ginagawa po ng paraan with regards to several policies.

asr-007435
06:37:21.120 --> 06:37:30.580
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: As to when we say these are within the reach of children, of course, or minor,

asr-007436
06:37:30.780 --> 06:37:32.560
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: of course, nandun na yung indication.

asr-007437
06:37:32.780 --> 06:37:37.840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: But that's why we have prepared cases against these personalities

asr-007438
06:37:37.840 --> 06:37:40.900
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: who are supposed to be the custodian of these firearms.

asr-007439
06:37:41.200 --> 06:37:43.720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And one of...

asr-007440
06:37:43.720 --> 06:37:55.840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: The recommendation was, of course, the enactment of law such that maripil yung naging bailable ang ating violation of firearms,

asr-007441
06:37:56.380 --> 06:37:58.020
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: illegal possession of firearms.

asr-007442
06:37:58.240 --> 06:38:07.000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We are recommending that a higher penalty be imposed for those in possession of unlicensed firearms.

asr-007443
06:38:07.500 --> 06:38:13.300
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Especially so that unlicensed firearms are being used in the commission of crime.

asr-007444
06:38:13.300 --> 06:38:22.380
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: About 98% of the cases involving firearms are unlicensed firearms.

asr-007445
06:38:22.680 --> 06:38:24.040
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-007446
06:38:28.300 --> 06:38:34.360
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And lastly, ano po yung maging role po ng barangay Tanots and the barangay regarding this?

asr-007447
06:38:35.780 --> 06:38:38.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Ito pong mga nagiging violence in schools.

asr-007448
06:38:42.360 --> 06:38:44.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Just like the police.

asr-007449
06:38:44.880 --> 06:38:46.720
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: At may role po ba sila?

asr-007450
06:38:47.160 --> 06:38:49.320
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair and Your Honor.

asr-007451
06:38:49.500 --> 06:38:55.960
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Ang alam naman natin ng peace and order ay shared responsibility of the community and the...

asr-007452
06:38:56.920 --> 06:38:58.640
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Kasi po, sir, sorry po.

asr-007453
06:38:58.640 --> 06:39:01.240
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Limited lang po ang polis sa isang munisipyo eh.

asr-007454
06:39:01.280 --> 06:39:04.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And they cannot be patrolling all the elementary schools.

asr-007455
06:39:04.160 --> 06:39:09.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Though ako po as a parent, bahala na po yung ibang crimes, basta okay lang po yung mga kids.

asr-007456
06:39:10.080 --> 06:39:11.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pero again, that is not realistic.

asr-007457
06:39:12.440 --> 06:39:14.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Pero kung tatangin niyo po, gusto ko yun.

asr-007458
06:39:14.680 --> 06:39:15.340
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes, ma'am.

asr-007459
06:39:15.340 --> 06:39:15.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-007460
06:39:15.700 --> 06:39:17.020
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-007461
06:39:17.280 --> 06:39:18.180
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Actually, there are...

asr-007462
06:39:18.180 --> 06:39:20.800
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 42,000 barangays nationwide.

asr-007463
06:39:21.840 --> 06:39:27.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Kung pibilangin na lang natin ang number of schools, there are, of course, more than 42,000.

asr-007464
06:39:31.560 --> 06:39:32.240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 42,000 schools.

asr-007465
06:39:32.660 --> 06:39:38.820
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, let's say it's about 56,000 schools nationwide, including those private schools.

asr-007466
06:39:39.420 --> 06:39:47.700
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So, it is a must that we multiply each other, especially in negating the occurrence of crime

asr-007467
06:39:47.700 --> 06:39:49.360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and maintaining peace and order.

asr-007468
06:39:49.620 --> 06:39:55.640
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: The best po dyan is the police, other law enforcement agencies working together with the community

asr-007469
06:39:55.640 --> 06:40:02.800
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: para po may capacitate at madinay natin by police presence or presence of our...

asr-007470
06:40:02.800 --> 06:40:08.180
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: presence of this police in the community, especially in the school.

asr-007471
06:40:08.180 --> 06:40:19.100
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And if we have 230,000 and then say another times 3, 42,000 times 7 of barangay,

asr-007472
06:40:19.100 --> 06:40:23.960
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: parangay, tanods, napakarami nun.

asr-007473
06:40:24.100 --> 06:40:28.440
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: But it is not the efficient way of maintaining peace and order.

asr-007474
06:40:30.160 --> 06:40:30.880
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes.

asr-007475
06:40:30.880 --> 06:40:32.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Teamwork na lang.

asr-007476
06:40:33.940 --> 06:40:39.160
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Sila muna yung una, tapos pag kayo na po yung re-rescue sa kanila.

asr-007477
06:40:39.960 --> 06:40:41.120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-007478
06:40:41.260 --> 06:40:41.360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: through,

asr-007479
06:40:41.360 --> 06:40:43.760
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: We have five statistics of...

asr-007480
06:40:45.200 --> 06:40:48.120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We are sitting together, engaging each other, and...

asr-007481
06:40:49.200 --> 06:40:52.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: making sure that we have our security plan for that.

asr-007482
06:40:55.620 --> 06:41:01.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May mga data po ba kayo regarding crime, kung ina niyong pinatay, kanila, or...

asr-007483
06:41:01.500 --> 06:41:02.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actions going down.

asr-007484
06:41:03.660 --> 06:41:05.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Napakagaling po ng polis natin.

asr-007485
06:41:05.180 --> 06:41:08.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Under the leadership of General Atates.

asr-007486
06:41:09.040 --> 06:41:11.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Meron po ba kayong crime statistics?

asr-007487
06:41:11.280 --> 06:41:12.400
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Like, pwede naman po...

asr-007488
06:41:12.060 --> 06:41:13.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes. Can you submit the...

asr-007489
06:41:14.260 --> 06:41:16.280
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Yes, I'm actually curious lang po.

asr-007490
06:41:17.120 --> 06:41:17.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: To this committee?

asr-007491
06:41:17.860 --> 06:41:18.720
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Sir, yes.

asr-007492
06:41:19.460 --> 06:41:20.980
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I'm hoping pababa po.

asr-007493
06:41:22.180 --> 06:41:23.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, it is.

asr-007494
06:41:23.660 --> 06:41:26.960
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Sir Chair, we'll be submitting the data.

asr-007495
06:41:27.200 --> 06:41:30.120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: But as far as I can remember,

asr-007496
06:41:30.880 --> 06:41:36.380
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: when we implemented and or launched our Safer Cities,

asr-007497
06:41:36.580 --> 06:41:41.260
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: lalong-lalo na yun ang utos ng ating SILG Remulia,

asr-007498
06:41:43.460 --> 06:41:48.280
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: bumaba po ang occurrence ng focus crime by 12%.

asr-007499
06:41:48.280 --> 06:41:49.000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: If we're...

asr-007500
06:41:49.000 --> 06:41:56.200
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: To compare a period of one year,

asr-007501
06:41:56.280 --> 06:42:02.700
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: one year today and one year before this period,

asr-007502
06:42:02.700 --> 06:42:05.880
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ay about 25% po ang reduction.

asr-007503
06:42:06.140 --> 06:42:07.120
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: So napakababa po.

asr-007504
06:42:07.660 --> 06:42:11.240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: That's why, per tourist index,

asr-007505
06:42:11.660 --> 06:42:19.940
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: tumaas po yung pan natin ng tourist visitors dito sa Pilipinas.

asr-007506
06:42:20.040 --> 06:42:20.780
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: We're ranked.

asr-007507
06:42:20.780 --> 06:42:23.300
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: By about 60%.

asr-007508
06:42:23.300 --> 06:42:24.800
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 65%.

asr-007509
06:42:24.800 --> 06:42:27.100
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: As to the crime index,

asr-007510
06:42:27.440 --> 06:42:29.520
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: crime index, bumaba po.

asr-007511
06:42:30.360 --> 06:42:31.440
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Bumaba po.

asr-007512
06:42:32.140 --> 06:42:32.700
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Sa datang crime index,

asr-007513
06:42:32.800 --> 06:42:34.500
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: nandito tayo sa ranking.

asr-007514
06:42:34.500 --> 06:42:36.360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Pang-rank,

asr-007515
06:42:36.360 --> 06:42:38.980
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: 45%.

asr-007516
06:42:40.220 --> 06:42:41.240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Your Honor, Mr. Chair.

asr-007517
06:42:41.660 --> 06:42:42.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you.

asr-007518
06:42:42.380 --> 06:42:43.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, thank you, ma'am.

asr-007519
06:42:43.620 --> 06:42:44.800
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, I'm sure po pababa yun.

asr-007520
06:42:45.460 --> 06:42:48.680
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And I would just like to see a listing po.

asr-007521
06:42:48.940 --> 06:42:50.960
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Baka ho, Central Luzon,

asr-007522
06:42:50.960 --> 06:42:52.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and Metro Manila.

asr-007523
06:42:52.200 --> 06:42:52.320
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: Opo.

asr-007524
06:42:52.400 --> 06:42:56.100
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: So, that concludes po yung mga tanong ko.

asr-007525
06:42:56.200 --> 06:43:00.080
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: I would again like to thank our PNP po sa tulong po sa akin

asr-007526
06:43:01.620 --> 06:43:03.600
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: netong tumating pong habagat.

asr-007527
06:43:04.200 --> 06:43:06.920
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And sana po, wag po kayong bibitaw sa amin

asr-007528
06:43:06.920 --> 06:43:10.200
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: dahil po talagang binabaha po yung aming lugar.

asr-007529
06:43:10.520 --> 06:43:14.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And rest assured po of the full support for Secretary Remolia

asr-007530
06:43:14.420 --> 06:43:18.420
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: and our Chief PNP po sa inyo pong budget.

asr-007531
06:43:18.680 --> 06:43:21.140
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: And to the DILG family, maraming salamat.

asr-007532
06:43:21.140 --> 06:43:21.340
Rep. Anna York P. Bondoc, M.D.: po.

asr-007533
06:43:21.340 --> 06:43:21.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ah

asr-007534
06:43:21.560 --> 06:43:25.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Congressman Anna York Bondoc

asr-007535
06:43:26.060 --> 06:43:29.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang last na po mag-interpellate, pero bago po yan,

asr-007536
06:43:29.380 --> 06:43:33.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I would like to recognize the presence of our SDS,

asr-007537
06:43:34.200 --> 06:43:34.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dinan Hernandez.

asr-007538
06:43:35.380 --> 06:43:37.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang pinakahuli na po magtatanong sa inyo,

asr-007539
06:43:38.620 --> 06:43:40.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: hinihintay po po natin si Chairman Micah Sonsing.

asr-007540
06:43:41.800 --> 06:43:45.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pero habang wala siya, may clarificatory question lang po ako.

asr-007541
06:43:46.060 --> 06:43:50.080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pwede pong magtanong sa DILG and even sa police.

asr-007542
06:43:50.540 --> 06:43:52.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we, ayan.

asr-007543
06:43:52.660 --> 06:43:53.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, boss.

asr-007544
06:43:53.440 --> 06:43:58.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May incident lang po sa amin pong district

asr-007545
06:43:58.560 --> 06:44:03.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na may nagsulat na po ang mga winning contractors sa amin

asr-007546
06:44:05.260 --> 06:44:09.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: regarding yung mga hulihan na mga bako, mga equipment nila.

asr-007547
06:44:10.250 --> 06:44:16.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, hindi na po nila alam ang difference between excavation and quarrying.

asr-007548
06:44:17.430 --> 06:44:18.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, we have the letter already.

asr-007549
06:44:19.580 --> 06:44:22.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It was received na by Secretary Vince Dizon.

asr-007550
06:44:23.200 --> 06:44:30.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And for sure, tatanungin po ang DNR and then tatanungin po rin ng DILG,

asr-007551
06:44:30.820 --> 06:44:33.000
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: then ang ating kapulisan.

asr-007552
06:44:33.000 --> 06:44:37.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil ang involved po dito, ang tinatawag po sa amin na Sagip Kalikasan Task Force.

asr-007553
06:44:37.720 --> 06:44:38.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So,

asr-007554
06:44:38.740 --> 06:44:41.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, even po yung mga re-blocking na mga daan,

asr-007555
06:44:41.640 --> 06:44:44.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: siyempre po gagamit ka ng bakho,

asr-007556
06:44:44.100 --> 06:44:48.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang tawag po nila doon, quarrying na.

asr-007557
06:44:48.160 --> 06:44:51.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And ang tinatanong po namin, are they allowed?

asr-007558
06:44:52.560 --> 06:45:00.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is the Sagip Kalikasan Task Force na mga tao ng provincial government,

asr-007559
06:45:00.020 --> 06:45:04.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: are they allowed to impound heavy equipment

asr-007560
06:45:04.440 --> 06:45:08.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na ginagamit po sa development, sa paggawaan ng mga daan

asr-007561
06:45:08.820 --> 06:45:13.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: sa buong-buong Pilipinas, huwag lang po sa amin sa Camarines World.

asr-007562
06:45:14.030 --> 06:45:17.800
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I would like to seek the first DILG, the opinion.

asr-007563
06:45:22.900 --> 06:45:23.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-007564
06:45:23.880 --> 06:45:30.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Meron pong contractor doon, anim na po na backhoe ang nakuha

asr-007565
06:45:30.060 --> 06:45:34.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dahil kumagawa po ng flood control.

asr-007566
06:45:36.380 --> 06:45:37.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes.

asr-007567
06:45:39.460 --> 06:45:42.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And I will submit also a copy.

asr-007568
06:45:42.700 --> 06:45:43.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Unahan ko na.

asr-007569
06:45:42.700 --> 06:45:47.080
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: Thank you very much, Mr. Chair.

asr-007570
06:45:47.220 --> 06:45:50.760
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: As far as confiscation of equipment belonging to the,

asr-007571
06:45:50.760 --> 06:45:57.360
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: belonging to some people engaged in quarrying or excavation,

asr-007572
06:45:58.050 --> 06:46:00.460
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: now the possibility of...

asr-007573
06:46:00.460 --> 06:46:02.680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: First, first, they're not engaged.

asr-007574
06:46:03.210 --> 06:46:06.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: What is the difference of excavation and quarrying?

asr-007575
06:46:07.910 --> 06:46:10.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: For example, sir, para mas malinaw,

asr-007576
06:46:10.700 --> 06:46:12.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: gumagawa po ako online kanal.

asr-007577
06:46:14.200 --> 06:46:17.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is that quarrying or excavation?

asr-007578
06:46:17.480 --> 06:46:18.500
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: That is excavation, sir.

asr-007579
06:46:18.640 --> 06:46:19.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Exactly.

asr-007580
06:46:19.040 --> 06:46:19.740
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: Now, when you quarry...

asr-007581
06:46:20.520 --> 06:46:23.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kumagawa po tayo ng re-blocking.

asr-007582
06:46:24.730 --> 06:46:26.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is that quarrying or excavation?

asr-007583
06:46:26.800 --> 06:46:28.100
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: I think that is also excavation, Your Honor.

asr-007584
06:46:28.100 --> 06:46:28.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Excavation. Okay.

asr-007585
06:46:29.940 --> 06:46:31.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Clearing po, dahil nag-landslide.

asr-007586
06:46:32.650 --> 06:46:35.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: May landslide sa bundok, nag-clearing po sa daan.

asr-007587
06:46:35.970 --> 06:46:38.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Is that quarrying or clearing?

asr-007588
06:46:39.080 --> 06:46:39.980
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: Same, same answer, Your Honor.

asr-007589
06:46:39.980 --> 06:46:40.360
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Okay.

asr-007590
06:46:40.180 --> 06:46:44.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang tanong ko po ba, pwede po bang i-impound?

asr-007591
06:46:45.700 --> 06:46:47.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nang mga tao ng probinsya,

asr-007592
06:46:47.900 --> 06:46:51.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang mga equipment na ito po yung ginagawa.

asr-007593
06:46:52.600 --> 06:46:56.120
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: Well, by and large, as long as the act is not illegal,

asr-007594
06:46:56.520 --> 06:46:59.460
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: it is not a travesty of any existing law.

asr-007595
06:46:59.660 --> 06:47:01.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And plus, we have to remember,

asr-007596
06:47:02.240 --> 06:47:04.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: any, nag-mayor po ako,

asr-007597
06:47:04.460 --> 06:47:07.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: any local ordinance, municipal,

asr-007598
06:47:07.280 --> 06:47:09.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: or even po, provincial,

asr-007599
06:47:09.400 --> 06:47:11.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: we cannot supersede any national law.

asr-007600
06:47:12.560 --> 06:47:13.140
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: That's correct, Your Honor.

asr-007601
06:47:13.400 --> 06:47:14.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: That's why I'm asking,

asr-007602
06:47:14.220 --> 06:47:16.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: are they allowed to impound?

asr-007603
06:47:16.500 --> 06:47:17.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes or no?

asr-007604
06:47:17.960 --> 06:47:24.120
DILG Undersecretary for External, Legal and Legislative Affairs Romeo P. Benitez: I don't think that authority is vested on the part of the LGU for that matter.

asr-007605
06:47:24.240 --> 06:47:24.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, kindly study it.

asr-007606
06:47:25.480 --> 06:47:27.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil ang next question ko naman po sa kapulisan.

asr-007607
06:47:28.260 --> 06:47:30.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Meron pong incident po sa amin,

asr-007608
06:47:30.280 --> 06:47:31.760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na private land,

asr-007609
06:47:31.980 --> 06:47:34.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: may backhoe rin,

asr-007610
06:47:34.300 --> 06:47:36.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: na gumagawa ng fishpond.

asr-007611
06:47:38.220 --> 06:47:40.180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Kinukuha rin po ng kaligasan,

asr-007612
06:47:40.180 --> 06:47:42.300
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dahil yung po raw ay quarrying.

asr-007613
06:47:42.300 --> 06:47:45.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ano po ang aksyon na dapat,

asr-007614
06:47:45.580 --> 06:47:48.120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: we are just, we would just want to clarify this.

asr-007615
06:47:48.120 --> 06:47:49.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: No? So, ah,

asr-007616
06:47:50.240 --> 06:47:51.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kasi in our area,

asr-007617
06:47:51.480 --> 06:47:52.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: just to tell you honestly,

asr-007618
06:47:52.980 --> 06:47:56.440
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: mas matatapang pa ang Sagip Kaligasan Task Force

asr-007619
06:47:56.440 --> 06:47:58.140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kaysa sa mga polis natin.

asr-007620
06:47:59.160 --> 06:48:01.480
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And that is the situation in our area.

asr-007621
06:48:01.480 --> 06:48:04.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, what should we do?

asr-007622
06:48:05.560 --> 06:48:07.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Please give us your guidance.

asr-007623
06:48:08.900 --> 06:48:10.360
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Ah, Mr. Chair, of course, ah,

asr-007624
06:48:10.360 --> 06:48:11.980
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: the Philippine National Police

asr-007625
06:48:11.980 --> 06:48:14.540
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: nage-exist to enforce the law.

asr-007626
06:48:14.540 --> 06:48:16.940
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: In enforcing the law, of course,

asr-007627
06:48:16.940 --> 06:48:18.600
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ah, for example, we have this, ah,

asr-007628
06:48:19.940 --> 06:48:22.760
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ah, heavy utility machineries

asr-007629
06:48:22.760 --> 06:48:23.840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: involved in, ah,

asr-007630
06:48:26.200 --> 06:48:26.900
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: um, excavation

asr-007631
06:48:26.900 --> 06:48:28.240
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: and or quarrying.

asr-007632
06:48:28.240 --> 06:48:30.660
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: If these machines are,

asr-007633
06:48:31.780 --> 06:48:32.840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: are, ah, being used

asr-007634
06:48:32.840 --> 06:48:33.820
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: in the conduct of, ah, or

asr-007635
06:48:33.820 --> 06:48:36.540
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: imponderance of, ah, illegal activities,

asr-007636
06:48:36.980 --> 06:48:38.660
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: whether this is

asr-007637
06:48:38.660 --> 06:48:40.540
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: in violation of the special laws,

asr-007638
06:48:40.820 --> 06:48:42.520
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: DNR laws, or,

asr-007639
06:48:44.480 --> 06:48:45.200
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: um, local, ah,

asr-007640
06:48:45.200 --> 06:48:46.780
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ordinances or local laws,

asr-007641
06:48:47.580 --> 06:48:48.920
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: ah, we are bound to

asr-007642
06:48:48.920 --> 06:48:49.780
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: implement it.

asr-007643
06:48:50.840 --> 06:48:52.680
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: Yes. Um, and

asr-007644
06:48:52.680 --> 06:48:54.340
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: sa pag-implement po nito,

asr-007645
06:48:54.520 --> 06:48:57.060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kahit po Sagip Kaligasan ang tawag,

asr-007646
06:48:57.060 --> 06:48:58.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dapat po ay deputize po

asr-007647
06:48:58.700 --> 06:49:00.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ng DNR.

asr-007648
06:49:01.060 --> 06:49:02.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Am I correct?

asr-007649
06:49:03.220 --> 06:49:04.900
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: That's correct, sir. That is always

asr-007650
06:49:04.900 --> 06:49:06.840
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: in coordination with the

asr-007651
06:49:06.840 --> 06:49:08.660
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: appropriate agency. And for that

asr-007652
06:49:08.660 --> 06:49:11.080
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: matter, ah, in that instance,

asr-007653
06:49:11.260 --> 06:49:13.000
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: that would be the DNR.

asr-007654
06:49:13.000 --> 06:49:14.740
PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr.: And the LGU.

asr-007655
06:49:14.860 --> 06:49:16.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes. Kasi ang alam ko po

asr-007656
06:49:16.860 --> 06:49:18.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: dyan, ah, kahit deputize po

asr-007657
06:49:18.920 --> 06:49:20.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kayo, hindi kayo pasabasa pwedeng

asr-007658
06:49:20.880 --> 06:49:22.600
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: humuli, dapat kasama

asr-007659
06:49:22.600 --> 06:49:24.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ang DNR, lalo na kasama

asr-007660
06:49:24.980 --> 06:49:26.740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: rin po ang ating kapulisan. And

asr-007661
06:49:26.740 --> 06:49:28.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: even ang ating kapulisan, kahit deputize

asr-007662
06:49:28.860 --> 06:49:30.640
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: po kayo, may nahuli po tayong illegal

asr-007663
06:49:30.640 --> 06:49:32.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: logging, ay sinosurrender po

asr-007664
06:49:32.820 --> 06:49:34.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: natin sa DNR.

asr-007665
06:49:34.900 --> 06:49:36.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ngayon po, ang nangyari po sa amin,

asr-007666
06:49:36.840 --> 06:49:37.840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: basta kinukuha yung bako,

asr-007667
06:49:38.320 --> 06:49:40.260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nandoon na po sa Kapitolyo.

asr-007668
06:49:40.500 --> 06:49:42.320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, ang gagawin na lang ay, ah,

asr-007669
06:49:42.320 --> 06:49:44.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kakaso, alam naman po natin

asr-007670
06:49:44.980 --> 06:49:46.500
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pag nagkaso, matagal,

asr-007671
06:49:46.540 --> 06:49:47.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: bulok na po yung bako.

asr-007672
06:49:48.380 --> 06:49:50.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, ang tanong lang po namin yung

asr-007673
06:49:50.940 --> 06:49:51.380
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: immediate, ahm,

asr-007674
06:49:51.680 --> 06:49:54.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: can we run

asr-007675
06:49:54.240 --> 06:49:56.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: sa PNP

asr-007676
06:49:56.400 --> 06:49:58.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pag may ganito pong

asr-007677
06:49:58.980 --> 06:49:59.620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: insidente?

asr-007678
06:50:00.440 --> 06:50:02.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It is a national government

asr-007679
06:50:02.540 --> 06:50:04.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: project na

asr-007680
06:50:04.560 --> 06:50:06.160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: gumagawa po ng daan.

asr-007681
06:50:06.480 --> 06:50:09.020
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Doon po kasi kami nagugulat dahil,

asr-007682
06:50:09.020 --> 06:50:10.780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: ah, siyempre

asr-007683
06:50:10.780 --> 06:50:12.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: gagamit ka ng bako pag, ah,

asr-007684
06:50:12.040 --> 06:50:14.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: nag-reblocking ka.

asr-007685
06:50:14.640 --> 06:50:16.980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Pero pag ganon ay nangyayari

asr-007686
06:50:16.980 --> 06:50:18.900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: po tong insidente nito sa amin.

asr-007687
06:50:19.020 --> 06:50:20.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, ahm, I'm just letting you

asr-007688
06:50:20.940 --> 06:50:22.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: know that, ah, this is

asr-007689
06:50:22.860 --> 06:50:24.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: happening in my district.

asr-007690
06:50:24.520 --> 06:50:26.660
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ah, there are contractors na

asr-007691
06:50:27.980 --> 06:50:28.880
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: anim na po yung nakuha.

