Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I'm just here to express my support.

asr-007872
07:21:50.900 --> 07:21:56.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And actually, baliktad po, I'm here to ask actually what else we can do

asr-007873
07:21:56.900 --> 07:22:01.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for the DILG moving forward as we go through the deliberations.

asr-007874
07:22:01.700 --> 07:22:07.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So siguro po, nabanggit na po ni Cong. Arnie.

asr-007875
07:22:07.020 --> 07:22:08.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: He's had discussions.

asr-007876
07:22:08.720 --> 07:22:10.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As of course, the...

asr-007877
07:22:10.300 --> 07:22:15.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The person who will be defending the budget of the DILG has had the discussions

asr-007878
07:22:15.420 --> 07:22:20.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: with the different, with DILG and all the attached agencies

asr-007879
07:22:20.040 --> 07:22:24.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: with regard to the additional requirements or proposals

asr-007880
07:22:24.860 --> 07:22:30.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or additional budget for consideration that you would like to put forth.

asr-007881
07:22:31.700 --> 07:22:35.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So siguro po, sinabi na po yan Nikong Arnie.

asr-007882
07:22:37.160 --> 07:22:40.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I don't know if you'd like to say it to me.

asr-007883
07:22:41.320 --> 07:22:43.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ano po yung laman ng wish list ninyo?

asr-007884
07:22:43.180 --> 07:22:45.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Or would you just prefer to write to the committee?

asr-007885
07:22:46.020 --> 07:22:46.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sulat na lang po.

asr-007886
07:22:46.760 --> 07:22:47.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-007887
07:22:46.760 --> 07:22:53.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In terms of logistics po, I'll just request if we could have the request

asr-007888
07:22:53.760 --> 07:23:01.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for additional consideration by Thursday po ngayon.

asr-007889
07:23:01.160 --> 07:23:03.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: By the first half of next week, if possible.

asr-007890
07:23:03.360 --> 07:23:03.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because we...

asr-007891
07:23:03.980 --> 07:23:07.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: One of the major reforms that we've done in the Committee on Appropriations is

asr-007892
07:23:07.960 --> 07:23:11.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we are now

asr-007893
07:23:11.240 --> 07:23:11.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: institutionalizing

asr-007894
07:23:11.240 --> 07:23:12.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The Budget Amendments Reviews of Committee,

asr-007895
07:23:12.940 --> 07:23:17.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which openly deliberates on all the requests for institutional amendments

asr-007896
07:23:17.800 --> 07:23:19.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: emanating from the agencies.

asr-007897
07:23:19.800 --> 07:23:21.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So yun po sana yung request namin.

asr-007898
07:23:21.680 --> 07:23:26.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As we are targeting to convene the BARC in about a week or so

asr-007899
07:23:26.360 --> 07:23:27.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: before the plenary.

asr-007900
07:23:27.620 --> 07:23:32.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Para po mahimay na namin yung mga budget requests po.

asr-007901
07:23:32.620 --> 07:23:36.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At saka maisama po namin for consideration of BARC.

asr-007902
07:23:36.400 --> 07:23:40.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So hopefully po, if it's okay po, by the first half of next week,

asr-007903
07:23:40.920 --> 07:23:42.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: if we could have those.

asr-007904
07:23:42.820 --> 07:23:45.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And siguro, Kong Arnie, if I may,

asr-007905
07:23:45.420 --> 07:23:54.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: this is actually one of the engagement models that we have been doing since last year,

asr-007906
07:23:54.560 --> 07:24:01.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which is to give the civil society organizations the opportunity to pose questions to the agencies

asr-007907
07:24:01.080 --> 07:24:03.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: through the Committee on Appropriations.

asr-007908
07:24:04.460 --> 07:24:10.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Just to clarify din po, siguro, we've seen some feedback.

asr-007909
07:24:10.100 --> 07:24:13.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: With regard to this, the engagement model this year.

asr-007910
07:24:13.920 --> 07:24:16.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Siguro po, ang kaklaruhin ko lang po,

asr-007911
07:24:16.160 --> 07:24:20.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for the record, this is the first time that the Committee on Appropriations

asr-007912
07:24:20.080 --> 07:24:24.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: received questions emanating from the CSOs.

asr-007913
07:24:24.080 --> 07:24:27.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ngayong araw pa lang po, yung una na natanggap namin.

asr-007914
07:24:27.180 --> 07:24:30.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because siguro po, just to clarify,

asr-007915
07:24:30.600 --> 07:24:35.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: meron po kasing perception that it's the Committee on Appropriations

asr-007916
07:24:35.320 --> 07:24:38.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: who is handling all of the direct coordination

asr-007917
07:24:40.180 --> 07:24:41.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: with the civil society organizations.

asr-007918
07:24:42.640 --> 07:24:46.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But in fact po, it's actually the CPBRD within Congress

asr-007919
07:24:46.880 --> 07:24:51.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: who directly coordinates with the civil society organizations.

asr-007920
07:24:51.860 --> 07:24:57.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So ang nangyayari po, umaasa po kami sa CPBRD every morning

asr-007921
07:24:57.560 --> 07:25:02.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to give us a list of the civil society organizations present during that day,

asr-007922
07:25:02.720 --> 07:25:08.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as well as the list of questions emanating from the civil society organizations.

asr-007923
07:25:08.640 --> 07:25:08.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So

asr-007924
07:25:09.360 --> 07:25:15.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Gusto ko lang po siguro kaklaruhin for all our partner CSOs who are watching

asr-007925
07:25:15.240 --> 07:25:21.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and also everyone who would like to engage with us.

asr-007926
07:25:22.740 --> 07:25:26.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Nito pong mga nakarang araw, wala po kaming natatanggap na mga tanong

asr-007927
07:25:26.900 --> 07:25:29.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: galing po sa mga civil society organizations.

asr-007928
07:25:29.520 --> 07:25:34.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So that's something that we have to coordinate with CPBRD with moving forward.

asr-007929
07:25:35.760 --> 07:25:38.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sana po, araw-araw, mabigyan na po nila kami

asr-007930
07:25:38.560 --> 07:25:39.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng listahan

asr-007931
07:25:39.740 --> 07:25:44.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ng mga civil society organizations at yung mga katanungan po para sa araw na yun.

asr-007932
07:25:44.520 --> 07:25:48.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because on the part of the Comitee on Appropriations, we are really sincere

asr-007933
07:25:48.960 --> 07:25:54.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: when we were really adamant in upholding the engagement models

asr-007934
07:25:54.300 --> 07:25:55.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: with the civil society organizations.

asr-007935
07:25:55.980 --> 07:26:00.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So we would like to apologize to the civil society organizations

asr-007936
07:26:00.920 --> 07:26:07.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: who felt that they have been left out of the deliberations in the previous days

asr-007937
07:26:07.680 --> 07:26:09.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: when in fact po,

asr-007938
07:26:09.040 --> 07:26:14.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: talaga honest to goodness, utmost sincerity, we have not been receiving any of the questions

asr-007939
07:26:14.640 --> 07:26:16.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: from the CSOs.

asr-007940
07:26:16.180 --> 07:26:24.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But now that we've received this today, hopefully po in the next days, kukulitin po namin yung

asr-007941
07:26:24.180 --> 07:26:31.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: CPBRD to give us the questions because we really want to be your voice, we want to be

asr-007942
07:26:31.520 --> 07:26:34.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: your avenue in asking questions to our agencies.

asr-007943
07:26:34.900 --> 07:26:39.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, buwena mano po itong DILG.

asr-007944
07:26:39.040 --> 07:26:41.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: In terms of the questions.

asr-007945
07:26:41.400 --> 07:26:47.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, if I may po, on behalf of the civil society organizations, I would like to pose a few questions

asr-007946
07:26:47.880 --> 07:26:51.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to the DILG family.

asr-007947
07:26:51.520 --> 07:27:01.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: These questions po, emanate from Code NGO, and these are the questions po for DILG.

asr-007948
07:27:01.100 --> 07:27:04.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The first is the rationale for the Local Government Support Fund.

asr-007949
07:27:04.960 --> 07:27:11.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I believe this was actually discussed at length by Secretary Jonvic earlier today.

asr-007950
07:27:11.920 --> 07:27:20.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The Mandanas-Garcia ruling broadened the tax base used to compute the just share of local government units in national taxes,

asr-007951
07:27:20.800 --> 07:27:23.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: now released through the National Tax Allotment.

asr-007952
07:27:24.180 --> 07:27:27.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Considering the resulting increase in the NTA of LGUs,

asr-007953
07:27:27.760 --> 07:27:32.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What is the policy justification for retaining a separate local government support fund

asr-007954
07:27:32.580 --> 07:27:37.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: whose allocations are still determined and directly released by the national government

asr-007955
07:27:37.560 --> 07:27:39.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to beneficiary LGUs?

asr-007956
07:27:39.780 --> 07:27:45.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Follow-up question po, what specific programs, needs, or fiscal gaps funded through the LGSF

asr-007957
07:27:45.680 --> 07:27:52.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: cannot be adequately supported through the increased NTA and other regular revenues of LGUs?

asr-007958
07:27:52.520 --> 07:27:58.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: How does the government ensure that the LGSF supplements rather than duplicates or substitutes

asr-007959
07:27:58.540 --> 07:28:01.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for resources already available to LGUs?

asr-007960
07:28:01.540 --> 07:28:06.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So yun po yung katanungan. If we may pose that to DILG.

asr-007961
07:28:06.420 --> 07:28:06.920
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Usec. Mario?

asr-007962
07:28:06.580 --> 07:28:09.160
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Your Honor.

asr-007963
07:28:10.080 --> 07:28:19.060
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: For 2027, the estimated national tax allocation share of local government is like 1.32 to 1.4 trillion pesos.

asr-007964
07:28:19.400 --> 07:28:28.120
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But this amount is divided between and among the 82 provinces, 149 cities, 1,493 municipalities,

asr-007965
07:28:28.380 --> 07:28:30.320
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: and more than 42,000 barricades.

asr-007966
07:28:30.840 --> 07:28:34.500
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So on the surface, it looks like it's a very, very big amount.

asr-007967
07:28:34.500 --> 07:28:37.680
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But when divided between those local governments that I mentioned,

asr-007968
07:28:37.680 --> 07:28:45.140
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: a while ago, it will not really be enough to fund the priority projects of the local governments,

asr-007969
07:28:45.140 --> 07:28:50.440
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: considering that there are devolved functions that are given to LGUs.

asr-007970
07:28:50.440 --> 07:28:56.300
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So the local government support fund, which will be like 58 billion for 2027,

asr-007971
07:28:56.300 --> 07:29:03.360
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: will be an additional resource, additional fund, which the local governments can use

asr-007972
07:29:03.360 --> 07:29:07.700
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: in responding to the other felt needs.

asr-007973
07:29:07.700 --> 07:29:09.460
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of their constituents.

asr-007974
07:29:09.460 --> 07:29:20.720
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: These funds are earmarked for projects like water system, water sanitation system,

asr-007975
07:29:20.960 --> 07:29:29.400
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: farm-to-market roads, electrification, health centers,

asr-007976
07:29:29.640 --> 07:29:36.440
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: and for other basic services of the people in the different localities.

asr-007977
07:29:36.440 --> 07:29:42.460
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So I believe, Mr. Chair, Your Honor, that's the rationale why there's the local government support fund.

asr-007978
07:29:42.840 --> 07:29:58.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Just to clarify po, I believe this was something that Sec. Mulya raised earlier today, that for the record, DILG, what is the role that DILG plays in LGSF? Para lang po malinaw.

asr-007979
07:29:58.320 --> 07:30:03.000
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Yes, Your Honor, Mr. Chair. The local government support fund is directly released to the local governments.

asr-007980
07:30:03.720 --> 07:30:12.540
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: The DILG's task is to, per the General Appropriations Act, is to do the monitoring and evaluation in the implementation of these projects.

asr-007981
07:30:12.540 --> 07:30:29.680
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So for that purpose, as I mentioned a while ago, we have a fund allocated for the hiring of engineers and project evaluation officers, which we deploy to our provinces and regions to help us monitor, to ensure the faithful implementation of all those projects funded from the LGSF.

asr-007982
07:30:30.100 --> 07:30:33.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So in terms of validation po, vetting?

asr-007983
07:30:37.560 --> 07:30:44.560
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Yes, Your Honor, Mr. Chair. There's a portal created by DBM where LGUs can submit their project proposals.

asr-007984
07:30:45.200 --> 07:30:59.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So just to answer the last question of our CSO partner, hindi po DILG. Kasi po ang tanong, how do we ensure that these are not duplicate projects?

asr-007985
07:30:59.180 --> 07:31:02.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So the vetting, the validation, all that process is not...

asr-007986
07:31:02.960 --> 07:31:11.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's not handled by DILG, but rather DBM. So we can, perhaps, we can also post that as a question to the DBM.

asr-007987
07:31:11.560 --> 07:31:19.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: That's correct, Mr. Chair, Your Honor. It's the LGUs themselves which identify the priority projects that they will fund from the LGSF.

asr-007988
07:31:11.560 --> 07:31:11.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-007989
07:31:11.560 --> 07:31:12.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: through

asr-007990
07:31:19.680 --> 07:31:30.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you. Thank you, po, USEC. So we'll move to the next question. This is with regard to community participation, project validation, and oversight, also from Code NGO.

asr-007991
07:31:30.080 --> 07:31:32.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Could the DILG explain the complete process

asr-007992
07:31:30.540 --> 07:31:44.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for identifying, endorsing, validating, procuring, and monitoring projects funded under the LGSF, particularly the FALGU, to the Barangay Development Program?

asr-007993
07:31:44.600 --> 07:31:55.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: At what stages are local development councils, local sanggunians, accredited civil society organizations, sectoral representatives, and affected communities meaningfully involved?

asr-007994
07:31:55.460 --> 07:31:57.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What safeguards are... Sorry.

asr-007995
07:31:57.160 --> 07:31:59.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sorry, sorry.

asr-007996
07:31:57.160 --> 07:31:59.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What safeguards are in place?

asr-007997
07:32:02.820 --> 07:32:18.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: To ensure that projects respond to documented community needs, are aligned with local development plans, do not duplicate existing national government or LGU programs, and are protected from conflicts of interest and undue influence in procurement.

asr-007998
07:32:19.100 --> 07:32:20.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Last paragraph, po.

asr-007999
07:32:44.960 --> 07:32:57.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The 2027 National Expenditure Program also proposes P563.925 million for the DILG's monitoring and evaluation of LGSF projects, as mentioned by USEC.

asr-008002
07:32:44.960 --> 07:32:51.840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What measurable outputs, public disclosure requirements, and accountability mechanisms correspond to this allocation?

asr-008003
07:32:44.960 --> 07:32:52.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Will CSOs and community representatives be formally involved in independent project monitoring and validation?

asr-008004
07:32:48.520 --> 07:32:50.400
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Yes, thank you, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-008005
07:32:50.860 --> 07:32:58.040
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: As I mentioned a while ago, the identification of priority projects, the procurement for these projects now are less with local governments.

asr-008006
07:32:58.400 --> 07:33:02.860
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: What we are doing today is to just make sure that the projects are...

asr-008009
07:33:02.860 --> 07:33:05.580
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: are not cost projects and that they are properly implemented.

asr-008010
07:33:05.580 --> 07:33:12.120
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: To do that, we came up with a three-tiered monitoring of all these projects.

asr-008011
07:33:12.360 --> 07:33:19.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: The first-party monitoring is done by the local project monitoring committees.

asr-008012
07:33:19.830 --> 07:33:31.180
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: This is the mandated committee that should be in the local government unit.

asr-008013
07:33:31.180 --> 07:33:32.180
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And the local...

asr-008014
07:33:31.520 --> 07:33:37.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: project monitoring committee is composed of LGU functionaries and civil society organizations.

asr-008015
07:33:37.640 --> 07:33:41.960
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: The second tier is second-party monitoring.

asr-008016
07:33:42.100 --> 07:33:42.580
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: That is us.

asr-008017
07:33:42.800 --> 07:33:47.180
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And as I mentioned a while ago, and it was also mentioned by the good congressman a while ago,

asr-008018
07:33:47.240 --> 07:33:56.220
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: by the good chair, that there is an allocation of 563 million for the Mialgo monitoring and evaluation of LGU projects.

asr-008019
07:33:56.220 --> 07:34:01.980
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So the 560 million is used for salaries of the...

asr-008020
07:34:01.980 --> 07:34:06.900
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: engineers and the project evaluation officers that we hired to do the monitoring on the ground.

asr-008021
07:34:06.900 --> 07:34:14.420
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Because the field officers of the DLG really do not have the technical know-how to do the monitoring themselves.

asr-008022
07:34:14.420 --> 07:34:18.420
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And the third-party monitoring, the third tier is the third-party monitoring.

asr-008023
07:34:18.720 --> 07:34:24.060
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: In the past, we have engaged civil society organizations and non-government organizations

asr-008024
07:34:24.060 --> 07:34:28.400
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: to help us monitor the projects implemented by the local governments.

asr-008025
07:34:28.400 --> 07:34:29.640
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So those are the...

asr-008026
07:34:29.640 --> 07:34:35.260
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: the monitoring mechanisms that we have put in place.

asr-008027
07:34:35.340 --> 07:34:36.860
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But aside from that, Your Honor,

asr-008028
07:34:37.080 --> 07:34:38.840
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: we also have the Subay Bayan Portal,

asr-008029
07:34:38.840 --> 07:34:43.600
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: which is a platform where local government units are required

asr-008030
07:34:43.600 --> 07:34:49.160
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: to upload status updates of projects implemented through the...

asr-008031
07:34:49.160 --> 07:34:52.700
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: or funded by the local government support fund.

asr-008032
07:34:54.760 --> 07:35:01.860
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Yes, that's already the safeguards that we have put in place to ensure the integrity of...

asr-008033
07:35:01.860 --> 07:35:03.380
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: the implementation of all these projects.

asr-008034
07:35:04.600 --> 07:35:07.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Yusek. Thank you for clarifying.

asr-008035
07:35:08.220 --> 07:35:11.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Next is with regard to participatory budgeting.

asr-008036
07:35:11.760 --> 07:35:15.200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The next question also from Code NGO is,

asr-008037
07:35:15.200 --> 07:35:22.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the 2027 NEP retains 1 billion pesos for the support and assistance fund to participatory budgeting.

asr-008038
07:35:23.120 --> 07:35:29.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: While the overall LGSF increases from approximately 57.87 billion in 2026

asr-008039
07:35:29.680 --> 07:35:31.980
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to 58.53 billion...

asr-008040
07:35:31.980 --> 07:35:33.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in 2027.

asr-008041
07:35:33.500 --> 07:35:34.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: During the same period,

asr-008042
07:35:35.160 --> 07:35:42.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the proposed allocation for the SBDP increases from 8.08 billion to 9.74 billion.

asr-008043
07:35:42.000 --> 07:35:47.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What performance evidence and policy considerations inform these relative allocations?

asr-008044
07:35:47.560 --> 07:35:51.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Consistent with the government's commitments to open and participatory governance,

asr-008045
07:35:51.860 --> 07:35:56.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: what plans does DILG have to expand the coverage of participatory budgeting

asr-008046
07:35:56.720 --> 07:36:00.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and institutionalize meaningful CSO and community participation?

asr-008047
07:36:00.740 --> 07:36:01.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: From

asr-008048
07:36:01.780 --> 07:36:07.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Project Identification and Prioritization through Implementation, Monitoring, and Evaluation.

asr-008049
07:36:07.160 --> 07:36:09.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Participatory Budgeting, Usec.

asr-008050
07:36:09.260 --> 07:36:14.420
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Yes, Mr. Chair. Actually, the good chair mentioned two projects a while ago.

asr-008051
07:36:14.760 --> 07:36:21.740
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: That's the Support to Barangay Development Program and the Support and Assistance Fund to Participatory Budgeting.

asr-008052
07:36:21.840 --> 07:36:28.860
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: The SBDP is the program that was put in place by the National Task Force to End Local Communist Armed Conflict

asr-008053
07:36:28.860 --> 07:36:30.020
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: to help barangays.

asr-008054
07:36:30.240 --> 07:36:33.660
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: To help address the needs of people in barangays

asr-008055
07:36:33.660 --> 07:36:36.840
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: which were previously influenced by the communist terrorist groups.

asr-008056
07:36:36.840 --> 07:36:39.460
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Because for the longest time, these barangays have been neglected.

asr-008057
07:36:39.920 --> 07:36:43.980
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Basic services supposedly delivered by the national and local governments.

asr-008058
07:36:44.220 --> 07:36:50.000
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So the 10 million for 2026, for example, is used to fund priority projects

asr-008059
07:36:50.000 --> 07:36:53.480
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: identified through consultations at the grassroots level.

asr-008060
07:36:53.480 --> 07:36:58.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So that's the rationale of the SBDP or Support to Barangay Development Fund.

asr-008061
07:36:58.280 --> 07:37:00.560
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: To gain or to regain the trust of...

asr-008062
07:37:00.560 --> 07:37:05.800
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of people to government, we need to also address their basic needs.

asr-008063
07:37:06.680 --> 07:37:10.320
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: The other one is the Support and Assistance Fund to Participatory Budgeting.

asr-008064
07:37:10.340 --> 07:37:15.780
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: For 2026, Mr. Chair, Your Honor, there's an allocation of 1 billion pesos.

asr-008065
07:37:15.780 --> 07:37:24.400
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And the 1 billion is used to fund water systems project by identified LGUs.

asr-008066
07:37:24.540 --> 07:37:30.260
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Also, evacuation centers by the identified LGUs.

asr-008067
07:37:31.220 --> 07:37:35.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: The water system project amounts to 13.3 million.

asr-008068
07:37:35.100 --> 07:37:40.460
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And the evacuation centers amount to 25 point something million pesos.

asr-008069
07:37:40.460 --> 07:37:45.880
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So these are the municipalities which are considered waterless municipalities.

asr-008070
07:37:46.280 --> 07:37:52.300
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Meaning 50% of their population do not have access to potable water.

asr-008071
07:37:52.420 --> 07:37:57.140
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So these are already pre-identified municipalities for the water system project.

asr-008072
07:37:57.460 --> 07:38:00.880
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: For the evacuation centers, these are also the pre-identified.

asr-008073
07:38:00.880 --> 07:38:04.300
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And these municipalities which do not have evacuation centers.

asr-008074
07:38:04.680 --> 07:38:05.920
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

asr-008075
07:38:06.640 --> 07:38:08.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Yusek.

asr-008076
07:38:09.160 --> 07:38:11.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll move to the fourth question still from Code NGO.

asr-008077
07:38:12.060 --> 07:38:14.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Human Rights Safeguards and Grievance Mechanisms.

asr-008078
07:38:14.980 --> 07:38:19.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: United Nations Special Reporters and the Commission on Human Rights

asr-008079
07:38:19.160 --> 07:38:22.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: have raised serious concerns regarding red tagging

asr-008080
07:38:22.020 --> 07:38:26.140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and its effects on the freedoms of expression, association, and participation.

asr-008081
07:38:26.140 --> 07:38:30.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The CHR's National Inquiry found that red tagging creates a chilling effect,

asr-008082
07:38:30.960 --> 07:38:32.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: on democratic participation

asr-008083
07:38:32.340 --> 07:38:34.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and may serve as a precursor

asr-008084
07:38:34.820 --> 07:38:36.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to grave human rights violations.

asr-008085
07:38:36.860 --> 07:38:38.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The CIVICUS monitor likewise

asr-008086
07:38:38.940 --> 07:38:40.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: currently rates civic space

asr-008087
07:38:40.580 --> 07:38:42.580
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the Philippines as repressed

asr-008088
07:38:42.580 --> 07:38:44.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and identifies continuing red-tagging

asr-008089
07:38:44.680 --> 07:38:45.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as one of its concerns.

asr-008090
07:38:45.920 --> 07:38:47.960
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Within the DILG's mandate,

asr-008091
07:38:48.280 --> 07:38:50.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: what concrete safeguards are in place

asr-008092
07:38:50.260 --> 07:38:51.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to ensure that the implementation

asr-008093
07:38:51.420 --> 07:38:54.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of LGSF and SBDP projects

asr-008094
07:38:54.420 --> 07:38:56.500
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: does not expose CSOs,

asr-008095
07:38:56.700 --> 07:38:57.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: human rights defenders,

asr-008096
07:38:58.320 --> 07:38:59.040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: indigenous peoples,

asr-008097
07:38:59.320 --> 07:39:00.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: community leaders,

asr-008098
07:39:00.340 --> 07:39:01.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and other stakeholders

asr-008099
07:39:01.380 --> 07:39:02.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to labeling, profiling,

asr-008100
07:39:03.060 --> 07:39:04.340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: retaliation, or exclusion?

asr-008101
07:39:04.740 --> 07:39:06.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What independent and accessible

asr-008102
07:39:06.400 --> 07:39:08.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: grievance and accountability mechanisms

asr-008103
07:39:08.280 --> 07:39:10.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are available to individuals

asr-008104
07:39:10.160 --> 07:39:11.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and organizations?

asr-008105
07:39:11.060 --> 07:39:13.560
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Will the department publicly report

asr-008106
07:39:13.560 --> 07:39:15.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the number and nature of complaints received,

asr-008107
07:39:15.940 --> 07:39:17.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the agencies or officials involved,

asr-008108
07:39:17.940 --> 07:39:19.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and the corresponding actions taken?

asr-008109
07:39:23.260 --> 07:39:25.100
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: Mr. Chair, Your Honor,

asr-008110
07:39:25.100 --> 07:39:27.500
DILG Secretary Juanito Victor C. Remulla: may I request the PNP to respond to that, please?

asr-008111
07:39:29.180 --> 07:39:30.140
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: Madam Chair,

asr-008112
07:39:30.140 --> 07:39:31.680
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: National Police Commission,

asr-008113
07:39:32.660 --> 07:39:34.980
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: The NAPLCOM recently released

asr-008114
07:39:34.980 --> 07:39:37.280
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: a manual for media relations

asr-008115
07:39:37.280 --> 07:39:40.820
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: which includes prohibition on red-tagging.

asr-008116
07:39:41.480 --> 07:39:42.700
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: In that manual,

asr-008117
07:39:42.860 --> 07:39:45.640
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: it is clearly stated that red-tagging is prohibited

asr-008118
07:39:45.640 --> 07:39:49.380
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: and there are sanctions attributed to it.

asr-008119
07:39:49.740 --> 07:39:51.660
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: And if anyone is listening,

asr-008120
07:39:51.840 --> 07:39:53.120
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: be it an ordinary citizen

asr-008121
07:39:53.120 --> 07:39:55.120
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: or a member of the media

asr-008122
07:39:55.120 --> 07:39:57.340
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: who might be a victim of red-tagging,

asr-008123
07:39:57.920 --> 07:40:00.200
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: the doors of the National Police Commission

asr-008124
07:40:00.200 --> 07:40:03.960
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: are always welcome to accept any concern or complaint

asr-008125
07:40:03.960 --> 07:40:04.620
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: and to report it.

asr-008126
07:40:04.840 --> 07:40:06.420
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: And definitely, we will act on them.

asr-008127
07:40:08.900 --> 07:40:09.700
NAPOLCOM Vice Chairperson and Executive Officer Atty. Rafael Vicente R. Calinisan: Thank you.

asr-008128
07:40:09.700 --> 07:40:10.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, po.

asr-008130
07:40:32.120 --> 07:40:32.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much.

asr-008131
07:40:32.660 --> 07:40:35.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, I hope that clarifies the question.

asr-008132
07:40:35.440 --> 07:40:38.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Next is the fifth question,

asr-008133
07:40:39.080 --> 07:40:40.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: also from Code NGO,

asr-008134
07:40:41.040 --> 07:40:43.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which is the basis for the proposed increase

asr-008135
07:40:43.080 --> 07:40:44.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the SBDP budget.

asr-008136
07:40:45.120 --> 07:40:46.100
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, same program, po.

asr-008137
07:40:46.320 --> 07:40:50.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The 2027 NAP proposes 9.74 billion for the SBDP,

asr-008138
07:40:51.160 --> 07:40:54.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: an increase from the 8.8 billion appropriated

asr-008139
07:40:54.280 --> 07:40:54.940
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the 2026

asr-008140
07:40:55.380 --> 07:40:56.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: General Appropriations Act.

asr-008141
07:40:57.000 --> 07:40:58.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What verified needs assessment,

asr-008142
07:40:59.100 --> 07:41:00.640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: utilization and completion data,

asr-008143
07:41:00.640 --> 07:41:02.820
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and independent outcome evaluation

asr-008144
07:41:02.820 --> 07:41:04.660
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: support this proposed increase?

asr-008145
07:41:05.440 --> 07:41:07.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Could the department please provide

asr-008146
07:41:07.000 --> 07:41:08.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the following information?

asr-008147
07:41:08.560 --> 07:41:11.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: First, the objective criteria for selecting

asr-008148
07:41:11.020 --> 07:41:12.680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: beneficiary barangays and projects.

asr-008149
07:41:13.080 --> 07:41:15.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Second, the proposed allocation per barangay

asr-008150
07:41:15.420 --> 07:41:16.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and per project.

asr-008151
07:41:16.420 --> 07:41:19.220
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Third, the physical and financial accomplishment rates

asr-008152
07:41:19.220 --> 07:41:21.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of project funded in prior years.

asr-008153
07:41:21.780 --> 07:41:24.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Fourth, any unresolved audit findings

asr-008154
07:41:24.860 --> 07:41:26.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or implementation delays or complaints.

asr-008155
07:41:27.200 --> 07:41:30.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Fifth, evidence that completed projects

asr-008156
07:41:30.320 --> 07:41:33.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: have resulted in measurable improvements

asr-008157
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:35.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in basic services, community welfare,

asr-008158
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:35.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and sustainable peace and development.

asr-008159
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:36.160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Will the DILG publish project-level financial

asr-008160
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:37.260
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and accomplishment data in an accessible open data format

asr-008161
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:36.120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and enable independent validation by CSOs

asr-008162
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:34.740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in affected communities?

asr-008163
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:33.860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yun pa.

asr-008164
07:41:33.360 --> 07:41:34.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: That would be the last question.

asr-008165
07:41:50.340 --> 07:41:52.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-008166
07:41:52.220 --> 07:41:54.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: On the surface, Your Honor,

asr-008167
07:41:54.280 --> 07:41:57.680
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: it appears that the allocation for SBDP increased

asr-008168
07:41:57.680 --> 07:41:59.020
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: for 2027.

asr-008169
07:41:59.360 --> 07:42:02.600
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But actually, the allocation per barangay decreased.

asr-008170
07:42:03.360 --> 07:42:05.760
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Because in 2028, the number of barangays covered

asr-008171
07:42:05.760 --> 07:42:06.680
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: is 808.

asr-008172
07:42:06.800 --> 07:42:10.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But for 2027, the number of covered barangays

asr-008173
07:42:10.100 --> 07:42:11.260
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: is 1,904.

asr-008174
07:42:11.760 --> 07:42:15.220
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So actually, we are asking 19 point something billion pesos

asr-008175
07:42:15.220 --> 07:42:18.800
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: so that each barangay will have 10 million allocation,

asr-008176
07:42:19.400 --> 07:42:20.880
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: just like in 2026.

asr-008177
07:42:21.140 --> 07:42:24.620
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: But unfortunately, the allocation was reduced to 5 million.

asr-008178
07:42:24.860 --> 07:42:27.960
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: So it really did not increase.

asr-008179
07:42:28.040 --> 07:42:29.540
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Actually, it decreased, Your Honor.

asr-008180
07:42:29.740 --> 07:42:33.060
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: And as to the mechanisms that we have put in place

asr-008181
07:42:33.360 --> 07:42:35.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: in order to ensure the faithful implementation

asr-008182
07:42:35.100 --> 07:42:36.080
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: of all these projects,

asr-008183
07:42:36.340 --> 07:42:37.800
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: I already mentioned a while ago,

asr-008184
07:42:37.940 --> 07:42:40.760
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: the process of monitoring and evaluation

asr-008185
07:42:40.760 --> 07:42:42.480
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: and the platform

asr-008186
07:42:42.480 --> 07:42:45.100
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: and the engagement with civil society

asr-008187
07:42:45.100 --> 07:42:46.360
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: and non-government organizations.

asr-008188
07:42:46.360 --> 07:42:47.340
DILG Undersecretary for Local Government Marlo L. Iringan: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-008189
07:42:48.480 --> 07:42:49.620
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Usec.

